window.QUESTION_BANK = {"meta":{"title":"AI-103 中文 AI 解析题库","version":"2026.08.21","questionCount":117,"source":"AI-103_aizh_无水印.docx"},"cases":[{"id":"contoso-case","title":"Contoso AI Engineering Case Study","titleZh":"Contoso AI 工程案例","descriptionEn":"Overview\n-\nCompany Information\n-\nContoso, Ltd is a multinational retail company that builds, deploys, and manages generative AI and agent-based solutions by using Microsoft\nFoundry.\nExisting Environment\n-\nIdentity Environment\n-\nContoso uses Microsoft Entra ID for identity management, authentication, and authorization capabilities that enable agents to access\norganizational resources and services.\nContoso recently formed a new AI engineering team named Agent1Dev Team to optimize and maintain existing AI solutions.\nThe team collaborates with solution architects, DevOps engineers, and security engineers to design, implement. monitor, and secure AI\napplications.\nContoso also has a team named Agent1Test Team that is responsible for validating AI solutions before the solution deployments.\nGenerative Environment\n-\nContoso has a Microsoft Foundry deployment that contains two projects named Project1 and Project2.\nProject1\n-\nProject1 contains a customer support agent named Agent1 that assists customers with product inquiries and troubleshooting requests.\nAgent1 has the following configurations:\n• Agent1 uses a base model deployment.\n• A safety evaluation pipeline is NOT enabled.\n• Tool invocation approval workflows are NOT enabled.\n• Conversation memory constraints are NOT configured.\nAgent1 interacts with customers by using digital support channels and answers general questions about Contoso products.\nProject1 is deployed to an Azure region located in the European Union (EU).\nAgent1Dev Team will use Project1 to optimize and maintain Agent1.\nProject2\n-\nProject2 contains a deployed video generation model. The marketing department at Contoso has access to Project2 and plans to use the model to\ndevelop a video creation solution.\nDevelopment of the solution is incomplete.\nData Environment\n-\nContoso stores product-related information in Azure resources that support AI applications.\nThe Azure environment contains an Azure Blob Storage account named storage1 that stores product detail sheets for all the Contoso products.\nThe product sheets include specifications, feature descriptions, and product support information that Agent1 can use to answer customer\nquestions. The product sheets are stored in the PDF format.\nProblem Statements\n-\nContoso identifies the following issues:\n• Agent1 has only general knowledge of the Contoso products.\n• A recent chat interaction with Agent1 was analyzed for sentiment. The results of the analysis have NOT been processed yet.\n• Agent1 does NOT use the detailed product information in the product sheets stored in storage1 when responding to customer questions.\n• The finance department at Contoso reports that vendor invoices must be reviewed manually to ensure that the invoices match the terms defined\nin the vendor contracts. The invoices contain tables, logos, and varied layouts that make the documents difficult to process consistently.\nRequirements\n-\nPlanned Changes\n-\nContoso plans to implement the following changes:\n• Implement a solution for Project1 that analyzes the vendor invoices by evaluating both the visual layout and the textual content of the invoices,\nso that the invoice details can be verified against the vendor contract terms.\n• Update the base model deployment used by Agent1 and standardize the model version to ensure continuity and consistent responses.\n• Enable Agent1 to retrieve and use the detailed product information from the product sheets stored in storage1.\n• Implement an indexing solution for the product sheets that Agent1 can use to answer customer questions.\n• Complete the development of the video creation solution.\nTechnical Requirements\n-\nContoso identifies the following technical requirements:\n• The model deployment used by Agent1 must support scalable, high-throughput generative AI workloads and dynamically scale to handle variable\ncustomer support traffic, without requiring reserved throughput capacity.\n• The product sheets must be processed by using an indexing pipeline that enables semantic and vector search, so that Agent1 can retrieve the\nrelevant product information.\n• Responses generated by using the product sheet information must be relevant, complete, and accurate.\n• Agent1 must be able to use the product sheets to answer natural language questions about product details.\n• The model version used by Agent1 must remain consistent to ensure stable responses.\n• The data processed by the model must remain within the EU.\nSecurity and Compliance Requirements\nContoso identifies the following security and compliance requirements:\n• API keys must NOT be used to access Foundry-deployed models.\n• Access to the Azure resources must follow the principle of least privilege.\n• The developers at Contoso must authenticate to Microsoft Foundry resources by using Microsoft Entra authentication.\n• Access to Project1 must be assigned to the members of Agent1Dev Team by using a security group named SC_Agent1_Dev.\n• Access to Project1 must be assigned to the members of Agent1Test Team by using a security group named SC_Agent1_Test.\n• Agent1 must never reveal customer information, even if a document that contains customer data is added erroneously to the product sheet\nrepository in storage1.\n• The product sheets might contain images that include embedded text. Agent1 must be protected from malicious instructions potentially hidden\nwithin the images.\nBusiness Requirements\n-\nContoso identifies the following business requirements:\n• Users that interact with Agent1 must have a personalized experience in future interactions, including the ability for Agent1 to retain conversation\ncontext and recall relevant information from previous interactions.\n• Agent1 must answer questions only about the products sold by Contoso.","descriptionZh":"概述\n-\n公司信息\n-\nContoso, Ltd 是一家跨国零售公司,通过使用 Microsoft Foundry 构建、部署和管理生成式 AI 和基于代理的解决方案。\n现有环境\n-\n身份环境\n-\nContoso 使用 Microsoft Entra ID 进行身份管理、身份验证和授权功能,使代理能够访问组织资源和服务。\nContoso 最近成立了一个新的 AI 工程团队,名为 Agent1Dev Team,负责优化和维护现有的 AI 解决方案。\n该团队与解决方案架构师、DevOps 工程师和安全工程师合作,设计、实施、监控和保护 AI 应用程序。\nContoso 还拥有一个名为 Agent1Test Team 的团队,负责在解决方案部署之前验证 AI 解决方案。\n生成环境\n-\nContoso 拥有一个 Microsoft Foundry 部署,其中包含两个项目,分别名为 Project1 和 Project2。\nProject1\n-\nProject1 包含一个名为 Agent1 的客戶支持代理,帮助客戶处理产品咨询和故障排除请求。\nAgent1 具有以下配置:\n• Agent1 使用基础模型部署。\n• 未启用安全评估管道。\n• 未启用工具调用审批工作流。\n• 未配置会话记忆约束。\nAgent1 通过数字支持渠道与客戶互动,并回答有关 Contoso 产品的一般问题。\nProject1 部署在位于欧盟 (EU) 的一个 Azure 区域。\nAgent1Dev Team 将使用 Project1 来优化和维护 Agent1。\nProject2\n-\nProject2 包含一个已部署的视频生成模型。Contoso 的市场营销部⻔可以访问 Project2,并计划使用该模型开发一个视频创建解决方\n案。\n该解决方案的开发尚未完成。\n数据环境\n-\nContoso 在支持 AI 应用程序的 Azure 资源中存储与产品相关的信息。\nAzure 环境包含一个名为 storage1 的 Azure Blob 存储帐戶,用于存储所有 Contoso 产品的产品详细信息表。\n产品表包括规格、功能描述和产品支持信息,Agent1 可以使用这些信息回答客戶问题。产品表以 PDF 格式存储。\n问题陈述\n-\nContoso 确定了以下问题:\n• Agent1 仅对 Contoso 产品有一般了解。\n• 最近对 Agent1 的一次聊天互动进行了情感分析。分析结果尚未处理。\n• Agent1 在回答客戶问题时未使用存储在 storage1 中的产品表中的详细产品信息。\n• Contoso 的财务部⻔报告称,供应商发票必须手动审核,以确保发票与供应商合同中定义的条款相符。发票包含表格、徽标和多种\n布局,使得文档难以一致地处理。\n需求\n-\n计划变更\n-\nContoso 计划实施以下变更:\n• 为 Project1 实现一个解决方案,通过评估发票的视觉布局和文本内容来分析供应商发票,以便验证发票详细信息是否符合供应商合\n同条款。\n• 更新 Agent1 使用的基础模型部署,并标准化模型版本,以确保连续性和一致的响应。\n• 使 Agent1 能够从存储在 storage1 中的产品表中检索并使用详细的产品信息。\n• 为产品表实现一个索引解决方案,使 Agent1 能够回答客戶问题。\n• 完成视频创建解决方案的开发。\n技术需求\n-\nContoso 确定了以下技术需求:\n• Agent1 使用的模型部署必须支持可扩展的高吞吐量生成式 AI 工作负载,并能够动态扩展以处理可变的客戶支持流量,而无需预留\n吞吐量容量。\n• 产品表必须通过一个索引管道进行处理,该管道支持语义和向量搜索,以便 Agent1 能够检索相关的产品信息。\n• 使用产品表信息生成的响应必须相关、完整且准确。\n• Agent1 必须能够使用产品表回答有关产品详细信息的自然语言问题。\n• Agent1 使用的模型版本必须保持一致,以确保稳定的响应。\n• 模型处理的数据必须保留在欧盟境内。\n安全和合规性需求\nContoso 确定了以下安全和合规性需求:\n• 不得使用 API 密钥访问 Foundry 部署的模型。\n• 对 Azure 资源的访问必须遵循最小权限原则。\n• Contoso 的开发人员必须使用 Microsoft Entra 身份验证来访问 Microsoft Foundry 资源。\n• 必须通过使用名为 SC_Agent1_Dev 的安全组,将 Project1 的访问权限分配给 Agent1Dev Team 的成员。\n• 必须通过使用名为 SC_Agent1_Test 的安全组,将 Project1 的访问权限分配给 Agent1Test Team 的成员。\n• Agent1 绝不能泄露客戶信息,即使包含客戶数据的文档被错误地添加到 storage1 中的产品表存储库中。\n• 产品表可能包含嵌入文本的图像。必须保护 Agent1 免受可能隐藏在图像中的恶意指令的影响。\n业务需求\n-\nContoso 确定了以下业务需求:\n• 与 Agent1 互动的用戶在未来的互动中必须拥有个性化体验,包括 Agent1 能够保留会话上下文并回忆起先前互动中的相关信息。\n• Agent1 必须仅回答有关 Contoso 销售的产品的问题。","questionIds":["q-1","q-2","q-27","q-28","q-56","q-61","q-62","q-66","q-67","q-68"],"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-002.jpg","assets/pages/page-003.jpg","assets/pages/page-004.jpg","assets/pages/page-005.jpg"]}],"questions":[{"id":"q-1","number":1,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"grouped","questionEn":"You need to configure the model deployment for Agent1 to meet the technical requirements.\nWhat should you configure? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"您需要配置 Agent1 的模型部署以满足技术需求。\n您应该配置什么?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["deployment:Standard","policy:Opt out of automatic model version upgrades"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n如何配置模型部署以满足技术要求,包括动态扩展能力和版本一致性。\n理解不同部署类型(Standard、Global Standard、Global Provisioned)的特点和适用场景。\n如何选择版本更新策略以确保模型版本的稳定性。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\n部署类型选项分析:\nStandard: 支持动态扩展,适合高吞吐量的生成式AI工作负载。符合题目要求的“动态扩展能力”和“无需预留吞吐量”。\nGlobal Standard: 提供全球范围的部署,但题目明确要求数据必须留在欧盟地区,因此不符合要求。\nGlobal Provisioned: 需要预留吞吐量,不符合题目要求的“无需预留吞吐量”。\n版本更新策略选项分析:\nOnce the current version expires: 只有当前版本过期后才会更新,可能导致版本不一致,无法满足题目要求的“版本一致性”。\nOpt out of automatic model version upgrades: 禁用自动版本升级,确保版本一致性,符合题目要求的“版本稳定性”。\nUpgrade once a new default version becomes available: 自动升级到新版本,可能导致版本不一致,无法满足题目要求的“版本一致性”。\n3. 我的答案\n部署类型: Standard\n版本更新策略: Opt out of automatic model version upgrades\n4. 官方答案\n部署类型: Standard\n版本更新策略: Opt out of automatic model version upgrades\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:官方答案正确地选择了支持动态扩展的部署类型(Standard)和确保版本一致性的更新策略(Opt out of automatic model\nversion upgrades)。这些选择完全符合题目中的技术要求。","pageStart":2,"pageEnd":6,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-002.jpg","assets/pages/page-003.jpg","assets/pages/page-004.jpg","assets/pages/page-005.jpg","assets/pages/page-006.jpg"],"visualGroups":[{"id":"deployment","labelEn":"Deployment type","labelZh":"部署类型","options":["Standard","Global Standard","Global Provisioned"]},{"id":"policy","labelEn":"Version update policy","labelZh":"版本更新策略","options":["Once the current version expires","Opt out of automatic model version upgrades","Upgrade once a new default version becomes available"]}]},{"id":"q-2","number":2,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"single","questionEn":"You need to configure Agent1 to meet the security and compliance requirements.\nWhat should you use?","questionZh":"您需要配置 Agent1 以满足安全和合规要求。\n您应该使用什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"self-harm content filtering","zh":"自残内容过滤"},{"id":"B","en":"prompt shields","zh":"提示屏蔽"},{"id":"C","en":"Personally identifiable information (PII) Detection","zh":"个人身份信息 (PII) 检测 Most Voted"},{"id":"D","en":"violence content filtering","zh":"暴力内容过滤"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"官方答案：C\n答案核验\nPDF 第 7-11 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 C。\n对应选项：C. 个人身份信息 (PII) 检测 Most Voted\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。\n\n英文版交叉核验\n英文版交叉核验：Correct Answer 为 C；社区投票 B/C 各 50%。微软 Prompt Shields 文档说明它用于检测用户提示和第三方文档中的隐藏指令，而 PII Detection 对应“不得泄露客户信息”。本题题干同时包含两类要求，官方 C 只覆盖 PII 要求；按官方答案保留 C，并注明 B 是另一项安全控制。","pageStart":7,"pageEnd":11,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-007.jpg","assets/pages/page-008.jpg","assets/pages/page-009.jpg","assets/pages/page-010.jpg","assets/pages/page-011.jpg"]},{"id":"q-3","number":3,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are planning a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1 that will contain multiple agents. Each agent will access the same Azure AI Search\nresource.\nYou need to recommend a solution to centrally manage the Azure AI Search credentials within Project1. The solution must be implemented across\nall the agents.\nWhat should you recommend?","questionZh":"您正在计划一个名为 Project1 的 Microsoft Foundry 项目,该项目将包含多个代理。每个代理都将访问同一个 Azure AI Search 资源。\n您需要推荐一个解决方案,以在 Project1 中集中管理 Azure AI Search 凭据。该解决方案必须在所有代理中实施。\n您应该推荐什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Enable role-based access control (RBAC) for the Azure AI Search resource.","zh":"为 Azure AI Search 资源启用基于⻆色的访问控制 (RBAC)。"},{"id":"B","en":"Disable key-based access control on the Azure AI Search resource.","zh":"禁用 Azure AI Search 资源上的基于密钥的访问控制。"},{"id":"C","en":"Add a connection to the Azure AI Search resource.","zh":"添加一个连接到 Azure AI Search 资源。"},{"id":"D","en":"Create a managed private endpoint that connects to the Azure AI Search resource.","zh":"创建一个连接到 Azure AI Search 资源的托管私有终端。"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"正确答案:C\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在多个代理(agents)中集中管理 Azure AI Search 的凭据。\n涉及 Azure 资源的访问控制和连接管理的知识点。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Enable role-based access control (RBAC) for the Azure AI Search resource.\nRBAC 是一种权限管理机制,可以为用戶或服务分配特定的⻆色权限。\n虽然 RBAC 可以控制对资源的访问,但它并不能直接解决集中管理凭据的问题。\n因此,此选项不符合题目要求。\nB. Disable key-based access control on the Azure AI Search resource.\n禁用基于密钥的访问控制可能会提高安全性,但这并不能解决集中管理凭据的问题。\n此选项与题目要求无关,因此不正确。\nC. Add a connection to the Azure AI Search resource.\n添加连接是一个有效的解决方案,可以通过 Azure 的连接机制集中管理凭据。\n此选项符合题目要求,因为它可以在多个代理中实现统一的凭据管理。\n此选项是正确的。\nD. Create a managed private endpoint that connects to the Azure AI Search resource.\n托管私有终端用于在虚拟网络中安全地访问 Azure 资源。\n虽然它可以提高安全性,但它并不能直接解决集中管理凭据的问题。\n此选项不符合题目要求,因此不正确。\n3. 我的答案\n我的答案是:C\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:C\n5. 答案比较与原因分析\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:添加连接到 Azure AI Search 资源是集中管理凭据的最佳解决方案,符合题目要求。","pageStart":12,"pageEnd":13,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-012.jpg","assets/pages/page-013.jpg"]},{"id":"q-4","number":4,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYour company is piloting a customer support agent in a Microsoft Foundry project name Project1. Project1 is connected to an existing Application\nInsights resource, and the company’s support team reviews runs in the Traces tab.\nThe Foundry Agent Service is configured to perform the following actions:\nRetrieve the Application Insights connection string by calling project_client.telemetry.get_application_insights_connection_string().\nCall configure_azure_monitor(connection_string=...) to enable telemetry.\nA separate LangChain service is configured to use OpenTelemetry and has the following configurations:\nUses AzureAIOpenTelemetryTracer(connection_string=..., enable_content_recording=False)\nPasses the tracer by using config={“callbacks”:[azure_tracer]}\nCompany policy has the following requirements:\nTelemetry from LangChain and OpenTelemetry must be distinguishable within the same Application Insights resource.\nSecrets and credentials must NOT be stored in prompts, tool arguments, or span attributes.\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您的公司正在微软 Foundry 项目中试点一个客戶支持代理,项目名称为 Project1。Project1 已连接到现有的 Application Insights 资源,\n公司支持团队在 Traces 选项卡中审查运行情况。\nFoundry Agent 服务配置为执行以下操作:\n通过调用 project_client.telemetry.get_application_insights_connection_string() 检索 Application Insights 连接字符串。\n调用 configure_azure_monitor(connection_string=...) 以启用遥测。\n一个单独的 LangChain 服务配置为使用 OpenTelemetry,并具有以下配置:\n使用 AzureAIOpenTelemetryTracer(connection_string=..., enable_content_recording=False)\n通过使用 config={“callbacks”:[azure_tracer]} 传递 tracer。\n公司政策有以下要求:\nLangChain 和 OpenTelemetry 的遥测数据必须在同一个 Application Insights 资源中可区分。\n秘密和凭据不得存储在提示、工具参数或 span 属性中。\n对于以下每个陈述,如果陈述为真,请选择“是”。否则,请选择“否”。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["statements:No","telemetry:Yes","recording:No"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n考察的知识点\n如何配置和使用 Application Insights 与 OpenTelemetry。\n区分不同服务的遥测数据。\n数据隐私与安全性配置(如禁用内容记录)。\n逐个分析选项\nThe LangChain service will appear in Traces without configuring a tracer:\n分析:LangChain服务需要明确配置一个OpenTelemetry tracer(如AzureAIOpenTelemetryTracer)才能将遥测数据发送到Application\nInsights。如果没有配置tracer,服务的遥测数据不会自动出现在Traces中。\n结论:此选项为 No。\nSetting different OTEL_SERVICE_NAME values separates the services in Application Insights:\n分析:OpenTelemetry允许通过设置不同的OTEL_SERVICE_NAME值来区分不同服务的遥测数据。这是区分服务的推荐方法。\n结论:此选项为 Yes。\nWhen using enable_content_recording=False, prompts and tool data will be captured in the telemetry:\n分析:设置enable_content_recording=False会禁用内容记录,因此不会捕获提示(prompts)和工具数据到遥测中。这符合公司政策要\n求。\n结论:此选项为 No。\n我的答案\nThe LangChain service will appear in Traces without configuring a tracer: No\nSetting different OTEL_SERVICE_NAME values separates the services in Application Insights: Yes\nWhen using enable_content_recording=False, prompts and tool data will be captured in the telemetry: No\n官方答案\nThe LangChain service will appear in Traces without configuring a tracer: No\nSetting different OTEL_SERVICE_NAME values separates the services in Application Insights: Yes\nWhen using enable_content_recording=False, prompts and tool data will be captured in the telemetry: No\n比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n原因:官方答案正确地反映了题目中涉及的技术配置和公司政策要求。\n\n结构化答题核验\n根据原题图 Correct Answer 区域的圈选结果：第 1 项 No；第 2 项 Yes；第 3 项 No。程序按这三个选择自动判分。","pageStart":14,"pageEnd":15,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-014.jpg","assets/pages/page-015.jpg"],"visualGroups":[{"id":"statements","labelEn":"The LangChain service will appear in Traces without configuring a tracer.","labelZh":"未配置 tracer 时，LangChain 服务会出现在 Traces 中。","options":["Yes","No"]},{"id":"telemetry","labelEn":"Setting different OTEL_SERVICE_NAME values separates the services in Application Insights.","labelZh":"设置不同的 OTEL_SERVICE_NAME 值可以在 Application Insights 中区分服务。","options":["Yes","No"]},{"id":"recording","labelEn":"When using enable_content_recording=False, prompts and tool data will be captured in the telemetry.","labelZh":"使用 enable_content_recording=False 时，提示词和工具数据会被记录到遥测中。","options":["Yes","No"]}]},{"id":"q-5","number":5,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that processes procurement documents submitted by suppliers.\nYou need to implement two pipelines by using Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools. The solution must meet the following requirements:\nInclude a pipeline named Pipeline1 that supports cost-effective, high-volume processing of standalone PDF invoices.\nInclude a pipeline named Pipeline2 that supports cross-document validation by using multi-step reasoning and reference data.\nHow should you configure each pipeline? To answer, drag the appropriate configurations to the correct pipelines. Each configuration may be used\nonce, more than once, of not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"拖放 -\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,用于处理供应商提交的采购文件。\n您需要使用 Foundry Tools 中的 Azure 内容理解实现两个管道。解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n包括一个名为 Pipeline1 的管道,该管道支持成本效益高的大批量处理独立的 PDF 发票。\n包括一个名为 Pipeline2 的管道,该管道通过使用多步骤推理和参考数据支持跨文档验证。\n您应该如何配置每个管道?要回答,请将适当的配置拖到正确的管道中。每个配置可以使用一次、多次或完全不使用。您可能需要\n拖动窗格之间的分隔条或滚动查看内容。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Single-file task in standard mode","item2:Multi-file task in pro mode"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Content Understanding的任务模式选择,包括单文件任务和多文件任务。\n标准模式与专业模式的区别及适用场景。\n如何根据需求选择合适的配置以优化成本和性能。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nMulti-file task in pro mode: 适用于需要跨文件验证、多步骤推理以及引用数据的复杂场景。专业模式提供更高的处理能力,但成本较\n高。\nMulti-file task in standard mode: 适用于跨文件验证的场景,但处理能力有限,适合对成本敏感的场景。\nSingle-file task in pro mode: 适用于单文件处理的高性能场景,成本较高,适合需要快速处理大量单文件的场景。\nSingle-file task in standard mode: 适用于单文件处理的低成本场景,适合高量但对性能要求不高的场景。\n3. 逐个分析选项\nPipeline1: Configuration\nSingle-file task in standard mode: 符合题目要求的“成本效益高”和“高量处理”需求。标准模式足以处理单文件PDF发票,且成本较低。\nSingle-file task in pro mode: 虽然性能更高,但成本较高,不符合题目对成本效益的要求。\nMulti-file task in standard mode: 不适用于单文件处理场景,错误选择。\nMulti-file task in pro mode: 不适用于单文件处理场景,错误选择。\nPipeline2: Configuration\nMulti-file task in pro mode: 符合题目要求的“跨文件验证”和“多步骤推理”需求。专业模式提供更高的处理能力,适合复杂场景。\nMulti-file task in standard mode: 虽然支持跨文件验证,但处理能力有限,不适合复杂场景,错误选择。\nSingle-file task in pro mode: 不支持跨文件验证,错误选择。\nSingle-file task in standard mode: 不支持跨文件验证,错误选择。\n4. 我选的答案\nPipeline1: Single-file task in standard mode\nPipeline2: Multi-file task in pro mode\n5. 官方答案\nPipeline1: Single-file task in standard mode\nPipeline2: Multi-file task in pro mode\n6. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:官方答案正确地选择了适合每个场景的配置,符合题目要求。","pageStart":16,"pageEnd":17,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-016.jpg","assets/pages/page-017.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Pipeline1","answer":"Single-file task in standard mode","choices":["Multi-file task in pro mode","Multi-file task in standard mode","Single-file task in pro mode","Single-file task in standard mode"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Pipeline2","answer":"Multi-file task in pro mode","choices":["Multi-file task in pro mode","Multi-file task in standard mode","Single-file task in pro mode","Single-file task in standard mode"]}]},{"id":"q-6","number":6,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Python application named App1 that integrates with a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1.\nYou need to ensure that App1 meets the following requirements:\nAuthenticates by using a Microsoft Entra managed identity\nSends prompts to a deployed model by using the Azure OpenAI Responses API\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您有一个名为 App1 的 Python 应用程序,该应用程序与名为 Project1 的 Microsoft Foundry 项目集成。\n您需要确保 App1 满足以下要求:\n使用 Microsoft Entra 托管身份进行身份验证\n通过使用 Azure OpenAI Responses API 向已部署的模型发送提示\n您应该如何完成 Python 代码?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:DefaultAzureCredential","item2:create"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n如何使用 Microsoft Entra 的托管身份进行身份验证。\n如何通过 Azure OpenAI Responses API 与部署的模型交互。\nPython SDK 的使用,包括身份验证和 API 调用。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\n第一部分:身份验证选项\nAzureKeyCredential: 此选项用于基于密钥的身份验证,但题目要求使用 Microsoft Entra 托管身份,因此此选项错误。\nClientSecretCredential: 此选项用于基于客戶端机密的身份验证,但题目要求使用托管身份,因此此选项错误。\nDefaultAzureCredential: 此选项支持多种身份验证方式,包括托管身份,是题目要求的正确选项。\n第二部分:API调用方法选项\ncompact: 此选项与题目要求的功能无关,因此错误。\ncreate: 此选项用于创建新的响应,与题目要求的功能匹配,因此正确。\nretrieve: 此选项用于检索现有的响应,但题目要求发送新的提示,因此错误。\n3. 我的答案\nDefaultAzureCredential\ncreate\n4. 官方答案\nDefaultAzureCredential\ncreate\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:官方答案正确地选择了支持托管身份的身份验证方式(DefaultAzureCredential)以及发送新提示的API调用方法(create)。","pageStart":18,"pageEnd":19,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-018.jpg","assets/pages/page-019.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Authentication","answer":"DefaultAzureCredential","choices":["AzureKeyCredential","ClientSecretCredential","DefaultAzureCredential"]},{"id":"item2","label":"API method","answer":"create","choices":["compact","create","retrieve"]}]},{"id":"q-7","number":7,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a workflow for a customer support triage process.\nYou have an Ask a question node that stores user responses in a local variable named Var01.\nYou need to create the following Power Fx expressions:\nAn if/else condition expression that ensures that Var01 contains a value\nA Send message expression that returns the stored user response in uppercase\nHow should you configure the expressions? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个客戶支持分诊流程的工作流。\n您有一个“提问”节点,该节点将用戶响应存储在名为 Var01 的本地变量中。\n您需要创建以下 Power Fx 表达式:\n一个 if/else 条件表达式,用于确保 Var01 包含一个值\n一个发送消息表达式,用于以大写形式返回存储的用戶响应\n您应该如何配置这些表达式?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Not(IsBlank(Local.Var01))","item2:{Upper(Local.Var01)}"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nPower Fx表达式的使用,包括条件判断和字符串操作。\n如何检查变量是否为空或无值。\n如何将字符串转换为大写。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nIf/else condition expression选项分析:\nIsBlank(Local.Var01): 检查变量是否为空(即没有值)。如果变量为空,则返回true;否则返回false。此选项可以用于判断变量是否为\n空。\nIsEmpty(Local.Var01): 检查集合是否为空。此选项用于集合类型变量,而不是单一值变量,因此在此场景中不适用。\nNot(IsBlank(Local.Var01)): 检查变量是否不为空。通过对IsBlank的结果取反,可以确保变量包含值。此选项是正确的,因为题目要求\n确保Var01包含值。\nSend message expression选项分析:\n{Local.Var01}: 返回变量的原始值,但没有进行任何操作。此选项不符合题目要求,因为题目要求返回大写的用戶响应。\n{Upper(Local.Var01)}: 将变量的值转换为大写并返回。此选项是正确的,因为它符合题目要求。\n{Upper(Var01)}: 尝试将变量Var01转换为大写,但此处缺少\"Local.\"前缀,导致语法错误。此选项不正确。\n3. 我的答案\nIf/else condition expression: Not(IsBlank(Local.Var01))\nSend message expression: Upper(Local.Var01)\n4. 官方答案\nIf/else condition expression: Not(IsBlank(Local.Var01))\nSend message expression: Upper(Local.Var01)\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n理由:官方答案正确地选择了用于检查变量是否包含值的表达式(Not(IsBlank(Local.Var01))以及将变量值转换为大写的表达式\n(Upper(Local.Var01))。这些选项完全符合题目要求。","pageStart":20,"pageEnd":21,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-020.jpg","assets/pages/page-021.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"If/else condition","answer":"Not(IsBlank(Local.Var01))","choices":["IsBlank(Local.Var01)","IsEmpty(Local.Var01)","Not(IsBlank(Local.Var01))"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Send message expression","answer":"{Upper(Local.Var01)}","choices":["{Local.Var01}","{Upper(Local.Var01)}","{Upper(Var01)}"]}]},{"id":"q-8","number":8,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a customer support agent built by using the Foundry Agent Service.\nThe agent uploads user-provided screenshots to Azure Storage through a ticketing tool and receives a blob URL for additional reasoning.\nYou need to use image moderation during agent runs and prevent harmful content from being returned during runs. Azure AI Content Safety must\naccess the images by using the blob URL. The solution must follow the principle of least privilege.\nWhat should you configure for Content Safety? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含使用 Foundry Agent Service 构建的客戶支持代理。\n该代理通过工单工具将用戶提供的屏幕截图上传到 Azure 存储,并接收一个用于进一步推理的 Blob URL。\n您需要在代理运行期间使用图像审核,并防止在运行期间返回有害内容。Azure AI 内容安全必须通过 Blob URL 访问图像。解决方案\n必须遵循最低权限原则。\n您应该为内容安全配置什么?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Select User input, Output, Tool response, and Tool call and set Action to Block","item2:A system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Reader role"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure AI Content Safety的配置,包括如何设置Guardrails以确保内容安全。\nAzure存储访问权限的配置,遵循最小权限原则。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nGuardrails选项分析:\nSelect Tool call and set Action to Block: 仅阻止工具调用可能不足以全面防止有害内容的传播,因为用戶输入和输出也可能包含敏感内\n容。\nSelect User input and Output and set Action to Annotate: 仅注释用戶输入和输出可能无法有效阻止有害内容的传播,尤其是在工具响应\n中可能包含敏感信息的情况下。\nSelect User input and Tool response and set Action to Annotate: 注释用戶输入和工具响应可以提供一定的内容标记,但无法完全阻止有\n害内容的传播。\nSelect User input, Output, Tool response, and Tool call and set Action to Block: 阻止所有相关内容(用戶输入、输出、工具响应和工具调\n用)是最全面的解决方案,可以有效防止有害内容的传播。\nStorage access选项分析:\nStorage account access keys: 使用存储账戶访问密钥提供了完全访问权限,但不符合最小权限原则,可能导致安全⻛险。\nA user-assigned identity that is assigned the Storage Queue Data Contributor role: 此⻆色仅适用于队列数据的贡献权限,与Blob存储访问\n无关,因此不适合此场景。\nA system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Reader role: 此选项符合最小权限原则,仅授予读取Blob数据的\n权限,适合用于内容安全访问Blob URL。\nA system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Contributor role: 此选项授予了写入权限,超出了读取Blob数据\n的需求,不符合最小权限原则。\n3. 我的答案\nGuardrails: Select User input, Output, Tool response, and Tool call and set Action to Block\nStorage access: A system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Reader role\n4. 官方答案\nGuardrails: Select User input, Output, Tool response, and Tool call and set Action to Block\nStorage access: A system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Reader role\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,原因是两者都遵循了内容安全的全面阻止策略(Guardrails)以及最小权限原则(Storage access)。\n没有发现需要重新思考的地方,答案是正确的。","pageStart":22,"pageEnd":23,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-022.jpg","assets/pages/page-023.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Guardrails","answer":"Select User input, Output, Tool response, and Tool call and set Action to Block","choices":["Select Tool call and set Action to Block","Select User input and Output and set Action to Annotate","Select User input and Tool response and set Action to Annotate","Select User input, Output, Tool response, and Tool call and set Action to Block"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Storage access","answer":"A system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Reader role","choices":["Storage account access keys","A user-assigned identity that is assigned the Storage Queue Data Contributor role","A system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Reader role","A system-assigned managed identity that is assigned the Storage Blob Data Contributor role"]}]},{"id":"q-9","number":9,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains three agents as shown in the following table.\nYou need to orchestrate the agents to ensure that the customer requests meet the following requirements:\nSupport a deterministic, step-based process that uses conditional branching and shared state across the agents.\nOptionally trigger a ticket action based on the triage result.\nThe solution must minimize development effort.\nWhat should you include in the solution?","questionZh":"你有一个微软Foundry项目,其中包含三个代理,如下表所示。\n你需要协调这些代理,以确保客戶请求满足以下要求:\n支持一个确定性的、基于步骤的流程,该流程使用条件分支并在代理之间共享状态。\n根据分类结果可选择性地触发工单操作。\n解决方案必须尽量减少开发工作量。\n你应该在解决方案中包含什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"a workflow","zh":"一个工作流"},{"id":"B","en":"threads and runs without a workflow","zh":"没有工作流的线程和运行"},{"id":"C","en":"a multi-agent group chat session","zh":"一个多代理组聊天会话"},{"id":"D","en":"separate agent runs coordinated in the application code","zh":"在应用程序代码中协调的单独代理运行"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"正确答案:A\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在Microsoft Foundry项目中使用合适的技术来协调多个智能代理(agents),以满足特定的业务需求。\n重点知识点包括:工作流的使用、条件分支、共享状态、多代理协作以及开发效率的优化。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nA. a workflow 一个工作流\n工作流是一个适合处理多步骤、条件分支和共享状态的工具。它可以支持确定性、步骤式的过程,并且可以轻松实现条件逻辑(例\n如根据分类结果触发票据操作)。\n工作流的使用可以显著减少开发复杂度,因为它提供了内置的状态管理和流程控制功能。\n此选项符合题目要求,正确。\nB. threads and runs without a workflow 没有工作流的线程和运行\n使用线程和运行来协调代理虽然可以实现一定的功能,但缺乏工作流的结构化支持,开发复杂度较高。\n无法直接支持条件分支和共享状态,开发者需要手动实现这些功能,违背了“最小化开发努力”的要求。\n此选项不符合题目要求,错误。\nC. a multi-agent group chat session 一个多代理组聊天会话\n多代理组聊天会话适用于实时交互场景,但不适合处理确定性、步骤式的流程。\n无法直接支持条件分支和共享状态,且开发者需要额外编写逻辑来协调代理间的交互。\n此选项不符合题目要求,错误。\nD. separate agent runs coordinated in the application code 在应用程序代码中协调的单独代理运行\n在应用程序代码中手动协调代理运行虽然灵活,但开发复杂度极高。\n需要开发者手动实现条件分支和共享状态管理,违背了“最小化开发努力”的要求。\n此选项不符合题目要求,错误。\n3. 我的答案\n我选择的答案是:A. a workflow\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:A. a workflow\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:工作流能够满足题目中提到的所有需求,包括支持确定性、步骤式的过程,条件分支和共享状态,同时最小化开发努\n力。","pageStart":24,"pageEnd":25,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-024.jpg","assets/pages/page-025.jpg"]},{"id":"q-10","number":10,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent uses Azure Speech in Foundry Tools.\nYou fine-tune a baseline speech to text model for the en-us locale and publish the model.\nThe agent calls the Speech to text REST API and returns an error message indicating that the project ID is invalid.\nYou need to set the project property to the correct ID.\nTo what should you set the project property?","questionZh":"您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理在 Foundry Tools 中使用了 Azure Speech。\n您为 en-us 语言区域微调了一个基础语音转文本模型并发布了该模型。\n代理调用语音转文本 REST API,并返回一条错误消息,指示项目 ID 无效。\n您需要将项目属性设置为正确的 ID。\n应该将项目属性设置为什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"the project URL","zh":"项目 URL"},{"id":"B","en":"the custom speech project ID","zh":"自定义语音项目 ID Most Voted"},{"id":"C","en":"the project ID","zh":"项目 ID"},{"id":"D","en":"the custom speech endpoint URL","zh":"自定义语音端点 URL"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"建议答案:B\nCommunity vote distribution\nB (100%)\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure Speech 服务中的“自定义语音模型”功能,特别是如何正确配置项目属性以调用 Speech to Text REST API。\n选项逐一分析\nA. the project URL:错误。项目 URL 通常指向项目的网⻚或管理界面,而不是用于 API 调用的具体标识符。REST API 需要的是项目的\n唯一标识符(ID),而非 URL。\nB. the custom speech project ID:正确。自定义语音项目 ID 是 Azure Speech 服务中用于标识特定自定义语音模型的唯一标识符。调用\nREST API 时需要提供此 ID,以便 API 能够正确定位到该模型。\nC. the project ID:错误。虽然“项目 ID”听起来类似,但它并不明确指代自定义语音项目 ID。Azure 中可能有多个类型的项目 ID,必须\n明确是“custom speech project ID”。\nD. the custom speech endpoint URL:错误。自定义语音端点 URL 是用于访问服务的网络地址,但它不能替代项目 ID。项目 ID 是 API 调\n用中必需的参数,用于标识具体的模型。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:B\n官方答案\n官方答案:B\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:根据 Azure Speech 服务的文档,调用自定义语音模型时,必须提供 custom speech project ID 作为参数,以确保 API 能够正\n确定位到该模型。其他选项均不符合技术要求。","pageStart":26,"pageEnd":27,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-026.jpg","assets/pages/page-027.jpg"]},{"id":"q-11","number":11,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent named PaymentAgent.\nPaymentAgent includes a function tool that issues customer refunds by using an external API.\nYou are creating a workflow in YAML.\nYou need to ensure that the workflow pauses for human approval and continues with the refund step only after approval is granted.\nHow should you complete the workflow definition? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您有一个包含名为 PaymentAgent 的代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\nPaymentAgent 包括一个使用外部 API 发放客戶退款的功能工具。\n您正在使用 YAML 创建一个工作流。\n您需要确保工作流暂停以获得人工批准,并且仅在批准后继续执行退款步骤。\n您应该如何完成工作流定义?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:ask_question","item2:approval == \"approved\""],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在Microsoft Foundry项目中使用YAML定义工作流,特别是如何实现人工审批流程。\n涉及的知识点包括工作流步骤类型(如agent、ask_question等)、条件语句的使用以及如何正确配置工作流的逻辑。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\n步骤2的类型选项分析:\nask_question: 这是一个用于暂停工作流并等待人工输入或批准的类型,符合题目要求。\nbasic_chat: 这是一个用于与用戶进行简单聊天的类型,通常用于收集信息或提供反馈,但不适合用于暂停工作流等待批准。\ndata_transformation: 这是一个用于处理数据的类型,通常用于数据转换或计算,与人工审批无关。\n步骤3的条件选项分析:\napproval == \"approved\": 这是一个正确的条件,表示只有在人工审批通过后,工作流才能继续执行退款步骤。\npropose_refund.output != null: 这是一个检查退款提议是否有输出的条件,虽然逻辑上可能有意义,但题目没有提到需要检查这个条\n件,因此不符合题目要求。\ntrue: 这是一个无条件执行的选项,不符合题目要求,因为题目明确要求在人工审批后才继续执行。\n3. 我的答案\n步骤2的类型:ask_question\n步骤3的条件:approval == \"approved\"\n4. 官方答案\n步骤2的类型:ask_question\n步骤3的条件:approval == \"approved\"\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:官方答案正确地选择了暂停工作流等待人工审批的类型(ask_question),以及在审批通过后继续执行的条件(approval ==\n\"approved\")。这些选择完全符合题目要求。","pageStart":28,"pageEnd":29,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-028.jpg","assets/pages/page-029.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Step 2 type","answer":"ask_question","choices":["ask_question","basic_chat","data_transformation"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Step 3 condition","answer":"approval == \"approved\"","choices":["approval == \"approved\"","propose_refund.output != null","true"]}]},{"id":"q-12","number":12,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an Azure Speech in Foundry Tools resource that hosts a custom speech to text model deployed to a custom endpoint. An agent uses the\nendpoint to perform real-time speech recognition.\nYou are approaching the expiration date of the custom speech to text model.\nWhat is the expected behavior when the model expires?","questionZh":"您在 Foundry Tools 中拥有一个 Azure Speech 资源,该资源托管了一个部署到自定义端点的自定义语音转文本模型。一个代理使用该\n端点执行实时语音识别。\n您正在接近自定义语音转文本模型的到期日期。\n模型到期后预期的行为是什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Speech recognition requests will return a 4xx error until a new custom model is deployed.","zh":"语音识别请求将返回 4xx 错误,直到部署新的自定义模型。"},{"id":"B","en":"Speech recognition requests will continue to use the expired custom model until the model is removed manually.","zh":"语音识别请求将继续使用过期的自定义模型,直到手动移除该模型。"},{"id":"C","en":"Speech recognition requests will fall back to the most recent base model for the same locale.","zh":"语音识别请求将回退到同一语言环境的最新基础模型。"},{"id":"D","en":"The custom model will be deleted automatically when the model expires.","zh":"自定义模型将在模型到期时自动删除。"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"正确答案:C\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Speech 服务的行为,特别是自定义语音到文本模型的生命周期管理。\n模型到期后的处理机制,包括回退策略和错误处理。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Speech recognition requests will return a 4xx error until a new custom model is deployed.\n错误:Azure Speech 服务通常不会直接返回 4xx 错误,而是会有回退机制以确保服务的连续性。\n如果自定义模型到期,服务会尝试使用基础模型,而不是直接中断服务。\nB. Speech recognition requests will continue to use the expired custom model until the model is removed manually.\n错误:根据 Azure 的设计,过期的自定义模型不会继续被使用,因为它已经失效,无法保证准确性。\n服务会自动回退到基础模型,而不是依赖用戶手动移除模型。\nC. Speech recognition requests will fall back to the most recent base model for the same locale.\n正确:Azure Speech 服务在自定义模型到期后,会自动回退到最新的基础模型以确保服务的连续性。\n这是官方文档中明确提到的行为,符合实际情况。\nD. The custom model will be deleted automatically when the model expires.\n错误:模型到期后不会被自动删除,而是会停止使用。用戶仍然可以查看和管理过期的模型。\n删除模型通常需要用戶手动操作,而不是自动完成。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:C\n4. 官方答案\n答案:C\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,都是 C。\n原因:Azure Speech 服务的设计旨在确保服务的连续性,因此在自定义模型到期后会自动回退到基础模型,而不会直接中断服务或\n删除模型。","pageStart":30,"pageEnd":31,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-030.jpg","assets/pages/page-031.jpg"]},{"id":"q-13","number":13,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a model deployment.\nYou have an application that calls the deployment by using the Azure OpenAI v1 API and DefaultAzureCredential.\nThe developers at your company receive HTTP 403 errors when they send inference requests, even after running az login.\nYou need to ensure that the developers can perform model inference. The solution must follow the principle of least privilege.\nWhich role-based access control (RBAC) role should you assign to the developers?","questionZh":"你有一个包含模型部署的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n你有一个应用程序通过 Azure OpenAI v1 API 和 DefaultAzureCredential 调用该部署。\n你公司的开发人员在发送推理请求时收到 HTTP 403 错误,即使已经运行了 az login。\n你需要确保开发人员能够执行模型推理。解决方案必须遵循最小权限原则。\n应该为开发人员分配哪种基于⻆色的访问控制 (RBAC) ⻆色?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Cognitive Services User","zh":"认知服务用戶"},{"id":"B","en":"Cognitive Services OpenAI User","zh":"认知服务 OpenAI 用戶"},{"id":"C","en":"Contributor","zh":"贡献者"},{"id":"D","en":"Cognitive Services Data Reader","zh":"认知服务数据读取者"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure RBAC(⻆色基于访问控制)权限管理,尤其是与 Azure OpenAI 服务相关的⻆色权限。\n需要理解 Azure OpenAI 服务的 API 调用权限,以及如何通过 RBAC 分配最小权限以解决 HTTP 403 错误。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Cognitive Services User (认知服务用戶)\n此⻆色允许用戶访问认知服务资源,但不包括对 Azure OpenAI 服务的特定权限。由于题目明确提到使用 Azure OpenAI v1 API,因此此\n⻆色不足以解决 HTTP 403 错误。\n错误原因:此⻆色不具备调用 Azure OpenAI API 的权限。\nB. Cognitive Services OpenAI User (认知服务 OpenAI 用戶)\n此⻆色专⻔用于允许用戶调用 Azure OpenAI 服务的 API。根据题目要求,开发者需要能够执行模型推理(inference),此⻆色正是为\n此设计的,且符合最小权限原则。\n正确原因:此⻆色具备调用 Azure OpenAI API 的权限,解决了 HTTP 403 错误。\nC. Contributor (贡献者)\n此⻆色允许用戶对资源进行全面管理,包括创建、删除和修改资源。虽然此⻆色可以解决 HTTP 403 错误,但它授予了过多权限,违\n反了最小权限原则。\n错误原因:权限过大,不符合最小权限原则。\nD. Cognitive Services Data Reader (认知服务数据读取者)\n此⻆色允许用戶读取认知服务资源中的数据,但不包括调用 Azure OpenAI API 的权限。因此无法解决 HTTP 403 错误。\n错误原因:此⻆色不具备调用 Azure OpenAI API 的权限。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:B. Cognitive Services OpenAI User\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:B. Cognitive Services OpenAI User\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:B 选项是唯一符合题目要求的⻆色,既解决了 HTTP 403 错误,又遵循了最小权限原则。","pageStart":32,"pageEnd":33,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-032.jpg","assets/pages/page-033.jpg"]},{"id":"q-14","number":14,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent has a Model Context Protocol (MCP) tool that queries a knowledge base\nstored in Azure AI Search.\nSome agent runs return answers from the base model without invoking the knowledge base, which results in responses without grounded\ncitations.\nYou are provided with the following code snippet that runs the agent.\nYou need to add the correct tool _choice parameter to the code to deterministically force the agent to invoke the MCP tool on each run.\nWhat should you add?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理具有一个模型上下文协议 (MCP) 工具,用于查询存储在 Azure AI Search 中的知识\n库。\n某些代理运行会直接从基础模型返回答案,而不调用知识库,这会导致响应中缺少有依据的引用。\n你被提供了以下运行代理的代码片段。\n你需要向代码中添加正确的 tool _choice 参数,以确定性地强制代理在每次运行时调用 MCP 工具。\n你应该添加什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"tool_choice={“required”}\ntool_choice={“required”} Most Voted","zh":""},{"id":"B","en":"tool_choice={“auto”}\ntool_choice={“auto”}","zh":""},{"id":"C","en":"tool_choice={“type”:“knowledge_base”}\ntool_choice={“type”:“knowledge_base”}","zh":""},{"id":"D","en":"tool_choice ={“type”:“mcp”}\ntool_choice ={“type”:“mcp”}","zh":""}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"官方答案：A\n答案核验\nPDF 第 34-35 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 A。\n对应选项：A. tool_choice={“required”}\ntool_choice={“required”} Most Voted\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":34,"pageEnd":35,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-034.jpg","assets/pages/page-035.jpg"]},{"id":"q-15","number":15,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a customer support agent grounded in internal documentation.\nAfter a recent update, users report the following issues:\nSome answers are unsupported by retrieved documents.\nA small number of responses are flagged for policy violations.\nYou need to evaluate each issue.\nWhich observability signals should you use for each issue? To answer, drag the appropriate observability signals to the correct issues. Each\nobservability signal may be used once, more than once, or not at all. You may need to drag the spit bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"拖放 -\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个基于内部文档的客戶支持代理。\n在最近的更新后,用戶报告了以下问题:\n某些答案不受检索文档支持。\n少量响应因违反政策而被标记。\n您需要评估每个问题。\n对于每个问题,您应该使用哪些可观察性信号?要回答,请将适当的可观察性信号拖到正确的问题上。每个可观察性信号可以使用\n一次、多次或完全不使用。您可能需要拖动分割条以在窗格之间查看内容或滚动查看内容。\n注意:每个正确选择值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Groundedness evaluation metrics","item2:Risk and safety metrics"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是AI模型的可观测性(Observability)信号的使用,包括如何评估模型的响应质量、性能和安全性。\n具体涉及到以下几个方面:\nGroundedness evaluation metrics:用于评估模型生成的答案是否基于检索到的文档。\nRisk and safety metrics:用于检测模型生成的内容是否存在政策违规或安全⻛险。\nLatency breakdown traces:用于分析模型响应的延迟问题。\nToken usage analytics:用于分析模型的令牌使用情况,通常与成本或性能优化相关。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nGroundedness evaluation metrics:正确。此信号专⻔用于评估模型生成的答案是否基于检索到的文档,因此适用于“Unsupported\nresponses”问题。\nRisk and safety metrics:正确。此信号用于检测模型生成的内容是否存在政策违规或安全⻛险,因此适用于“Policy violations”问题。\nLatency breakdown traces:错误。此信号主要用于分析响应时间问题,与题目中的问题无关。\nToken usage analytics:错误。此信号主要用于分析令牌使用情况,与题目中的问题无关。\n3. 我的答案\nUnsupported responses: Groundedness evaluation metrics\nPolicy violations: Risk and safety metrics\n4. 官方答案\nUnsupported responses: Groundedness evaluation metrics\nPolicy violations: Risk and safety metrics\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:官方答案正确地将“Unsupported responses”问题与“Groundedness evaluation metrics”信号匹配,因为该信号专⻔用于评估答\n案是否基于检索到的文档;同时将“Policy violations”问题与“Risk and safety metrics”信号匹配,因为该信号用于检测政策违规或安全⻛\n险。","pageStart":36,"pageEnd":37,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-036.jpg","assets/pages/page-037.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Unsupported responses","answer":"Groundedness evaluation metrics","choices":["Groundedness evaluation metrics","Latency breakdown traces","Risk and safety metrics","Token usage analytics"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Policy violations","answer":"Risk and safety metrics","choices":["Groundedness evaluation metrics","Latency breakdown traces","Risk and safety metrics","Token usage analytics"]}]},{"id":"q-16","number":16,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1 that contains an agent. The agent uses an OpenAPI 3.0 specification to call an external\nweather service.\nThe weather service requires a key to be passed in an HTTP header. The key value is stored as a connection in Project1.\nYou need to ensure that the key value from the connection is included automatically whenever the OpenAPI tool is invoked.\nWhat should you configure in the OpenAPI specification?","questionZh":"你有一个名为 Project1 的 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个代理。该代理使用 OpenAPI 3.0 规范调用外部天气服务。\n天气服务要求在 HTTP 头中传递一个密钥。密钥值作为连接存储在 Project1 中。\n你需要确保每次调用 OpenAPI 工具时,连接中的密钥值都会自动包含。\n你应该在 OpenAPI 规范中配置什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"a header parameter defined for each operation","zh":"为每个操作定义的头参数"},{"id":"B","en":"an Azure Key Vault connection","zh":"一个 Azure Key Vault 连接"},{"id":"C","en":"an API key security scheme","zh":"一个 API 密钥安全方案"},{"id":"D","en":"a Bearer token security scheme","zh":"一个 Bearer 令牌安全方案"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"正确答案:C\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在OpenAPI 3.0规范中配置安全方案,以便自动传递API密钥或其他认证信息。\n涉及OpenAPI 3.0的安全定义,包括API密钥安全方案、Bearer令牌安全方案等。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 为每个操作定义的头参数\n错误。虽然可以通过为每个操作定义头参数来传递API密钥,但这种方法需要手动为每个操作添加头参数,无法实现自动化传递,且\n不符合最佳实践。\nB. 一个 Azure Key Vault 连接\n错误。Azure Key Vault是一个安全存储服务,用于存储密钥、证书等敏感信息,但它本身并不是OpenAPI规范的一部分,无法直接在\nOpenAPI中配置。\nC. 一个 API 密钥安全方案\n正确。API密钥安全方案是OpenAPI 3.0中用于定义如何通过HTTP头、查询参数或cookie传递API密钥的标准方法。通过这种方式,可以\n自动将存储的密钥包含在请求中。\nD. 一个 Bearer 令牌安全方案\n错误。Bearer令牌安全方案通常用于OAuth 2.0认证,与题目中提到的API密钥认证需求不符。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:C\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:C\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:API密钥安全方案是OpenAPI 3.0中用于自动传递API密钥的标准方法,符合题目要求。","pageStart":38,"pageEnd":39,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-038.jpg","assets/pages/page-039.jpg"]},{"id":"q-17","number":17,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that serves a high-volume chat app.\nMost requests are simple FAQs, but some require advanced reasoning.\nYou need to reduce costs and latency for common queries, without degrading the quality of the responses to complex questions.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"你有一个微软Foundry项目,服务于一个高流量的聊天应用。\n大多数请求是简单的常⻅问题解答,但有些需要高级推理。\n你需要降低常⻅查询的成本和延迟,同时不降低对复杂问题的响应质量。\n你应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Route all the requests to a smaller model.","zh":"将所有请求路由到一个较小的模型。"},{"id":"B","en":"Use a model cascade that routes the requests to different models.","zh":"使用模型级联,将请求路由到不同的模型。"},{"id":"C","en":"Increase the value of the max_tokens parameter for all the requests.","zh":"增加所有请求的max_tokens参数的值。"},{"id":"D","en":"Route all the requests to the most capable model.","zh":"将所有请求路由到最强大的模型。"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何优化AI模型的使用,以降低成本和延迟,同时保证复杂问题的响应质量。这涉及到模型级联、模型选择以及参数\n优化等知识点。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Route all the requests to a smaller model.\n分析:将所有请求都路由到一个较小的模型虽然可以降低成本和延迟,但会导致复杂问题的响应质量下降,因为较小的模型可能无\n法处理复杂问题。\n结论:此选项错误。\nB. Use a model cascade that routes the requests to different models.\n分析:使用模型级联可以根据请求的复杂性选择合适的模型。简单问题可以由较小的模型处理,复杂问题可以由更强大的模型处\n理,从而在降低成本和延迟的同时保证响应质量。\n结论:此选项正确。\nC. Increase the value of the max_tokens parameter for all the requests.\n分析:增加max_tokens参数的值会导致每次请求的响应更⻓,可能会增加成本和延迟,并且对简单问题来说是资源浪费。\n结论:此选项错误。\nD. Route all the requests to the most capable model.\n分析:将所有请求都路由到最强大的模型虽然可以保证复杂问题的响应质量,但会显著增加成本和延迟,对简单问题来说是资源浪\n费。\n结论:此选项错误。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:B\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:B\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:模型级联是解决本题需求的最佳方法,可以根据请求的复杂性动态选择模型,既降低了成本和延迟,又保证了复杂问题的响\n应质量。","pageStart":40,"pageEnd":41,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-040.jpg","assets/pages/page-041.jpg"]},{"id":"q-18","number":18,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an internal Q&A agent.\nUsers report the following issues when they ask the agent questions:\nAn increase in the following response: “No relevant information found”\nPeriodic HTTP 429 rate limit exceeded errors during peak hours\nYou need to identify whether each issue is caused by model unavailability, resource limits, or inference failures.\nWhat should you do? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您有一个包含内部问答代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n用戶在向代理提问时报告了以下问题:\n以下响应的增加:“未找到相关信息”\n高峰时段出现周期性的 HTTP 429 速率限制超出错误\n您需要确定每个问题是由模型不可用、资源限制还是推理失败引起的。\n您应该怎么做?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Model Availability Rate and Provisioned Utilization","item2:RequestResponse"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何诊断和解决 Microsoft Foundry 项目中 Q&A 代理的性能问题,包括模型可用性、资源限制和推理失败。\n需要理解如何使用监控指标和诊断日志来定位问题的根源。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nMetrics to enable:\nModel Availability Rate and Provisioned Utilization:\n这是用于监控模型的可用性和资源使用情况的指标。\n“No relevant information found”可能与模型不可用或资源不足有关,因此启用这些指标是合理的。\n正确选项。\nOnly Tokens Cache Match Rate:\n此指标用于监控缓存命中率,与问题描述中的错误无直接关联。\n错误选项。\nOnly Total Requests filtered to status code 200:\n此指标仅监控成功的请求,与问题描述中的 HTTP 429 错误无关。\n错误选项。\nTime To Response and Total Tokens:\n此指标用于监控响应时间和令牌使用情况,与问题描述中的错误无直接关联。\n错误选项。\nDiagnostic log to collect:\nAllMetrics:\n此选项会收集所有指标,但可能会导致数据过载,且不针对问题的具体诊断。\n错误选项。\naudit:\n此选项用于记录安全相关的审计日志,与问题描述无关。\n错误选项。\nRequestResponse:\n此选项记录请求和响应的详细信息,可以帮助诊断 HTTP 429 错误和模型推理问题。\n正确选项。\ntrace:\n此选项记录系统的详细跟踪信息,但可能不直接针对问题的诊断。\n错误选项。\n3. 我的答案\nMetrics to enable: Model Availability Rate and Provisioned Utilization\nDiagnostic log to collect: RequestResponse\n4. 官方答案\nMetrics to enable: Model Availability Rate and Provisioned Utilization\nDiagnostic log to collect: RequestResponse\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:官方答案正确地选择了与问题相关的指标和日志,能够有效诊断模型可用性和资源限制问题。","pageStart":42,"pageEnd":43,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-042.jpg","assets/pages/page-043.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Metrics","answer":"Model Availability Rate and Provisioned Utilization","choices":["Model Availability Rate and Provisioned Utilization","Only Tokens Cache Match Rate","Only Total Requests filtered to status code 200","Time To Response and Total Tokens"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Diagnostic log","answer":"RequestResponse","choices":["AllMetrics","audit","RequestResponse","trace"]}]},{"id":"q-19","number":19,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a high-traffic agent.\nAfter a recent update, operational costs increase significantly.\nMonitoring confirms that the volume of user traffic to the agent remains unchanged.\nYou suspect that changes to the request or response characteristics are causing the increase. You need to identify whether the additional costs\nare driven by the model input size, the model output size, or expanded tool usage.\nWhich observability capability should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个包含高流量代理的微软Foundry项目。\n最近的一次更新后,运营成本显著增加。\n监控确认代理的用戶流量量保持不变。\n你怀疑请求或响应特性发生变化导致了成本增加。你需要确定额外成本是由模型输入大小、模型输出大小还是扩展工具使用引起\n的。\n你应该使用哪种可观察性功能?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"latency","zh":"延迟"},{"id":"B","en":"evaluation metrics","zh":"评估指标"},{"id":"C","en":"run success rate","zh":"运行成功率"},{"id":"D","en":"token usage","zh":"令牌使用"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是微软AI-103考试中关于“模型性能监控与优化”的知识点,特别是如何通过观察工具来分析和优化模型的运行成本。\n重点在于理解如何使用“令牌使用”来分析模型输入和输出的变化对成本的影响。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. latency(延迟)\n延迟是指模型响应时间的⻓短,虽然延迟可能会间接影响用戶体验,但它并不能直接反映成本的变化。题目明确提到需要分析成本\n增加的原因,而不是性能问题,因此此选项错误。\nB. evaluation metrics(评估指标)\n评估指标通常用于衡量模型的准确性或性能(如精度、召回率等),而不是直接用于分析成本问题。题目要求分析成本增加的原因,\n因此此选项不符合要求,错误。\nC. run success rate(运行成功率)\n运行成功率是指模型运行是否成功的比率,通常用于监控模型的稳定性或故障率。虽然运行成功率可能会影响用戶体验,但它与成\n本增加无直接关系,因此此选项错误。\nD. token usage(令牌使用)\n令牌使用直接反映了模型输入和输出的大小。令牌的数量会影响模型的计算成本,特别是在高流量场景下,令牌使用的增加会显著\n提高运行成本。因此此选项正确。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:D. token usage(令牌使用)\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:D. token usage(令牌使用)\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,都是D. token usage(令牌使用)。\n原因分析:令牌使用是唯一能够直接反映模型输入和输出大小变化的指标,而输入和输出大小是影响运行成本的关键因素。\n没有必要重新思考,因为我的分析与官方答案完全一致。","pageStart":44,"pageEnd":45,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-044.jpg","assets/pages/page-045.jpg"]},{"id":"q-20","number":20,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe agent uses tools to retrieve internal content and call external APIs. The agent is configured to let the model decide when to call the tools.\nYou need to publish the agent for a compliance workflow. The solution must meet the following requirements:\nEach workflow run must include a retrieval step before generating a response.\nTool calls must authenticate by using the published agent’s own identity.\nTool access must use an identity isolated from other project resources.\nTool access must use support audit tracing.\nWhat should you do? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n该代理使用工具来检索内部内容并调用外部 API。代理被配置为让模型决定何时调用工具。\n您需要发布代理以用于合规工作流。解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n每次工作流运行必须在生成响应之前包含检索步骤。\n工具调用必须使用已发布代理自己的身份进行身份验证。\n工具访问必须使用与其他项目资源隔离的身份。\n工具访问必须支持审计追踪。\n您应该怎么做?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:required","item2:Using a distinct agent identity bound to the client application"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n如何配置Microsoft Foundry项目中的代理(agent)以满足特定的合规性工作流需求。\n工具调用的身份验证机制,包括隔离性和审计追踪支持。\n工具选择策略的配置(自动、无工具或强制工具调用)。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nSet tool_choice to:\nauto: 允许模型根据需要决定是否调用工具。这种配置灵活,但无法保证每次工作流运行都包含检索步骤,因此不符合题目要求。\nnone: 禁止工具调用。这显然不符合题目要求,因为题目明确要求工具调用必须包含检索步骤。\nrequired: 强制工具调用。这确保每次工作流运行都包含检索步骤,符合题目要求。\nConfigure the tool to authenticate by:\nStoring API keys in prompts: 将API密钥存储在提示中。这种方法不安全,无法满足题目要求的身份隔离和审计追踪支持。\nUsing the shared project agent identity: 使用共享的项目代理身份。这种方法无法实现工具访问的身份隔离,因此不符合题目要求。\nUsing a distinct agent identity bound to the client application: 使用绑定到客戶端应用程序的独立代理身份。这种方法可以实现工具访问\n的身份隔离,并支持审计追踪,符合题目要求。\n3. 我的答案\nSet tool_choice to: required\nConfigure the tool to authenticate by: Using a distinct agent identity bound to the client application\n4. 官方答案\nSet tool_choice to: required\nConfigure the tool to authenticate by: Using a distinct agent identity bound to the client application\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:官方答案完全符合题目要求,包括强制工具调用以确保检索步骤,以及使用独立代理身份以实现身份隔离和审计追踪支\n持。","pageStart":46,"pageEnd":47,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-046.jpg","assets/pages/page-047.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"tool_choice","answer":"required","choices":["auto","none","required"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Authentication","answer":"Using a distinct agent identity bound to the client application","choices":["Storing API keys in prompts","Using the shared project agent identity","Using a distinct agent identity bound to the client application"]}]},{"id":"q-21","number":21,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1 that contains the following:\nAn OpenAPI tool that calls an external API\nA project connection named Connection1 that stores the API key of the external API\nWhen an agent calls the OpenAPI tool, the API returns a 401 unauthorized error, and traces show that the API key header is NOT being sent.\nYou need to ensure that the OpenAPI tool automatically includes the API key from Connection1 on all requests.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"你有一个名为 Project1 的 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含以下内容:\n一个调用外部 API 的 OpenAPI 工具\n一个名为 Connection1 的项目连接,用于存储外部 API 的 API 密钥\n当代理调用 OpenAPI 工具时,API 返回 401 未授权错误,并且追踪显示 API 密钥头未被发送。\n你需要确保 OpenAPI 工具在所有请求中自动包含来自 Connection1 的 API 密钥。\n你应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Enable identity passthrough so that the tool uses the Microsoft Entra token of the caller.","zh":"启用身份透传,以便工具使用调用者的 Microsoft Entra 令牌。"},{"id":"B","en":"Add the API key header manually to the OpenAPI specification.","zh":"手动将 API 密钥头添加到 OpenAPI 规范中。"},{"id":"C","en":"Configure the tool to use the default connection of Project1.","zh":"将工具配置为使用 Project1 的默认连接。"},{"id":"D","en":"Connect the tool to Connection1.","zh":"将工具连接到 Connection1。 Most Voted"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"建议答案:D\nCommunity vote distribution\nD (100%)\n知识点\n本题考察的是 Microsoft Foundry 项目中 OpenAPI 工具与外部 API 的集成,特别是如何正确配置 API 密钥以确保请求授权。这涉及到 连\n接 (Connection) 的使用和 OpenAPI 工具的配置。\n选项分析\nA. 启用身份透传 (Enable identity passthrough) 使工具使用调用者的 Microsoft Entra 令牌:\n错误。身份透传是用于将调用者的身份(如 Microsoft Entra ID 令牌)传递给后端服务的功能,但题目明确指出需要使用 API 密钥,而\n不是 Microsoft Entra 令牌。因此此选项与问题无关。\nB. 手动将 API 密钥头添加到 OpenAPI 规范:\n错误。虽然手动修改 OpenAPI 规范可以添加 API 密钥头,但这不是最佳实践。Microsoft Foundry 提供了连接 (Connection) 功能来安全\n地存储和管理 API 密钥,手动修改规范会导致维护复杂性和安全⻛险。\nC. 配置工具以使用 Project1 的默认连接:\n错误。默认连接的使用需要明确配置,但题目中并未提到 Connection1 是默认连接。此外,问题的核心是工具未正确使用\nConnection1,而不是默认连接的配置问题。\nD. 将工具连接到 Connection1:\n正确。题目描述中提到 Connection1 存储了 API 密钥,但工具未发送 API 密钥头。将工具正确连接到 Connection1 是解决问题的关键\n步骤,这样工具才能自动从 Connection1 中提取 API 密钥并包含在请求中。\n推荐答案\nD\n官方答案\nD\n比较与验证\n我的推荐答案与官方答案一致。根据题目描述和 Microsoft Foundry 的功能,正确连接工具到 Connection1 是解决问题的唯一方法。","pageStart":48,"pageEnd":49,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-048.jpg","assets/pages/page-049.jpg"]},{"id":"q-22","number":22,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a customer support agent. The agent calls an internal knowledge API tool before generating\nresponses.\nUsers report the following issues:\nSome requests take more than 15 seconds to complete.\nSome responses are incorrect, even when the knowledge API returns the expected data.\nYou need to inspect individual agent runs to view the ordered sequence of large language model (LLM) calls, tool invocations, and timing\ninformation.\nWhich observability capability should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个微软Foundry项目,其中包含一个客戶支持代理。该代理在生成响应之前会调用一个内部知识API工具。\n用戶报告了以下问题:\n某些请求需要超过15秒才能完成。\n某些响应不正确,即使知识API返回了预期的数据。\n你需要检查单个代理运行,以查看大型语言模型(LLM)调用、工具调用和时间信息的有序序列。\n你应该使用哪种可观察性功能?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"token usage","zh":"令牌使用"},{"id":"B","en":"monitoring","zh":"监控"},{"id":"C","en":"safety metrics","zh":"安全指标"},{"id":"D","en":"tracing","zh":"追踪"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 这题考察的知识点是什么\n本题考察的是微软AI-103考试中关于“Observability(可观测性)”的知识点,特别是如何使用可观测性工具来分析和优化AI模型的运行\n表现。\n重点在于理解不同的可观测性功能(如令牌使用、监控、安全指标、追踪)在解决性能和准确性问题中的作用。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. token usage 令牌使用\n令牌使用主要用于分析模型在处理请求时消耗的令牌数量。这对于优化成本和理解模型的复杂性有帮助,但无法提供关于调用顺\n序、工具使用或时间信息。因此此选项错误。\nB. monitoring 监控\n监控通常用于实时观察系统的整体运行状态,例如CPU使用率、内存消耗等。虽然监控可以帮助识别系统性能问题,但它无法提供\n关于单次运行的详细调用顺序和时间信息。因此此选项错误。\nC. safety metrics 安全指标\n安全指标主要用于评估模型的输出是否符合安全性要求,例如是否包含有害内容或偏⻅。这与题目中提到的性能和调用顺序问题无\n关,因此此选项错误。\nD. tracing 追踪\n追踪是用于记录和分析单次运行的详细信息,包括调用顺序、工具使用情况和时间信息。它可以帮助开发者深入了解模型的行为,\n定位性能瓶颈和错误来源。因此此选项正确。\n3. 我选的答案\nD. tracing 追踪\n4. 官方答案\nD. tracing 追踪\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致,都是D. tracing 追踪。\n原因是追踪功能能够满足题目中提到的需求,即查看单次运行的调用顺序、工具使用情况和时间信息。","pageStart":50,"pageEnd":51,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-050.jpg","assets/pages/page-051.jpg"]},{"id":"q-23","number":23,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"Note: This section contains one or more sets of questions with the same scenario and problem. Each question presents a unique solution to the\nproblem. You must determine whether the solution meets the stated goals. More than one solution in the set might solve the problem. It is also\npossible that none of the solutions in the set solve the problem.\nAfter you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return. As a result, these questions do not appear on the Review Screen.\nYou have a multimodal AI generative model that accepts image uploads and uses extracted image text to generate responses.\nYou discover that users can upload unsafe images and embed hidden instructions into images to manipulate the model.\nYou need to implement controls to mitigate the risk.\nSolution: You configure a prompt shield for user prompts.\nDoes this meet the goal?","questionZh":"注意:本节包含一个或多个具有相同场景和问题的题组。每个问题都提供了一个解决方案。您需要判断该解决方案是否满足所述目\n标。题组中可能有多个解决方案可以解决问题,也可能没有任何解决方案能够解决问题。\n在您回答本节中的问题后,将无法返回。因此,这些问题不会出现在复查屏幕上。\n您有一个多模态AI生成模型,该模型接受图像上传,并使用提取的图像文本生成响应。\n您发现用戶可以上传不安全的图像,并在图像中嵌入隐藏指令以操控模型。\n您需要实施控制措施以降低⻛险。\n解决方案:您为用戶提示配置了一个提示屏障。\n这是否满足目标?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","zh":"是"},{"id":"B","en":"No","zh":"否 Most Voted"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"建议答案:B\nCommunity vote distribution\nB (75%) A (25%)\n知识点分析\n本题考察的具体知识点是多模态生成模型的安全性控制,特别是如何防止用戶通过上传不安全的图像或嵌入隐藏指令来操控模型。\n涉及的技术包括提示工程(Prompt Engineering)和内容过滤机制。\n选项分析\nA. Yes:\n错误。配置提示屏蔽(Prompt Shield)主要用于过滤或修改用戶输入的文本提示,以防止恶意或不适当的指令影响模型的输出。然\n而,本题的核心问题是用戶通过上传的图像嵌入隐藏指令,而不是直接通过文本提示操控模型。Prompt Shield 无法直接检测或处理\n图像中的隐藏信息,因此不能完全解决问题。\nB. No:\n正确。Prompt Shield 的功能局限于文本提示的过滤和修改,无法处理图像中的隐藏指令或不安全内容。因此,仅配置 Prompt Shield\n并不能满足题目中提出的目标。\n推荐答案\nB\n官方答案\nB\n答案对比与验证\n官方答案与推荐答案一致。Prompt Shield 无法解决图像中隐藏指令的问题,因此答案为 B 是正确的。","pageStart":52,"pageEnd":53,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-052.jpg","assets/pages/page-053.jpg"]},{"id":"q-24","number":24,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"Note: This section contains one or more sets of questions with the same scenario and problem. Each question presents a unique solution to the\nproblem. You must determine whether the solution meets the stated goals. More than one solution in the set might solve the problem. It is also\npossible that none of the solutions in the set solve the problem.\nAfter you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return. As a result, these questions do not appear on the Review Screen.\nYou have a multimodal AI generative model that accepts image uploads and uses extracted image text to generate responses.\nYou discover that users can upload unsafe images and embed hidden instructions into images to manipulate the model.\nYou need to implement controls to mitigate the risk.\nSolution: You configure image moderation to block unsafe content before processing the images.\nDoes this meet the goal?","questionZh":"注意:本节包含一个或多个具有相同场景和问题的题目集。每个题目都提供了一个解决方案。您需要判断该解决方案是否满足所述\n目标。题目集中可能有多个解决方案可以解决问题,也可能没有任何解决方案可以解决问题。\n在您回答本节中的一个问题后,您将无法返回。因此,这些问题不会出现在复查屏幕上。\n您有一个多模态AI生成模型,该模型接受图像上传,并使用提取的图像文本生成响应。\n您发现用戶可以上传不安全的图像,并在图像中嵌入隐藏指令以操控模型。\n您需要实施控制措施以降低⻛险。\n解决方案:您配置图像审核功能,在处理图像之前屏蔽不安全内容。\n这是否满足目标?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","zh":"是"},{"id":"B","en":"No","zh":"否 Most Voted"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"官方答案：B\n答案核验\nPDF 第 54-55 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 B。\n对应选项：B. 否 Most Voted\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":54,"pageEnd":55,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-054.jpg","assets/pages/page-055.jpg"]},{"id":"q-25","number":25,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"Note: This section contains one or more sets of questions with the same scenario and problem. Each question presents a unique solution to the\nproblem. You must determine whether the solution meets the stated goals. More than one solution in the set might solve the problem. It is also\npossible that none of the solutions in the set solve the problem.\nAfter you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return. As a result, these questions do not appear on the Review Screen.\nYou have a multimodal AI generative model that accepts image uploads and uses extracted image text to generate responses.\nYou discover that users can upload unsafe images and embed hidden instructions into images to manipulate the model.\nYou need to implement controls to mitigate the risk.\nSolution: You configure a prompt shield for documents.\nDoes this meet the goal?","questionZh":"注意:本节包含一个或多个具有相同场景和问题的题组。每个问题都提供了一个解决方案,您必须判断该解决方案是否满足所述目\n标。一个题组中可能有多个解决方案可以解决问题,也可能没有任何解决方案能够解决问题。\n回答本节中的问题后,您将无法返回。因此,这些问题不会出现在复查屏幕上。\n您有一个多模态 AI 生成模型,该模型接受图像上传,并使用提取的图像文本生成响应。\n您发现用戶可以上传不安全的图像,并在图像中嵌入隐藏指令以操控模型。\n您需要实施控制措施以降低⻛险。\n解决方案:您为文档配置了提示屏蔽。\n这是否满足目标?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","zh":"是 Most Voted"},{"id":"B","en":"No","zh":"否"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"官方答案：A\n答案核验\nPDF 第 56-57 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 A。\n对应选项：A. 是 Most Voted\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":56,"pageEnd":57,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-056.jpg","assets/pages/page-057.jpg"]},{"id":"q-26","number":26,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"Note: This section contains one or more sets of questions with the same scenario and problem. Each question presents a unique solution to the\nproblem. You must determine whether the solution meets the stated goals. More than one solution in the set might solve the problem. It is also\npossible that none of the solutions in the set solve the problem.\nAfter you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return. As a result, these questions do not appear on the Review Screen.\nYou have a multimodal AI generative model that accepts image uploads and uses extracted image text to generate responses.\nYou discover that users can upload unsafe images and embed hidden instructions into images to manipulate the model.\nYou need to implement controls to mitigate the risk.\nSolution: You configure protected material detection.\nDoes this meet the goal?","questionZh":"注意:本部分包含一个或多个具有相同场景和问题的题目集。每个题目为问题提供一个独特的解决方案。您必须确定该解决方案是\n否符合既定目标。题目集中可能有多个解决方案可以解决问题,也有可能没有任何解决方案可以解决问题。\n在回答本部分中的问题后,您将无法返回。因此,这些问题不会出现在审查屏幕上。\n您有一个多模态 AI 生成模型,该模型接受图像上传,并使用提取的图像文本生成响应。\n您发现用戶可以上传不安全的图像,并在图像中嵌入隐藏指令以操控模型。\n您需要实施控制措施以降低⻛险。\n解决方案:您配置了受保护材料检测。\n这是否符合目标?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","zh":"是"},{"id":"B","en":"No","zh":"否"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在多模态AI生成模型中处理安全性问题,特别是如何防止用戶上传不安全的图片或嵌入隐藏指令来操控模型。\n涉及的知识点包括内容过滤、保护性检测以及模型安全性设计。\n2. 独立分析与思考\n题目要求解决用戶上传不安全图片的问题,并防止嵌入隐藏指令操控模型。\n解决方案提到“配置保护性材料检测”,需要分析这种方法是否能够有效解决问题。\n3. 选项分析\nA. Yes 是: 配置保护性材料检测可以检测图片中的敏感内容(如暴力、色情等),但无法有效检测嵌入的隐藏指令(如对模型的操控\n指令)。因此,这种方法无法完全解决问题。\nB. No 否: 由于保护性材料检测无法处理嵌入的隐藏指令问题,因此此选项是正确的。\n4. 我的答案\n我的答案是:B. No\n5. 官方答案\n官方答案是:B. No\n6. 与官方答案比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致,原因是保护性材料检测虽然可以过滤敏感内容,但无法解决嵌入隐藏指令的问题。","pageStart":58,"pageEnd":59,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-058.jpg","assets/pages/page-059.jpg"]},{"id":"q-27","number":27,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"single","questionEn":"You need to recommend a solution to assess the responses generated by Agent1 when the agent uses the product information stored in storage1.\nThe solution must meet the technical requirements.\nWhat should you include in the recommendation?","questionZh":"您需要推荐一个解决方案来评估 Agent1 在使用存储在 storage1 中的产品信息时生成的响应。该解决方案必须满足技术需求。\n您应该在推荐中包含什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"a Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) evaluator","zh":"检索增强生成 (RAG) 评估器"},{"id":"B","en":"a custom guardrail","zh":"自定义防护措施"},{"id":"C","en":"model fine-tuning","zh":"模型微调"},{"id":"D","en":"a groundedness evaluator","zh":"基础性评估器 Most Voted"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"建议答案:D\nCommunity vote distribution\nD (100%)\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是如何评估生成式AI模型的响应质量,特别是基于外部数据(如存储在Azure Blob Storage中的产品信息)生成的\n响应是否符合技术要求。具体涉及的概念包括“响应评估”和“语义搜索”。\n相关技术:Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)、模型微调、定制防护措施(guardrails)、以及 groundedness evaluator。\n选项逐一分析\nA. Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) evaluator\n分析:RAG是一种技术,用于结合检索和生成模型以提高生成内容的准确性。虽然RAG可以帮助模型从外部数据中检索信息,但它本\n身不是一种评估工具,而是生成方法。因此,RAG evaluator并不直接用于评估生成响应的质量,而是用于增强生成过程。此选项错\n误。\nB. a custom guardrail\n分析:定制防护措施(guardrails)通常用于限制模型行为,例如防止生成敏感或不适当的内容。虽然它可以保护Agent1免受恶意指\n令的影响,但它并不直接评估响应的质量或准确性。此选项错误。\nC. model fine-tuning\n分析:模型微调是通过训练模型以适应特定任务或数据集来提高性能的过程。虽然微调可以提高模型生成的质量,但它是一个优化\n过程,而不是评估工具。题目要求的是评估解决方案,而不是优化方法。此选项错误。\nD. a groundedness evaluator\n分析:groundedness evaluator是一种专⻔用于评估生成内容是否基于外部数据(如存储1中的产品信息)的工具。它可以验证生成的\n响应是否与外部数据一致,从而确保响应的准确性和相关性。此工具完全符合题目要求。此选项正确。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:D\n官方答案\n官方答案:D\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:groundedness evaluator是专⻔用于评估生成内容是否基于外部数据的工具,完全符合题目要求。其他选项要么不适用于评\n估任务,要么与题目要求不符。","pageStart":60,"pageEnd":64,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-060.jpg","assets/pages/page-061.jpg","assets/pages/page-062.jpg","assets/pages/page-063.jpg","assets/pages/page-064.jpg"]},{"id":"q-28","number":28,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"single","questionEn":"You need to configure Agent1 to answer customer questions about only the Contoso products. The solution must meet the business\nrequirements.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您需要配置 Agent1 以仅回答客戶关于 Contoso 产品的问题。解决方案必须满足业务需求。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Modify the system message instructions.","zh":"修改系统消息指令。"},{"id":"B","en":"Add few-shot examples.","zh":"添加少量示例。"},{"id":"C","en":"Apply top-p sampling.","zh":"应用顶级采样。"},{"id":"D","en":"Increase the value of the temperature parameter.","zh":"增加温度参数的值。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"正确答案:A\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何通过配置生成式AI模型的行为,使其能够专注于回答特定领域的问题(如仅回答关于Contoso产品的问题)。\n涉及到系统消息指令(System Message Instructions)、少量示例(Few-shot Examples)、采样方法(Top-p Sampling)和温度参数\n(Temperature Parameter)的应用。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 修改系统消息指令\n正确。系统消息指令是用于定义模型行为的核心配置项,可以明确告诉模型只回答关于Contoso产品的问题。这种方法直接且有效,\n符合题目要求和业务需求。\nB. 添加少量示例\n错误。少量示例(Few-shot Examples)通常用于提供上下文或示例以帮助模型理解任务,但它无法直接限制模型的回答范围,仅通\n过示例无法确保模型只回答关于Contoso产品的问题。\nC. 应用顶级采样\n错误。Top-p Sampling是一种生成式AI的采样方法,用于控制生成内容的随机性和多样性,但它与限制回答范围无关,无法满足题目\n要求。\nD. 增加温度参数的值\n错误。温度参数用于控制生成内容的随机性,增加温度会使模型生成的回答更加随机化,这与题目要求的“专注于回答关于Contoso\n产品的问题”相违背。\n3. 我选的答案\nA. 修改系统消息指令\n4. 官方答案\nA. 修改系统消息指令\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:系统消息指令是最直接、最有效的方法,可以明确限制模型的回答范围,符合题目要求和业务需求。","pageStart":65,"pageEnd":69,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-065.jpg","assets/pages/page-066.jpg","assets/pages/page-067.jpg","assets/pages/page-068.jpg","assets/pages/page-069.jpg"]},{"id":"q-29","number":29,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project.\nYou plan to build a customer support solution that contains an agent. The solution must meet the following requirements:\nProvide accurate, context-aware responses grounded in internal product documentation stored in Azure AI Search.\nRequire deep, multi-step reasoning across long contexts.\nGenerate detailed natural language responses.\nWhich type of model should you use to power the agent?","questionZh":"你有一个微软Foundry项目。\n你计划构建一个包含代理的客戶支持解决方案。该解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n提供基于存储在Azure AI Search中的内部产品文档的准确、上下文相关的响应。\n需要在⻓上下文中进行深度、多步骤推理。\n生成详细的自然语言响应。\n应该使用哪种类型的模型来支持代理?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"a multimodal model","zh":"多模态模型"},{"id":"B","en":"a small language model (SLM)","zh":"小型语言模型(SLM)"},{"id":"C","en":"a key phrase extraction model","zh":"关键短语提取模型"},{"id":"D","en":"a large language model (LLM)","zh":"大型语言模型(LLM)"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何选择适合的AI模型来满足特定的业务需求,尤其是基于Azure AI Search的解决方案。\n重点关注模型的能力,包括上下文理解、多步推理、自然语言生成等。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 多模态模型 (Multimodal model)\n多模态模型主要用于处理多种数据类型(如文本、图像、视频等)的输入和输出。\n题目中并未提到需要处理多模态数据,仅涉及文本和上下文推理,因此此选项不符合需求。\n错误原因:不适合单一文本处理场景。\nB. 小型语言模型 (Small Language Model, SLM)\n小型语言模型适合处理简单的文本任务,但在深度推理、⻓上下文理解和复杂自然语言生成方面能力有限。\n题目要求“深度、多步推理”和“详细自然语言生成”,小型语言模型无法满足这些需求。\n错误原因:功能不足,无法满足复杂任务需求。\nC. 关键短语提取模型 (Key Phrase Extraction Model)\n关键短语提取模型主要用于从文本中提取重要的关键词或短语,适合信息提取任务。\n题目要求的是上下文推理和自然语言生成,而非简单的关键词提取,因此此选项不符合需求。\n错误原因:功能单一,无法满足题目要求的复杂任务。\nD. 大型语言模型 (Large Language Model, LLM)\n大型语言模型(如GPT系列)擅⻓处理复杂的自然语言任务,包括上下文理解、多步推理和详细的自然语言生成。\n题目要求“准确、上下文相关的回答”、“深度推理”和“详细自然语言生成”,这些都是LLM的核心能力。\n正确原因:完全符合题目需求。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:D. 大型语言模型 (Large Language Model, LLM)\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:D. 大型语言模型 (Large Language Model, LLM)\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,均为D。\n原因分析:大型语言模型能够满足题目中所有的需求,包括上下文理解、多步推理和自然语言生成。\n没有发现官方答案错误的地方,因此无需重新思考。","pageStart":70,"pageEnd":71,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-070.jpg","assets/pages/page-071.jpg"]},{"id":"q-30","number":30,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a deployed ticket-triage agent.\nYou discover that sometimes the agent responds without calling any tools, even when a tool is required.\nYou need to ensure that the agent calls a tool during execution.\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, drag the appropriate values to the correct targets. Each value may be used once, more\nthan once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"拖放 -\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个已部署的票务分拣代理。\n您发现有时代理在需要工具时会在未调用任何工具的情况下响应。\n您需要确保代理在执行期间调用工具。\n您应该如何完成 Python 代码?要回答,请将适当的值拖到正确的目标位置。每个值可以使用一次、多次或完全不使用。您可能需要\n拖动拆分栏或滚动以查看内容。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:\"tool_choice\"","item2:\"required\""],"analysis":"官方答案：原 PDF 未提供可识别的 Correct Answer\n核验说明\nPDF 第 72-73 页的 Correct Answer 为空或未识别到选中项，因此没有足够依据生成官方答案。\n本题保留原题页供人工查看，不参与自动判分，请根据原题资料自行核验。","pageStart":72,"pageEnd":73,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-072.jpg","assets/pages/page-073.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Dictionary key","answer":"\"tool_choice\"","choices":["\"response_format\"","\"tool_choice\"","\"tools\"","\"type\""]},{"id":"item2","label":"Dictionary value","answer":"\"required\"","choices":["\"auto\"","\"required\""]}]},{"id":"q-31","number":31,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are building a web app named App1 that generates responses by using a model deployed to a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1.\nBefore sending the prompts to the model, App1 must retrieve documents by using Azure AI Search.\nYou need to integrate Project1 and App1. The solution must meet the following requirements:\nMultiple client applications must use the same search configuration.\nA security policy must prevent key-based authentication.\nAdministrative effort must be minimized.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您正在构建一个名为 App1 的 Web 应用程序,该应用程序通过使用部署到 Microsoft Foundry 项目 Project1 的模型生成响应。\n在将提示发送到模型之前,App1 必须使用 Azure AI Search 检索文档。\n您需要集成 Project1 和 App1。解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n多个客戶端应用程序必须使用相同的搜索配置。\n安全策略必须防止基于密钥的身份验证。\n管理工作量必须最小化。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Create a custom HTTP connection in Foundry and manually configure Azure AI Search endpoints per application.","zh":"在 Foundry 中创建一个自定义 HTTP 连接,并为每个应用程序手动配置 Azure AI Search 端点。"},{"id":"B","en":"Configure an Azure AI Search connection in Project1 and reference the connection in each application.","zh":"在 Project1 中配置 Azure AI Search 连接,并在每个应用程序中引用该连接。"},{"id":"C","en":"Call Azure AI Search directly from each application by using Microsoft Entra authentication.","zh":"通过使用 Microsoft Entra 身份验证直接从每个应用程序调用 Azure AI Search。"},{"id":"D","en":"Enable a managed identity for each application and call Azure AI Search directly.","zh":"为每个应用程序启用托管身份,并直接调用 Azure AI Search。"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure AI Search的集成与配置。\n如何使用安全认证(如托管身份或Microsoft Entra)来避免密钥认证。\n如何减少管理工作量并支持多个客戶端应用程序共享配置。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 创建一个自定义 HTTP 连接,并为每个应用程序手动配置 Azure AI Search 端点。\n错误:手动配置每个应用程序的端点会增加管理工作量,不符合“减少管理工作量”的要求。\n错误:此方法没有提到如何避免密钥认证,可能无法满足“安全策略禁止密钥认证”的要求。\nB. 在 Project1 中配置 Azure AI Search 连接,并在每个应用程序中引用该连接。\n正确:通过在Project1中配置连接,可以实现多个客戶端应用程序共享同一搜索配置,减少管理工作量。\n正确:此方法可以通过安全认证机制(如托管身份或Microsoft Entra)来避免密钥认证,符合安全策略要求。\nC. 通过使用 Microsoft Entra 身份验证直接从每个应用程序调用 Azure AI Search。\n错误:虽然Microsoft Entra身份验证可以避免密钥认证,但每个应用程序都需要单独配置搜索连接,增加了管理工作量。\n错误:此方法没有集中管理搜索配置,不符合“多个客戶端应用程序共享配置”的要求。\nD. 为每个应用程序启用托管身份,并直接调用 Azure AI Search。\n错误:托管身份可以避免密钥认证,但每个应用程序都需要单独配置搜索连接,增加了管理工作量。\n错误:此方法没有集中管理搜索配置,不符合“多个客戶端应用程序共享配置”的要求。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:B\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:B\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:选项B符合题目要求,能够实现多个客戶端应用程序共享搜索配置,减少管理工作量,并通过安全认证机制避免密钥认证。","pageStart":74,"pageEnd":75,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-074.jpg","assets/pages/page-075.jpg"]},{"id":"q-32","number":32,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent used by the financial analysts at your company.\nYou need to optimize the agent workflow by providing additional data access and processing capabilities. The solution must meet the following\nrequirements:\nEnsure that the agent can perform calculations during conversations.\nEnsure that the agent can access up-to-date information from public websites.\nEnsure that the agent can retrieve information from documents uploaded directly to the agent.\nWhat should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate tools to the correct requirements. Each tool may be used once, more\nthan once, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"拖放 -\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个供公司财务分析师使用的代理。\n您需要通过提供额外的数据访问和处理能力来优化代理的工作流程。解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n确保代理可以在对话期间执行计算。\n确保代理可以从公共网站访问最新信息。\n确保代理可以从直接上传到代理的文档中检索信息。\n对于每个要求,您应该使用什么?要回答,请将适当的工具拖到正确的要求中。每个工具可以使用一次、多次或不使用。您可能需\n要拖动拆分栏或滚动以查看内容。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Grounding with Bing Search","item2:Code interpreter","item3:File search"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何为微软Foundry项目中的智能代理优化工作流,涉及到数据访问、处理能力以及与外部资源的集成。\n重点知识点包括:计算能力、实时信息获取能力、文件处理能力。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nCode interpreter: 适用于执行复杂计算和数据处理任务,因此可以用于“Perform calculations during conversations”。\nComputer use: 通常指代理能够使用计算机资源,但不具体指代某种功能,无法满足题目中的具体需求。\nFile search: 适用于从上传的文件中检索信息,因此可以用于“Retrieve information from documents uploaded directly to the agent”。\nGrounding with Bing Search: 适用于从公共网站获取实时信息,因此可以用于“Access up-to-date information from public websites”。\nMicrosoft Fabric: 是一个数据分析和集成平台,但不直接适用于题目中的具体需求。\n3. 我的答案\nAccess up-to-date information from public websites: Grounding with Bing Search\nPerform calculations during conversations: Code interpreter\nRetrieve information from documents uploaded directly to the agent: File search\n4. 官方答案\nAccess up-to-date information from public websites: Grounding with Bing Search\nPerform calculations during conversations: Code interpreter\nRetrieve information from documents uploaded directly to the agent: File search\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n原因分析:官方答案正确地匹配了工具与需求,符合题目要求。","pageStart":76,"pageEnd":77,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-076.jpg","assets/pages/page-077.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Access up-to-date information from public websites:","answer":"Grounding with Bing Search","choices":["Code interpreter","Computer use","File search","Grounding with Bing Search","Microsoft Fabric"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Perform calculations during conversations:","answer":"Code interpreter","choices":["Code interpreter","Computer use","File search","Grounding with Bing Search","Microsoft Fabric"]},{"id":"item3","label":"Retrieve information from documents uploaded directly to the agent:","answer":"File search","choices":["Code interpreter","Computer use","File search","Grounding with Bing Search","Microsoft Fabric"]}]},{"id":"q-33","number":33,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"multiple","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a prompt agent used by a customer support web app.\nThe agent is invoked from a Python service that does NOT run in the Foundry portal.\nYou need to implement end-to-end tracing to capture latency breakdowns and exceptions across agent runs.\nWhich two components can you use? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"你有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个由客戶支持 Web 应用程序使用的提示代理。\n该代理从一个未在 Foundry ⻔戶中运行的 Python 服务中调用。\n你需要实施端到端跟踪,以捕获代理运行过程中的延迟分解和异常。\n以下两个组件可以使用?每个正确答案都提供了一个完整的解决方案。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[{"id":"A","en":"a Log Analytics workspace\na Log Analytics workspace","zh":""},{"id":"B","en":"Application Insights\nApplication Insights","zh":""},{"id":"C","en":"OpenTelemetry\nOpenTelemetry","zh":""},{"id":"D","en":"the Azure Monitor Agent\nthe Azure Monitor Agent","zh":""},{"id":"E","en":"Microsoft Sentinel\nMicrosoft Sentinel","zh":""}],"answer":["B","C"],"analysis":"正确答案:BC\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在Microsoft Foundry项目中实现端到端的性能追踪和异常捕获,涉及Azure监控工具的选择和使用。\n重点知识点包括:Azure Monitor、Application Insights、OpenTelemetry等工具的功能和适用场景。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nA. Log Analytics workspace\nLog Analytics workspace是Azure Monitor的一部分,用于存储和查询日志数据。虽然它可以存储日志,但它本身并不直接提供端到端的\n性能追踪功能。因此,这个选项不适合用于实现端到端追踪。\n错误原因:仅用于日志存储和查询,不直接支持性能追踪和异常捕获。\nB. Application Insights\nApplication Insights是Azure Monitor的一部分,专⻔用于应用性能管理(APM)。它可以捕获请求的性能数据、异常、依赖项调用等,\n是实现端到端追踪的核心工具。\n正确原因:提供端到端性能追踪和异常捕获功能,适合本题场景。\nC. OpenTelemetry\nOpenTelemetry是一个开源框架,用于分布式追踪和指标收集。它可以与Application Insights集成,帮助实现端到端追踪。它是一个重\n要的组件,尤其是在非Azure环境中运行的服务中。\n正确原因:支持分布式追踪,适合跨平台和跨服务的性能监控。\nD. Azure Monitor Agent\nAzure Monitor Agent用于收集虚拟机和容器的指标和日志,但它主要用于基础设施监控,而不是应用级的端到端追踪。\n错误原因:主要用于基础设施监控,不适合本题场景。\nE. Microsoft Sentinel\nMicrosoft Sentinel是一个SIEM(安全信息和事件管理)工具,主要用于安全事件的监控和响应,而不是性能追踪。\n错误原因:专注于安全监控,与性能追踪无关。\n3. 我的选择\n正确答案: B. Application Insights 和 C. OpenTelemetry\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案: B. Application Insights 和 C. OpenTelemetry\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:Application Insights和OpenTelemetry是实现端到端追踪的最佳组合,分别提供应用性能管理和分布式追踪功能,完全符合\n题目要求。","pageStart":78,"pageEnd":79,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-078.jpg","assets/pages/page-079.jpg"]},{"id":"q-34","number":34,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a customer support agent that uses the Microsoft Foundry Agent Service.\nSometimes, customers return to a session days later to continue the same support case, and the agent must resume with the full historical\ncontext. The agent must provide the following:\nMulti-turn continuity within the session\nCross-session continuity for the same case\nAccess to the full interaction history, including user messages, agent messages, tool calls, and tool outputs\nYou need to ensure that the agent automatically reloads the complete history on each new turn.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您有一个客戶支持代理使用 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service。\n有时,客戶会在几天后返回会话以继续同一个支持案例,代理必须在完整的历史背景下继续处理。代理必须提供以下内容:\n会话内的多轮连续性\n同一案例的跨会话连续性\n访问完整的交互历史记录,包括用戶消息、代理消息、工具调用和工具输出\n您需要确保代理在每次新轮次时自动重新加载完整的历史记录。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Create and reuse a conversation by storing the conversation’s ID and supplying the ID on subsequent requests.","zh":"通过存储会话的 ID 并在后续请求中提供该 ID 来创建和重用会话。"},{"id":"B","en":"Persist only the final model response stored in the client application and prepend the response to future prompts.","zh":"仅在客戶端应用程序中存储最终的模型响应,并将响应添加到未来的提示中。"},{"id":"C","en":"Enable memory summarization on the agent definition to persist the context automatically.","zh":"在代理定义上启用内存摘要以自动持久化上下文。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"正确答案:A\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在微软 Foundry Agent Service 中实现会话的多轮连续性和跨会话连续性。\n重点在于如何保存和恢复会话历史,以确保用戶和代理之间的交互能够无缝延续。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nA. Create and reuse a conversation by storing the conversation’s ID and supplying the ID on subsequent requests.\n此选项建议通过存储会话 ID 并在后续请求中提供该 ID 来实现会话的连续性。\n这种方法确实可以实现跨会话的连续性,因为会话 ID 可以用来标识和恢复特定的会话历史。\n此外,微软 Foundry Agent Service 支持通过会话 ID 来管理和恢复会话,因此此选项是正确的。\nB. Persist only the final model response stored in the client application and prepend the response to future prompts.\n此选项建议仅存储最终的模型响应,并将其添加到未来的提示中。\n这种方法无法实现完整的会话历史恢复,因为它只保存了最终的响应,而不是整个交互历史(包括用戶消息、代理消息、工具调用\n等)。\n因此,此选项是错误的。\nC. Enable memory summarization on the agent definition to persist the context automatically.\n此选项建议通过启用内存摘要来自动持久化上下文。\n虽然内存摘要可以帮助减少上下文的大小,但它并不能保证完整的交互历史被保存和恢复,尤其是跨会话的连续性。\n因此,此选项是错误的。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:A\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:A\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,都是A。\n原因是选项 A 提供了一个明确的方法来实现跨会话的连续性,并且符合微软 Foundry Agent Service 的设计逻辑。\n选项 B 和 C 无法满足题目中提到的“访问完整交互历史”的需求,因此它们是错误的。","pageStart":80,"pageEnd":81,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-080.jpg","assets/pages/page-081.jpg"]},{"id":"q-35","number":35,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a deployed chat model.\nYou have a Python service that sends API requests to the model. The service is integrated with an automated validation system that compares\ngenerated outputs against approved response patterns.\nStakeholders report that small wording differences are causing validation mismatches.\nYou need to update the request parameters to improve output stability. The solution must maximize reasoning quality.\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个已部署的聊天模型。\n您有一个 Python 服务,该服务向模型发送 API 请求。该服务与一个自动验证系统集成,该系统将生成的输出与批准的响应模式进行\n比较。\n利益相关者报告说,细微的措辞差异导致了验证不匹配。\n您需要更新请求参数以提高输出稳定性。解决方案必须最大化推理质量。\n您应该如何完成 Python 代码?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:1","item2:high"],"analysis":"官方答案：temperature: 1；output_config: high\n答案核验\nPDF 第 82-83 页的官方答案如上。\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与官方答案存在冲突。本题按 PDF 官方答案进行自评。\n\n英文版交叉核验\n英文版讨论认为 temperature=0 更有利于稳定输出。微软 Learn 说明推理模型不支持 temperature；对普通聊天模型，较低 temperature 通常更集中、更稳定。因此 temperature=1 不是普遍的稳定性最优值。考试官方答案仍保留 temperature: 1、output_config: high。","pageStart":82,"pageEnd":83,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-082.jpg","assets/pages/page-083.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"temperature","answer":"1","choices":["0","1","2"]},{"id":"item2","label":"output_config","answer":"high","choices":["high","low","medium"]}]},{"id":"q-36","number":36,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a chat app in a Microsoft Foundry project and an Azure AI Search vectorized index.\nYou need to connect to the index to meet the following requirements:\nComplex questions must retrieve information from multiple chunks.\nMulti-turn conversations must influence retrieval planning.\nRetrievals must run in parallel to reduce latency.\nWhich retrieval approach should you use?","questionZh":"你在一个微软Foundry项目中有一个聊天应用和一个Azure AI Search向量化索引。\n你需要连接到该索引以满足以下要求:\n复杂问题必须从多个块中检索信息。\n多轮对话必须影响检索规划。\n检索必须并行运行以减少延迟。\n你应该使用哪种检索方法?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"iterative retrieval","zh":"迭代检索"},{"id":"B","en":"agentic Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)","zh":"代理型检索增强生成(RAG)"},{"id":"C","en":"chain of thought","zh":"思维链"},{"id":"D","en":"classic Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)","zh":"经典检索增强生成(RAG)"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是在使用Azure AI Search和向量化索引时,如何选择合适的检索方法以满足特定的需求。\n重点关注检索方法的特点,包括复杂问题的处理、多轮对话的影响、并行检索的能力等。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. iterative retrieval(迭代检索)\n迭代检索通常用于逐步优化检索结果,通过多轮查询逐步改进答案。\n虽然它可以处理复杂问题,但它的检索过程是串行的,无法满足“检索必须并行以减少延迟”的要求。\n因此,此选项错误。\nB. agentic Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)(代理型检索增强生成)\n代理型RAG是一种高级检索方法,能够动态调整检索策略,适应复杂问题和多轮对话的需求。\n它支持并行检索,从而减少延迟,符合题目要求。\n因此,此选项正确。\nC. chain of thought(思维链)\n思维链是一种推理方法,通常用于生成复杂答案,但它并不是一种检索方法。\n它无法直接满足题目中关于检索的要求,例如并行检索和多轮对话的影响。\n因此,此选项错误。\nD. classic Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)(经典检索增强生成)\n经典RAG是一种常⻅的检索增强生成方法,能够处理复杂问题,但它通常是基于静态检索策略。\n它不具备动态调整检索策略的能力,无法很好地处理多轮对话的影响。\n此外,经典RAG的检索过程通常是串行的,无法满足并行检索的要求。\n因此,此选项错误。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:B. agentic Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:B. agentic Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因是agentic RAG能够动态调整检索策略,支持复杂问题的处理、多轮对话的影响以及并行检索,完全符合题目要求。","pageStart":84,"pageEnd":85,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-084.jpg","assets/pages/page-085.jpg"]},{"id":"q-37","number":37,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou need to recommend a plan to create a customer support agent by using the Microsoft Foundry Agent Service. The agent must meet the\nfollowing requirements:\nRetain user preferences across multiple conversations.\nEnable users to provide contextual grounding by directly uploading documents during a chat.\nWhich Foundry capability should you recommend for each requirement? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您需要推荐一个计划,通过使用 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service 创建一个客戶支持代理。该代理必须满足以下要求:\n在多次对话中保留用戶偏好。\n允许用戶在聊天过程中直接上传文档以提供上下文依据。\n对于每个要求,您应该推荐哪种 Foundry 功能?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Agent memory that uses persistent storage","item2:File search tool"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n如何使用 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service 的功能来实现特定需求。\n考察对 Agent memory、文件搜索工具等 Foundry 功能的理解和应用。\n2. 独立分析与选项解析\n第一部分:Retain user preferences across conversations\nAgent memory that uses persistent storage: 这是正确的选项。Agent memory 使用持久存储可以保存用戶偏好,并在后续会话中继续使\n用这些信息。这是实现跨会话用戶偏好保留的最佳方式。\nConversation history: 虽然会话历史可以记录用戶的交互,但它通常是临时的,无法持久保存用戶偏好,因此不适合用于跨会话的用\n戶偏好保留。\nOrchestration-managed session context: 这个选项主要用于管理单次会话的上下文,而不是跨会话的用戶偏好保留,因此不符合题目\n要求。\n第二部分:Enable users to provide contextual grounding during chats\nAzure AI Search tool: 这个工具主要用于搜索和查询现有的知识库或文档,但它不支持用戶直接上传文档并进行上下文绑定,因此不\n符合题目要求。\nCode interpreter tool: 这个工具用于代码解释和执行,与用戶上传文档并进行上下文绑定无关,因此不符合题目要求。\nFile search tool: 这是正确的选项。File search tool 支持用戶直接上传文档,并在聊天中使用这些文档进行上下文绑定,完全符合题目\n要求。\n3. 我的答案\nRetain user preferences across conversations: Agent memory that uses persistent storage\nEnable users to provide contextual grounding during chats: File search tool\n4. 官方答案\nRetain user preferences across conversations: Agent memory that uses persistent storage\nEnable users to provide contextual grounding during chats: File search tool\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案完全一致。\n原因分析:官方答案正确地选择了能够实现题目要求的功能,符合 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service 的设计逻辑。","pageStart":86,"pageEnd":87,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-086.jpg","assets/pages/page-087.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Retain preferences","answer":"Agent memory that uses persistent storage","choices":["Agent memory that uses persistent storage","Conversation history","Orchestration-managed session context"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Contextual grounding","answer":"File search tool","choices":["Azure AI Search tool","Code interpreter tool","File search tool"]}]},{"id":"q-38","number":38,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent generates summaries from retrieved policy documents.\nYou need to improve response completeness. The solution must be implemented in the logic of the application code before responses are\nreturned.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理从检索到的政策文件中生成摘要。\n你需要提高响应的完整性。解决方案必须在应用程序代码的逻辑中实现,然后再返回响应。\n你应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Add a retry evaluation before the responses are returned.","zh":"在返回响应之前添加重试评估。"},{"id":"B","en":"Decrease the value of the max_tokens parameter.","zh":"减少 max_tokens 参数的值。"},{"id":"C","en":"Switch to Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG).","zh":"切换到检索增强生成 (RAG)。"},{"id":"D","en":"Replace the model with a smaller deployment.","zh":"用较小的部署替换模型。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"正确答案:A\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何优化生成式AI的响应完整性,涉及到模型参数调整、生成逻辑优化以及检索增强生成(RAG)的应用。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Add a retry evaluation before the responses are returned. 在返回响应之前添加重试评估。\n分析:重试评估可以在生成的响应不完整或质量不高时重新尝试生成。这种方法可以提高响应的完整性,但它依赖于逻辑代码的实\n现,并且可能增加响应时间。此选项是合理的解决方案。\nB. Decrease the value of the max_tokens parameter. 减少 max_tokens 参数的值。\n分析:减少 max_tokens 参数的值会限制生成的文本⻓度,可能导致响应更加不完整。因此,这个选项不适合解决响应完整性问题。\nC. Switch to Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG). 切换到检索增强生成 (RAG)。\n分析:RAG是一种结合检索和生成的技术,可以显著提高生成内容的准确性和完整性。然而,切换到RAG需要对系统架构进行较大的\n改动,可能不符合题目要求的“在逻辑代码中实现”的条件。因此,这个选项虽然有效,但不完全符合题目要求。\nD. Replace the model with a smaller deployment. 用较小的部署替换模型。\n分析:使用较小的模型通常会降低生成质量和响应完整性,因此这个选项不适合解决问题。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:A\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:A\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:添加重试评估是一个直接且有效的解决方案,可以在逻辑代码中实现,并且符合题目要求。","pageStart":88,"pageEnd":89,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-088.jpg","assets/pages/page-089.jpg"]},{"id":"q-39","number":39,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a customer support agent built by using the Microsoft Foundry Agent Service. The agent calls an Azure OpenAI model deployment.\nDuring load testing, calls intermittently fail and return an HTTP 429 rate limit exceeded error.\nYou need to handle throttling to reduce call failures and improve reliability under load. The solution must remain within the service and model\nlimits.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您有一个使用 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service 构建的客戶支持代理。该代理调用了一个 Azure OpenAI 模型部署。\n在负载测试期间,调用会间歇性失败,并返回 HTTP 429 速率限制超出错误。\n您需要处理限流问题,以减少调用失败并在负载下提高可靠性。解决方案必须保持在服务和模型限制范围内。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Create a new thread and retry the calls immediately.","zh":"创建一个新线程并立即重试调用。"},{"id":"B","en":"Reduce the number of registered tools.","zh":"减少注册工具的数量。"},{"id":"C","en":"Implement a retry policy that uses exponential backoff and jitter.","zh":"实施使用指数退避和抖动的重试策略。"},{"id":"D","en":"Spit uploaded content into smaller files.","zh":"将上传的内容拆分成更小的文件。"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"正确答案:C\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何处理 Azure OpenAI 服务中的 HTTP 429 错误(Rate Limit Exceeded),即在高负载情况下如何实现可靠性和减少调用\n失败。\n重点知识点包括:重试策略、指数退避、抖动机制,以及如何优化服务调用以避免超出限制。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 创建一个新线程并立即重试调用\n分析:创建新线程并立即重试调用可能会加剧负载问题,因为它没有解决根本问题(服务的速率限制)。这种方法可能导致更多的\nHTTP 429 错误,甚至可能触发服务的进一步限制。因此此选项错误。\nB. 减少注册工具的数量\n分析:减少注册工具的数量可能会降低服务的复杂性,但与解决 HTTP 429 错误无直接关系。此选项没有针对性地解决问题,因此错\n误。\nC. 实施使用指数退避和抖动的重试策略\n分析:指数退避和抖动是处理速率限制的最佳实践。指数退避可以逐步增加重试间隔时间,避免频繁重试导致服务压力过大;抖动\n可以引入随机性,减少多个请求同时重试的可能性。这种方法有效解决了 HTTP 429 错误,因此正确。\nD. 将上传的内容拆分成更小的文件\n分析:拆分文件可能对某些场景有帮助(例如上传大文件时),但与解决 HTTP 429 错误无直接关系。此选项没有针对性地解决问\n题,因此错误。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:C\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:C\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:指数退避和抖动是处理速率限制的最佳实践,能够有效减少调用失败并提高服务可靠性。","pageStart":90,"pageEnd":91,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-090.jpg","assets/pages/page-091.jpg"]},{"id":"q-40","number":40,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nYou use a GitHub Actions workflow for CI/CD.\nYou need to configure the workflow to automatically evaluate the agent when a pull request (PR) is created and prevent branches from merging if\nthe evaluation results do NOT meet the defined thresholds.\nHow should you configure the workflow? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点 -\n您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n您使用 GitHub Actions 工作流进行 CI/CD。\n您需要配置工作流,以便在创建拉取请求 (PR) 时自动评估代理,并在评估结果未达到定义的阈值时阻止分支合并。\n您应该如何配置工作流?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:An Azure Login action that uses OpenID Connect (OIDC)","item2:Fail"],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n如何在GitHub Actions中配置CI/CD工作流以评估Microsoft Foundry项目中的代理。\n如何使用身份验证方法(如PAT、用戶分配的托管身份或OIDC)进行安全集成。\n如何处理评估结果不符合阈值的情况(例如锁定分支、发送警报或失败)。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nAuthentication method:\nA personal access token (PAT): 虽然PAT可以用于身份验证,但它的安全性较低,尤其是在自动化工作流中使用时。OIDC是更现代化、\n更安全的选择。\nA user-assigned managed identity: 这是Azure中的一种身份验证方法,但它通常用于Azure资源之间的身份验证,而不是GitHub Actions\n工作流中。此选项不适合此场景。\nAn Azure Login action that uses OpenID Connect (OIDC): OIDC是一种现代化的身份验证协议,GitHub Actions支持与Azure集成时使用OIDC\n进行安全登录。此选项是最佳选择。\nIf the evaluation results are NOT met, configure the workflow to:\nLock the target branch: 锁定分支虽然可以阻止进一步的更改,但它并不是标准的CI/CD工作流中处理失败评估的方式。\nSend an alert: 发送警报可以通知相关人员,但它不能直接阻止分支合并,因此不符合题目要求。\nFail: 配置工作流失败是最直接的方式,可以阻止分支合并并确保代码质量符合要求。此选项是最佳选择。\n3. 我的答案\nAuthentication method: An Azure Login action that uses OpenID Connect (OIDC)\nIf the evaluation results are NOT met, configure the workflow to: Fail\n4. 官方答案\nAuthentication method: An Azure Login action that uses OpenID Connect (OIDC)\nIf the evaluation results are NOT met, configure the workflow to: Fail\n5. 比较与分析\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:OIDC是GitHub Actions与Azure集成时的推荐身份验证方法,Fail是最符合题目要求的处理方式。","pageStart":92,"pageEnd":93,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-092.jpg","assets/pages/page-093.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Authentication","answer":"An Azure Login action that uses OpenID Connect (OIDC)","choices":["A personal access token (PAT)","A user-assigned managed identity","An Azure Login action that uses OpenID Connect (OIDC)"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Evaluation not met","answer":"Fail","choices":["Lock the target branch","Send an alert","Fail"]}]},{"id":"q-41","number":41,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"Note: This section contains one or more sets of questions with the same scenario and problem. Each question presents a unique solution to the\nproblem. You must determine whether the solution meets the stated goals. More than one solution in the set might solve the problem. It is also\npossible that none of the solutions in the set solve the problem.\nAfter you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return. As a result, these questions do not appear on the Review Screen.\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent generates summaries from retrieved policy documents.\nUsers report that some responses omit required regulatory clauses, even when the clauses are present in the retrieved content.\nYou need to improve response completeness.\nSolution: You increase the value of the max_tokens parameter.\nDoes this meet the goal?","questionZh":"注意:本节包含一个或多个具有相同场景和问题的题目集。每个题目为问题提供一个独特的解决方案。您必须确定该解决方案是否\n满足所述目标。题目集中可能有多个解决方案可以解决问题,也可能没有任何解决方案可以解决问题。\n在您回答本节中的问题后,您将无法返回。因此,这些问题不会出现在审查屏幕上。\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个代理。该代理从检索到的政策文件中生成摘要。\n用戶报告称,一些响应遗漏了所需的法规条款,即使这些条款存在于检索到的内容中。\n您需要改进响应的完整性。\n解决方案:您增加了 max_tokens 参数的值。\n这是否满足目标?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","zh":"是"},{"id":"B","en":"No","zh":"否"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何优化AI模型生成的文本内容,特别是通过调整参数(如max_tokens)来改善生成结果的完整性。\n涉及到OpenAI或类似语言模型的参数设置及其对生成内容的影响。\n2. 独立分析与思考\nmax_tokens参数用于控制生成文本的最大⻓度。如果设置的值过低,可能导致生成的文本被截断,从而遗漏重要信息。\n然而,问题描述中提到“某些响应遗漏了必要的法规条款,即使这些条款存在于检索内容中”,这表明问题可能与模型的内容选择或\n生成逻辑有关,而不是简单的文本⻓度限制。\n单纯增加max_tokens的值可能会让生成的文本更⻓,但并不能保证遗漏的法规条款会被包含在生成结果中。\n3. 选项分析\nA. Yes 是: 选择此项意味着认为增加max_tokens可以解决问题。但实际上,问题的根源在于模型的内容选择逻辑,而不是文本⻓度限\n制。因此此选项错误。\nB. No 否: 选择此项意味着认为增加max_tokens不能解决问题。根据问题描述和max_tokens的功能,此选项正确。\n4. 我的答案\n答案:B\n5. 官方答案\n官方答案:B\n6. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致,均为B。\n原因分析:问题的根源在于模型的内容选择逻辑,而不是文本⻓度限制。增加max_tokens无法解决遗漏法规条款的问题。","pageStart":94,"pageEnd":95,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-094.jpg","assets/pages/page-095.jpg"]},{"id":"q-42","number":42,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"Note: This section contains one or more sets of questions with the same scenario and problem. Each question presents a unique solution to the\nproblem. You must determine whether the solution meets the stated goals. More than one solution in the set might solve the problem. It is also\npossible that none of the solutions in the set solve the problem.\nAfter you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return. As a result, these questions do not appear on the Review Screen.\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent generates summaries from retrieved policy documents.\nUsers report that some responses omit required regulatory clauses, even when the clauses are present in the retrieved content.\nYou need to improve response completeness.\nSolution: You add a reflection pass that regenerates the response if the required clauses are missing.\nDoes this meet the goal?","questionZh":"注意:本节包含一个或多个具有相同场景和问题的题目集。每个题目为问题提供一个独特的解决方案。您必须确定该解决方案是否\n满足所述目标。题目集中可能有多个解决方案可以解决问题,也可能没有任何解决方案可以解决问题。\n在您回答本节中的问题后,您将无法返回。因此,这些问题不会出现在“审查屏幕”上。\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个代理。该代理从检索到的政策文档中生成摘要。\n用戶报告说,即使检索内容中存在所需的法规条款,某些响应仍然遗漏了这些条款。\n您需要改进响应的完整性。\n解决方案:您添加一个反思过程,如果缺少所需条款,则重新生成响应。\n此解决方案是否满足目标?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","zh":"是"},{"id":"B","en":"No","zh":"否"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"正确答案:A\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何提高AI生成内容的完整性,尤其是在处理政策文件时确保包含所有必要的法规条款。\n涉及的知识点包括:自然语言处理(NLP)、内容生成的质量控制、反射机制(Reflection Pass)等。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Yes 是\n分析:添加反射机制(Reflection Pass)可以有效地检查生成的内容是否遗漏了关键条款,并在必要时重新生成响应。这种方法直接\n解决了问题中提到的“遗漏法规条款”的问题,因此是一个合理的解决方案。\nB. No 否\n分析:如果不添加反射机制,问题中提到的遗漏法规条款问题将无法得到解决。因此,选择“否”是不正确的。\n3. 我的答案\n我的答案是:A\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:A\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致,都是A。\n原因:添加反射机制是解决问题的直接且有效的方法,符合题目要求。","pageStart":96,"pageEnd":97,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-096.jpg","assets/pages/page-097.jpg"]},{"id":"q-43","number":43,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"Note: This section contains one or more sets of questions with the same scenario and problem. Each question presents a unique solution to the\nproblem. You must determine whether the solution meets the stated goals. More than one solution in the set might solve the problem. It is also\npossible that none of the solutions in the set solve the problem.\nAfter you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return. As a result, these questions do not appear on the Review Screen.\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent generates summaries from retrieved policy documents.\nUsers report that some responses omit required regulatory clauses, even when the clauses are present in the retrieved content.\nYou need to improve response completeness.\nSolution: You increase the value of the temperature parameter.\nDoes this meet the goal?","questionZh":"注意:本节包含一个或多个具有相同场景和问题的题目集。每个题目为问题提供一个独特的解决方案。您必须确定该解决方案是否\n满足所述目标。题目集中可能有多个解决方案可以解决问题,也可能没有任何解决方案可以解决问题。\n在回答本节中的问题后,您将无法返回。因此,这些问题不会出现在审查屏幕上。\n您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理从检索到的政策文档中生成摘要。\n用戶报告说,一些响应遗漏了所需的法规条款,即使这些条款在检索到的内容中存在。\n您需要改进响应的完整性。\n解决方案:您增加了温度参数的值。\n这是否满足目标?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","zh":"是"},{"id":"B","en":"No","zh":"否"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是对AI模型参数的理解,尤其是“temperature”参数的作用。\n“temperature”参数用于控制生成文本的随机性。较低的值会使生成的文本更确定性,较高的值会增加随机性。\n题目要求解决的是“提高响应的完整性”,即确保生成的内容包含所有必要的条款。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Yes 是\n增加“temperature”参数的值会使生成的文本更加随机化,但这并不能保证生成的内容更完整。\n事实上,增加随机性可能会导致生成的内容更加不确定,甚至遗漏更多的必要条款。\n因此,选择“是”并不能解决问题。\nB. No 否\n“temperature”参数的调整与提高响应的完整性无直接关系。\n解决问题的关键在于改进模型的训练数据或使用更精确的生成策略,而不是简单地调整随机性参数。\n因此,选择“否”是正确的。\n3. 我的答案\n答案:B\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:B\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,均为“B”。\n原因分析:增加“temperature”参数的值无法解决问题,反而可能导致生成内容更加不确定,进一步降低响应的完整性。\n因此,无需重新思考,答案正确。","pageStart":98,"pageEnd":99,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-098.jpg","assets/pages/page-099.jpg"]},{"id":"q-44","number":44,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"Note: This section contains one or more sets of questions with the same scenario and problem. Each question presents a unique solution to the\nproblem. You must determine whether the solution meets the stated goals. More than one solution in the set might solve the problem. It is also\npossible that none of the solutions in the set solve the problem.\nAfter you answer a question in this section, you will NOT be able to return. As a result, these questions do not appear on the Review Screen.\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent generates summaries from retrieved policy documents.\nUsers report that some responses omit required regulatory clauses, even when the clauses are present in the retrieved content.\nYou need to improve response completeness.\nSolution: You run an evaluation flow that scores responses for completeness and blocks responses that fall below a defined threshold.\nDoes this meet the goal?","questionZh":"注意:本部分包含一个或多个具有相同场景和问题的题目集。每个题目为问题提供一个独特的解决方案。您必须确定该解决方案是\n否满足所述目标。题目集中可能有多个解决方案可以解决问题,也有可能没有任何解决方案可以解决问题。\n在回答本部分中的问题后,您将无法返回。因此,这些问题不会出现在审查屏幕上。\n您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理从检索到的政策文档中生成摘要。\n用戶报告称,一些响应遗漏了所需的法规条款,即使这些条款存在于检索到的内容中。\n您需要改进响应的完整性。\n解决方案:您运行一个评估流程,对响应的完整性进行评分,并阻止低于定义阈值的响应。\n此解决方案是否满足目标?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Yes","zh":"是"},{"id":"B","en":"No","zh":"否"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何提高AI生成内容的完整性,尤其是在内容生成过程中确保包含所有必要的条款或信息。\n涉及到AI模型的评估与优化,特别是通过评分机制来提高生成内容的质量。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Yes 是\n运行一个评估流程并对生成的响应进行评分,确实可以帮助识别不完整的响应。\n然而,仅仅阻止低分响应并不能直接解决问题,因为这并没有改进生成内容的逻辑或模型本身。问题的根源在于模型生成内容时遗\n漏了必要的条款,而不是评分机制本身。\n因此,这种方法虽然可以筛选出不合格的响应,但并不能从根本上解决问题。\nB. No 否\n阻止低分响应并不能直接提高生成内容的完整性,因为它没有解决模型生成内容时遗漏条款的根本问题。\n要解决问题,需要对模型进行优化,例如调整训练数据、改进生成逻辑或引入更严格的内容检查机制,而不是仅仅依赖评分和阻止\n机制。\n因此,选择“否”是正确的,因为该解决方案并未完全满足目标要求。\n3. 我的答案\n答案:B. No 否\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:B. No 否\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致,均为B。\n原因是该解决方案虽然可以筛选出不完整的响应,但并未从根本上解决生成内容遗漏条款的问题。","pageStart":100,"pageEnd":101,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-100.jpg","assets/pages/page-101.jpg"]},{"id":"q-45","number":45,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are creating an image-editing workflow in a Microsoft Foundry project.\nThe workflow must meet the following requirements:\nEnsure that background objects can be removed by applying a mask-based inpainting edit.\nPreserve the original lighting and style of the edited images.\nUse the built-in image editing controls, NOT a custom model.\nYou need to ensure that image edits apply exclusively inside the masked area.\nHow should you configure the workflow?","questionZh":"您正在为一个微软Foundry项目创建图像编辑工作流程。\n该工作流程必须满足以下要求:\n确保可以通过应用基于遮罩的修复编辑来移除背景对象。\n保留编辑图像的原始光照和⻛格。\n使用内置的图像编辑控件,而不是自定义模型。\n您需要确保图像编辑仅应用于遮罩区域内。\n您应该如何配置工作流程?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Set generation mode to image_variation and provide the original image as a reference.","zh":"将生成模式设置为image_variation,并提供原始图像作为参考。"},{"id":"B","en":"Enable text_to_image mode and a prompt describing the desired background removal.","zh":"启用text_to_image模式,并提供描述所需背景移除的提示。"},{"id":"C","en":"Enable image_to_image mode and a high-strength value to regenerate the full image based on the prompt.","zh":"启用image_to_image模式,并设置高强度值以根据提示重新生成完整图像。"},{"id":"D","en":"Enable mask_inpainting and supply both the input image and a mask indicating which part of the image to modify.","zh":"启用mask_inpainting,并提供输入图像以及指示图像中需要修改部分的遮罩。"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是微软AI服务中图像编辑功能的使用,特别是如何使用内置的图像编辑模式(如mask_inpainting)来满足特定的图像处理\n需求。\n重点在于理解不同模式(image_variation、text_to_image、image_to_image、mask_inpainting)的用途及适用场景。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Set generation mode to image_variation and provide the original image as a reference.\n分析:image_variation模式用于生成与原始图像⻛格相似的变体,但它无法针对特定区域进行编辑,也无法满足“仅在遮罩区域内编\n辑”的要求。\n结论:错误。\nB. Enable text_to_image mode and a prompt describing the desired background removal.\n分析:text_to_image模式用于根据文本提示生成全新的图像,而不是编辑现有图像。它无法满足“保留原始光照和⻛格”的要求。\n结论:错误。\nC. Enable image_to_image mode and a high-strength value to regenerate the full image based on the prompt.\n分析:image_to_image模式可以基于输入图像和提示生成新的图像,但高强度值会导致图像完全重新生成,无法满足“仅在遮罩区域\n内编辑”的要求。\n结论:错误。\nD. Enable mask_inpainting and supply both the input image and a mask indicating which part of the image to modify.\n分析:mask_inpainting模式专⻔用于在遮罩区域内进行图像编辑,同时保留未遮罩区域的原始光照和⻛格。这完全符合题目要求。\n结论:正确。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:D\n4. 官方答案\n答案:D\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:mask_inpainting模式是唯一能够满足题目所有要求的选项,包括“仅在遮罩区域内编辑”、“保留原始光照和⻛格”,以及使用内\n置图像编辑功能。","pageStart":102,"pageEnd":103,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-102.jpg","assets/pages/page-103.jpg"]},{"id":"q-46","number":46,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that generates product marketing images from text prompts.\nAfter publishing several images, the legal team at your company identifies a competitor’s logo on a sign in the background of an image.\nYou need to remove only the logo, while preserving the rest of the image.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"你有一个微软Foundry项目,可以根据文本提示生成产品营销图片。\n在发布了几张图片后,你公司的法律团队在一张图片的背景中发现了竞争对手的标志。\n你需要仅移除标志,同时保留图片的其他部分。\n你应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Apply a mask-based inpainting edit to the part of the image that contains the logo.","zh":"对包含标志的图片部分应用基于遮罩的修复编辑。"},{"id":"B","en":"Increase the prompt guidance strength.","zh":"增加提示指导强度。"},{"id":"C","en":"Modify the original prompt to exclude brand names.","zh":"修改原始提示以排除品牌名称。"},{"id":"D","en":"Rerun the prompt by using a different random seed.","zh":"使用不同的随机种子重新运行提示。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"正确答案:A\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是图像生成与编辑技术,特别是基于AI的图像修复(inpainting)技术的应用。\n重点在于如何使用遮罩技术对图像中的特定部分进行编辑,同时保留其他部分不受影响。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Apply a mask-based inpainting edit to the part of the image that contains the logo.\n基于遮罩的修复编辑是专⻔用于处理图像中某些特定区域的技术。通过遮罩,可以选择性地编辑图像中的某些部分,而不会影响其\n他部分。\n这种方法非常适合解决题目中提到的问题,即移除竞争对手的标志,同时保留图像的其他部分。\n此选项是正确的解决方案。\nB. Increase the prompt guidance strength.\n提示指导强度是用于控制生成图像与文本提示之间的匹配程度的参数。\n虽然增加提示指导强度可能会影响生成的图像质量,但它无法解决已经生成的图像中存在的竞争对手标志的问题。\n此选项与题目要求无关,因此是错误的。\nC. Modify the original prompt to exclude brand names.\n修改原始提示以排除品牌名称可以在未来生成图像时避免类似问题,但它无法解决已经生成的图像中存在的问题。\n此选项无法满足题目要求,因此是错误的。\nD. Rerun the prompt by using a different random seed.\n使用不同的随机种子重新运行提示可能会生成不同的图像,但它无法保证移除竞争对手的标志。\n此选项无法解决已经生成的图像中存在的问题,因此是错误的。\n3. 我的答案\n我选择的答案是:A\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:A\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因是基于遮罩的修复编辑是解决题目中问题的最佳方法,可以选择性地移除图像中的特定部分(竞争对手的标志),同时保留其他\n部分不受影响。","pageStart":104,"pageEnd":105,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-104.jpg","assets/pages/page-105.jpg"]},{"id":"q-47","number":47,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe agent ingests scanned PDF vendor invoices that contain tables and embedded QR codes.\nThe agent must preserve the PDF layout in the extracted output to ensure that downstream processing can reference sections and tables.\nYou plan to call Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools.\nYou need to extract content and layout elements and detect QR codes without requiring a language model deployment.\nWhich built-in analyzer should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的微软Foundry项目。\n该代理会摄取包含表格和嵌入式二维码的扫描PDF供应商发票。\n该代理必须在提取的输出中保留PDF布局,以确保下游处理可以引用部分和表格。\n你计划在Foundry Tools中调用Azure Content Understanding。\n你需要提取内容和布局元素,并检测二维码,而无需部署语言模型。\n你应该使用哪种内置分析器?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"prebuilt-documentFieldSchema\nprebuilt-documentFieldSchema","zh":""},{"id":"B","en":"prebuilt-read\nprebuilt-read","zh":""},{"id":"C","en":"prebuilt-documentSearch\nprebuilt-documentSearch","zh":""},{"id":"D","en":"prebuilt-layout\nprebuilt-layout","zh":""}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure AI 服务中的预构建分析器(Prebuilt Analyzer)的功能和适用场景。\n重点在于选择适合的分析器来提取内容和布局元素,同时检测嵌入的 QR 码。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nA. prebuilt-documentFieldSchema\n此分析器用于提取文档中的字段信息,主要用于结构化数据的提取。\n它不专注于保留 PDF 的布局,也不支持 QR 码检测。\n错误原因:不符合题目要求,无法提取布局和 QR 码。\nB. prebuilt-read\n此分析器用于读取文档中的文本内容,支持 OCR(光学字符识别)。\n虽然可以提取文本,但无法保留 PDF 的布局,也不支持 QR 码检测。\n错误原因:无法满足题目中“保留布局”和“检测 QR 码”的要求。\nC. prebuilt-documentSearch\n此分析器用于搜索文档中的内容,适合查询和搜索场景。\n它不专注于提取布局或检测 QR 码。\n错误原因:功能不符合题目要求。\nD. prebuilt-layout\n此分析器专⻔用于提取文档的布局元素,包括表格、段落、标题等。\n它还支持检测嵌入的 QR 码,完全符合题目要求。\n正确原因:能够提取内容和布局元素,同时检测 QR 码。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:D. prebuilt-layout\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:D\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:prebuilt-layout 是唯一能够同时满足“提取内容和布局元素”和“检测 QR 码”要求的分析器。","pageStart":106,"pageEnd":107,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-106.jpg","assets/pages/page-107.jpg"]},{"id":"q-48","number":48,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent and an image generation model deployment.\nThe agent generates original images from user-supplied product photos.\nYou need to ensure that the generated images maintain the product identity and visual characteristics of the provided photo.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"你有一个微软Foundry项目,其中包含一个代理和一个图像生成模型部署。\n该代理从用戶提供的产品照片生成原创图像。\n你需要确保生成的图像保持提供照片的产品身份和视觉特征。\n你应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Set the input_fidelity parameter to high.","zh":"将input_fidelity参数设置为高。"},{"id":"B","en":"Apply a groundedness detection filter.","zh":"应用一个扎根性检测过滤器。"},{"id":"C","en":"Include a prompt and input image in the request.","zh":"在请求中包含一个提示和输入图像。"},{"id":"D","en":"Decrease the value of the temperature parameter.","zh":"降低temperature参数的值。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"正确答案:A\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在使用微软Foundry项目中的图像生成模型时,确保生成的图像能够保持输入图像的产品身份和视觉特征。\n涉及的知识点包括模型参数设置(如input_fidelity和temperature)、提示工程(prompt engineering)、以及图像处理相关技术。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Set the input_fidelity parameter to high. 将input_fidelity参数设置为高。\n分析:input_fidelity参数通常用于控制生成图像与输入图像的相似度。如果设置为高,模型会更倾向于保留输入图像的特征和细节,\n从而确保产品身份和视觉特征。这是一个合理的选择。\nB. Apply a groundedness detection filter. 应用一个扎根性检测过滤器。\n分析:扎根性检测过滤器通常用于确保生成内容与现实世界的知识一致,但它并不直接影响图像生成模型对输入图像特征的保留。\n因此,这个选项与题目要求无关。\nC. Include a prompt and input image in the request. 在请求中包含一个提示和输入图像。\n分析:在请求中包含提示和输入图像可以帮助模型更好地理解用戶的需求,但这并不能直接保证生成图像保持输入图像的产品身份\n和视觉特征。提示的作用更多是指导生成内容的主题,而不是控制图像的细节保留。\nD. Decrease the value of the temperature parameter. 降低temperature参数的值。\n分析:temperature参数用于控制生成内容的随机性。降低temperature值会使生成内容更加确定性,但它并不直接影响图像生成模型\n对输入图像特征的保留。因此,这个选项与题目要求无关。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:A\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:A\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:设置input_fidelity参数为高是确保生成图像保持输入图像产品身份和视觉特征的最直接和有效的方法。","pageStart":108,"pageEnd":109,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-108.jpg","assets/pages/page-109.jpg"]},{"id":"q-49","number":49,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT -\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe agent accepts user-uploaded screenshots and uses a multimodal chat model.\nSome screenshots contain potentially malicious embedded text.\nYou need to prevent a prompt injection attack and ensure that third-party content is treated as lower trust.\nHow should you configure prompt shields for document attacks? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点问题 -\n您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n该代理接受用戶上传的屏幕截图,并使用多模态聊天模型。\n一些屏幕截图包含潜在的恶意嵌入文本。\n您需要防止提示注入攻击,并确保第三方内容被视为较低信任级别。\n您应该如何配置提示屏蔽以防止文档攻击?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Set action to block.","item2:Enable Spotlighting."],"analysis":"正确答案:\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何配置 Microsoft Foundry 项目中的 Prompt Shields,以防止用戶上传的截图中可能存在的恶意嵌入文本导致的提示注\n入攻击。\n重点在于理解 Prompt Shields 的功能和如何通过配置来降低第三方内容的信任级别。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nPrompt shields action:\nDisable the shield: 关闭 Prompt Shields 会完全禁用保护机制,这显然不符合题目要求,因为题目明确要求防止提示注入攻击。此选项\n错误。\nSet action to block: 阻止恶意内容是最直接的防护措施,可以有效防止提示注入攻击。此选项正确。\nSet action to annotate: 注释内容虽然可以标记潜在的恶意内容,但并不能完全阻止攻击,因此不如“Set action to block”有效。此选项错\n误。\nAdditional mitigation:\nEnable Spotlighting: Spotlighting 是一种额外的保护机制,可以帮助识别和隔离潜在的恶意内容。启用 Spotlighting 是一个合理的选择,\n可以进一步降低⻛险。此选项正确。\nCreate a custom blocklist: 自定义阻止列表虽然可以针对已知的恶意内容,但无法处理未知的攻击模式,因此不如 Spotlighting 更全\n面。此选项错误。\nUse optical character recognition (OCR) to extract the text from the images first: 使用 OCR 提取文本虽然可以帮助分析截图内容,但并不能\n直接防止提示注入攻击,因此不符合题目要求。此选项错误。\n3. 我的答案\nPrompt shields action: Set action to block\nAdditional mitigation: Enable Spotlighting\n4. 官方答案\nPrompt shields action: Set action to block\nAdditional mitigation: Enable Spotlighting\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:官方答案选择了最直接和有效的防护措施(阻止恶意内容和启用 Spotlighting),符合题目要求。","pageStart":110,"pageEnd":111,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-110.jpg","assets/pages/page-111.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Prompt shields action","answer":"Set action to block.","choices":["Disable the shield.","Set action to block.","Set action to annotate."]},{"id":"item2","label":"Additional mitigation","answer":"Enable Spotlighting.","choices":["Enable Spotlighting.","Create a custom blocklist.","Use optical character recognition (OCR) to extract the text from the images first."]}]},{"id":"q-50","number":50,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are deploying a support agent that enables users to upload photos.\nYou need to automatically classify uploaded images for harmful content. The solution must block content based on severity levels.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您正在部署一个支持代理,允许用戶上传照片。\n您需要自动分类上传的图像以检测有害内容。解决方案必须根据严重程度级别屏蔽内容。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Apply keyword scanning to optical character recognition (OCR) output by using Azure Vision in Foundry Tools.","zh":"使用 Foundry Tools 中的 Azure Vision 对光学字符识别 (OCR) 输出应用关键词扫描。"},{"id":"B","en":"Enable prompt shields.","zh":"启用提示屏障。"},{"id":"C","en":"Use blocklists.","zh":"使用屏蔽列表。"},{"id":"D","en":"Implement image moderation.","zh":"实施图像审核。"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure AI 服务中的内容审核功能,特别是图像审核(Image Moderation)的应用。\n重点在于如何自动分类上传的图像并根据严重程度阻止有害内容。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Apply keyword scanning to optical character recognition (OCR) output by using Azure Vision in Foundry Tools.\n错误:OCR主要用于从图像中提取文本内容,而关键词扫描仅适用于文本内容的分析,无法直接处理图像的整体内容(如暴力或色\n情图像)。\n虽然OCR可以作为辅助工具,但它并不能满足题目要求的“自动分类图像并根据严重程度阻止内容”的需求。\nB. Enable prompt shields.\n错误:Prompt shields通常用于保护生成式AI模型的输入和输出,防止生成不适当内容,与图像审核无关。\n此选项与题目要求的图像分类和阻止有害内容的功能不匹配。\nC. Use blocklists.\n错误:屏蔽列表(Blocklists)通常用于文本或URL过滤,无法直接处理图像内容。\n虽然可以通过屏蔽列表阻止某些已知的有害内容,但它无法实现题目要求的“自动分类图像并根据严重程度阻止内容”的功能。\nD. Implement image moderation.\n正确:图像审核(Image Moderation)是Azure Content Moderator服务的一部分,专⻔用于分析图像内容并根据严重程度标记或阻止有\n害内容。\n此功能完全符合题目要求,可以自动分类上传的图像并根据严重程度阻止内容。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:D. Implement image moderation.\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:D. Implement image moderation.\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:图像审核(Image Moderation)是Azure Content Moderator服务的核心功能,完全符合题目要求。","pageStart":112,"pageEnd":113,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-112.jpg","assets/pages/page-113.jpg"]},{"id":"q-51","number":51,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an app named App1 that uses a Microsoft Foundry multimodal model deployment.\nApp1 runs optical character recognition (OCR) on uploaded images and appends the OCR output to the prompt as additional context.\nSome uploaded images contain embedded text.\nYou need to prevent potentially malicious instructions from being processed by the model.\nWhat should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个名为 App1 的应用程序,该应用程序使用 Microsoft Foundry 多模态模型部署。\nApp1 对上传的图像运行光学字符识别 (OCR),并将 OCR 输出作为附加上下文附加到提示中。\n一些上传的图像包含嵌入的文本。\n你需要防止潜在的恶意指令被模型处理。\n你应该使用什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"image moderation","zh":"图像审核"},{"id":"B","en":"prompt shields for documents","zh":"文档提示保护"},{"id":"C","en":"protected material text","zh":"受保护的材料文本"},{"id":"D","en":"prompt shields for user prompts","zh":"用戶提示保护"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何在使用微软多模态模型(如 Foundry 模型)时,确保输入的安全性,特别是防止恶意指令通过 OCR 或用戶输入被\n处理。\n涉及的知识点包括:图像审核、提示保护(Prompt Shield)以及如何处理潜在的恶意内容。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nA. image moderation 图像审核\n图像审核主要用于检测图像中的不适当内容(如暴力、色情等),但它并不能直接处理嵌入图像中的文本内容(如 OCR 提取的文\n本)。因此,这个选项不适合解决防止恶意指令的问题。\nB. prompt shields for documents 文档提示保护\n文档提示保护(Prompt Shields for Documents)是专⻔设计用于保护模型免受文档中潜在恶意内容的影响。由于 OCR 提取的文本会被\n附加到模型的提示中作为上下文,这个选项可以有效防止恶意指令被处理。因此,这个选项是正确的。\nC. protected material text 受保护的材料文本\n受保护的材料文本通常指的是对敏感数据的保护(如加密或屏蔽),但它并不直接涉及如何防止恶意指令通过提示被处理。因此,这\n个选项不适合解决问题。\nD. prompt shields for user prompts 用戶提示保护\n用戶提示保护(Prompt Shields for User Prompts)主要用于保护用戶直接输入的提示内容,而本题中提到的是通过 OCR 提取的文本作\n为上下文,而不是用戶直接输入的提示。因此,这个选项不适合解决问题。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:B. prompt shields for documents 文档提示保护\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:B. prompt shields for documents 文档提示保护\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,都是B。\n原因:文档提示保护是专⻔设计用于防止文档中潜在恶意内容影响模型的功能,符合题目要求。","pageStart":114,"pageEnd":115,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-114.jpg","assets/pages/page-115.jpg"]},{"id":"q-52","number":52,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nYou need to process mixed-format documents that contain scanned text, tables, and multicolumn layouts. The extracted content must preserve\nthe document structure and be converted into the Markdown format for downstream reasoning.\nWhat should you configure first?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的微软Foundry项目。\n你需要处理包含扫描文本、表格和多列布局的混合格式文档。提取的内容必须保留文档结构,并转换为Markdown格式以供后续推理\n使用。\n你首先应该配置什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"an Azure Language in Foundry Tools text analysis model deployment","zh":"在Foundry Tools中部署的Azure Language文本分析模型"},{"id":"B","en":"a generative chat completion request","zh":"一个生成式聊天完成请求"},{"id":"C","en":"an Azure OpenAI Responses API call that uses a multimodal model","zh":"一个使用多模态模型的Azure OpenAI Responses API调用"},{"id":"D","en":"an Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools analyzer","zh":"在Foundry Tools中的Azure Content Understanding分析器"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是如何处理混合格式文档(包括扫描文本、表格和多列布局),并提取内容以保留文档结构,同时转换为Markdown格\n式。这涉及到Azure AI服务中的文档分析和内容理解能力。\n2. 逐个分析选项\nA. an Azure Language in Foundry Tools text analysis model deployment\n错误:Azure Language文本分析模型主要用于处理自然语言文本,例如情感分析、关键短语提取等。它不适合处理混合格式文档(如\n扫描文本和表格),也无法保留文档结构。\nB. a generative chat completion request\n错误:生成式聊天完成请求通常用于生成对话或文本内容,而不是处理复杂的文档结构或提取内容。它无法满足题目中提到的“保留\n文档结构并转换为Markdown格式”的需求。\nC. an Azure OpenAI Responses API call that uses a multimodal model\n错误:虽然多模态模型可以处理图像和文本,但它主要用于生成内容或回答问题,而不是专⻔设计用于提取和保留复杂文档结构。\n题目要求的是文档分析和结构化提取,这不是多模态模型的主要功能。\nD. an Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools analyzer\n正确:Azure Content Understanding分析器专⻔用于处理复杂文档,包括扫描文本、表格和多列布局。它能够提取内容并保留文档结\n构,同时支持转换为Markdown格式。这正是题目要求的功能。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:D\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:D\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:Azure Content Understanding分析器是专⻔设计用于处理复杂文档结构的工具,能够满足题目中提到的所有需求。","pageStart":116,"pageEnd":117,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-116.jpg","assets/pages/page-117.jpg"]},{"id":"q-53","number":53,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an application that processes scanned PDF invoices. The invoices have varied layouts and include multipage tables.\nYou have a pipeline that uses optical character recognition (OCR) and extracts totals and invoice numbers. The results are often incorrect because\nthe document structure is ignored.\nYou need to implement a solution that provides OCR, layout analysis, and template-generalizing field extraction. The solution must NOT require\ntraining a custom model. The solution must minimize administrative effort.\nWhat should you include in the solution?","questionZh":"您有一个处理扫描的 PDF 发票的应用程序。这些发票具有不同的布局,并包含多⻚表格。\n您有一个使用光学字符识别 (OCR) 的管道,并提取总计和发票号码。结果通常不正确,因为忽略了文档结构。\n您需要实施一个解决方案,该解决方案提供 OCR、布局分析和模板通用化字段提取。该解决方案不得要求训练自定义模型,并且必\n须最大限度地减少管理工作。\n您应该在解决方案中包含什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Azure Language in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry Tools 中的 Azure Language"},{"id":"B","en":"Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry Tools 中的 Azure Content Understanding"},{"id":"C","en":"an Azure Machine Learning model","zh":"一个 Azure 机器学习模型"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure AI 服务中的文档处理能力,特别是 OCR(光学字符识别)、布局分析和字段提取功能。\n要求解决方案能够处理多⻚表格和多样化的文档结构,同时无需训练自定义模型,且减少管理工作量。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Azure Language in Foundry Tools\nAzure Language 是一种语言处理服务,主要用于自然语言处理(NLP)任务,例如情感分析、实体识别等。\n它不适合处理文档的布局分析和字段提取任务,因此不符合题目要求。\n错误原因:此选项与文档结构处理无关。\nB. Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools\nAzure Content Understanding 是一种专⻔用于文档处理的服务,支持 OCR、布局分析和字段提取功能。\n它可以处理多⻚表格和复杂文档结构,并且无需训练自定义模型,符合题目要求。\n正确原因:此选项完全满足题目需求。\nC. an Azure Machine Learning model\nAzure Machine Learning 需要用戶训练和部署自定义模型,虽然可以实现类似功能,但需要较高的管理和开发工作量。\n题目明确要求不需要训练自定义模型,因此此选项不符合要求。\n错误原因:此选项增加了额外的管理复杂性,与题目要求相悖。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:B. Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:B. Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:Azure Content Understanding 是专⻔设计用于文档处理的服务,完全符合题目要求,包括 OCR、布局分析和字段提取功\n能,同时无需训练自定义模型,且管理工作量较低。","pageStart":118,"pageEnd":119,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-118.jpg","assets/pages/page-119.jpg"]},{"id":"q-54","number":54,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe agent uses a knowledge source built from documents stored in Azure Blob Storage. The documents include digitally scanned PDFs that\ncontain multipage tables.\nYou have an ingestion job that extracts only plain text, causing loss of table structure, headings, and page-number metadata.\nUsers frequently ask questions that require the retrieval of specific table rows across the pages.\nYou need to configure an ingestion job for a Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) pipeline that performs optical character recognition (OCR) on\nscanned PDFs, preserves tables and headings as structure-aware chunks, and stores page-number metadata with each chunk.\nHow should you configure the ingestion job?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n该代理使用从存储在 Azure Blob Storage 中的文档构建的知识源。这些文档包括包含多⻚表格的数字扫描 PDF。\n你有一个提取作业,仅提取纯文本,导致表格结构、标题和⻚码元数据丢失。\n用戶经常提出需要跨⻚面检索特定表格行的问题。\n你需要为一个检索增强生成(RAG)管道配置一个提取作业,该管道对扫描的 PDF 执行光学字符识别(OCR),以结构感知的块形式\n保留表格和标题,并将⻚码元数据存储在每个块中。\n你应该如何配置提取作业?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Use advanced data parsing to reingest the documents.","zh":"使用高级数据解析重新提取文档。 Most Voted"},{"id":"B","en":"Use OCR and page-level chunking.","zh":"使用 OCR 和⻚面级分块。"},{"id":"C","en":"Use page-level OCR extraction and store each page as a single chunk.","zh":"使用⻚面级 OCR 提取,并将每⻚存储为单个块。"},{"id":"D","en":"Use basic parsing and fixed-size chunking.","zh":"使用基本解析和固定大小分块。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"建议答案:A\nCommunity vote distribution\nA (100%)\n知识点\n本题考查的是如何配置数据摄取任务以支持Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)管道,特别是针对包含扫描PDF的文档,如何使用光\n学字符识别 (OCR)技术并保留表格结构、标题和⻚码元数据。\n选项分析\nA. 使用高级数据解析重新摄取文档。\n正确。 高级数据解析(Advanced Data Parsing)通常包括OCR功能,并支持保留文档的结构化信息(如表格、标题和元数据)。这是\n解决问题的核心需求,因为它能够提取表格并保留⻚码等元数据。\nB. 使用OCR和⻚级分块。\n错误。 虽然OCR是必要的,但仅仅进行⻚级分块(page-level chunking)无法保留表格的结构化信息。表格可能跨⻚,单纯的⻚级分\n块会导致表格被破坏,无法满足用戶查询特定表格行的需求。\nC. 使用⻚级OCR提取并将每⻚存储为单独的块。\n错误。 这种方法与选项B类似,虽然可以提取文本,但无法保留表格结构和标题等信息。将每⻚存储为单独的块也会导致跨⻚表格\n的完整性丢失。\nD. 使用基本解析和固定大小分块。\n错误。 基本解析(Basic Parsing)和固定大小分块(Fixed-size Chunking)无法处理扫描PDF中的表格结构,也无法保留标题和⻚码元\n数据。这种方法过于简单,无法满足题目要求。\n推荐答案\nA\n官方答案\nA\n比较与验证\n我的答案与官方答案一致。选项A是唯一能够满足题目要求的解决方案,因为它支持OCR、保留表格结构和元数据。其他选项均无法\n完整解决问题。","pageStart":120,"pageEnd":121,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-120.jpg","assets/pages/page-121.jpg"]},{"id":"q-55","number":55,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe agent uses Azure AI Search as the retriever.\nYou plan to ingest PDF into an Azure AI Search index to ensure that the agent can ground responses in texts in both documents and embedded\nimages.\nUsers require citations that link to the source files.\nYou need to ensure that during indexing, the images are extracted into a structure that can be used as input for the built-in optical character\nrecognition (OCR) skill.\nWhich indexing approach should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n该代理使用 Azure AI Search 作为检索器。\n你计划将 PDF 导入 Azure AI Search 索引,以确保代理能够在文档和嵌入图像中的文本中找到依据来生成响应。\n用戶需要链接到源文件的引用。\n你需要确保在索引过程中,图像被提取到一个可以用作内置光学字符识别 (OCR) 技能输入的结构中。\n你应该使用哪种索引方法?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"an indexer to extract image data into a normalized_images collection","zh":"使用索引器将图像数据提取到一个 normalized_images 集合中"},{"id":"B","en":"a Shaper skill to restructure the OCR input","zh":"使用 Shaper 技能重构 OCR 输入"},{"id":"C","en":"a skillset to run the OCR skill directly against the content field of the index","zh":"使用技能集直接对索引的内容字段运行 OCR 技能"},{"id":"D","en":"the outputFieldMappings parameter to write image data to a searchable field","zh":"使用 outputFieldMappings 参数将图像数据写入可搜索字段"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"正确答案:A\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure AI Search 的索引器和技能集的使用,特别是如何处理 PDF 文件中的嵌入图像并通过 OCR 技能提取文本。\n重点在于理解索引器、技能集、Shaper 技能以及 outputFieldMappings 参数的功能和适用场景。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 使用索引器将图像数据提取到一个 normalized_images 集合中\n此选项正确。索引器可以自动提取 PDF 文件中的嵌入图像,并将其存储到 normalized_images 集合中。此集合可以作为 OCR 技能的输\n入,确保图像中的文本能够被提取并用于搜索索引。这是 Azure AI Search 的推荐方法之一。\nB. 使用 Shaper 技能重构 OCR 输入\n此选项错误。Shaper 技能用于重构数据结构,但它并不能直接处理图像提取或 OCR 输入。题目要求的是提取图像并运行 OCR,而不\n是重构数据结构。\nC. 使用技能集直接对索引的内容字段运行 OCR 技能\n此选项错误。OCR 技能需要图像作为输入,而不是直接对内容字段运行。内容字段通常包含文本数据,而不是图像数据,因此无法\n满足题目要求。\nD. 使用 outputFieldMappings 参数将图像数据写入可搜索字段\n此选项错误。outputFieldMappings 参数用于将技能输出映射到索引字段,但它并不能负责图像提取或 OCR 输入的处理。题目要求的\n是图像提取,而不是字段映射。\n3. 我的答案\n我选择的答案是:A\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:A\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,都是A。\n原因:索引器能够提取 PDF 文件中的嵌入图像并存储到 normalized_images 集合中,这是运行 OCR 技能的必要步骤。其他选项无法满\n足题目要求。","pageStart":122,"pageEnd":123,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-122.jpg","assets/pages/page-123.jpg"]},{"id":"q-56","number":56,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"single","questionEn":"You need to recommend an invoice review solution that resolves the issue reported by the finance department.\nWhat should you include in the recommendation?","questionZh":"您需要推荐一个解决供应商发票问题的解决方案。\n您应该在推荐中包含什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"chat completions","zh":"聊天补全"},{"id":"B","en":"Azure Document Intelligence in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry 工具中的 Azure 文档智能"},{"id":"C","en":"Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry 工具中的 Azure 内容理解 Most Voted"},{"id":"D","en":"Image Analysis","zh":"图像分析"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"官方答案：C\n答案核验\nPDF 第 124-128 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 C。\n对应选项：C. Foundry 工具中的 Azure 内容理解 Most Voted\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":124,"pageEnd":128,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-124.jpg","assets/pages/page-125.jpg","assets/pages/page-126.jpg","assets/pages/page-127.jpg","assets/pages/page-128.jpg"]},{"id":"q-57","number":57,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe knowledge source for the agent is a set of scanned PDF troubleshooting guides stored in Azure Blob Storage. The guide pages contain two-\ncolumn layouts and tables.\nYou use Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools to process the PDFs.\nYou plan to ingest the processed content into an index for Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) and store extracted fields for downstream\nautomation.\nStakeholders must be able to verify where each extracted field value came from in the original PDF and route low-reliability extractions for manual\nreview.\nYou need to ensure that the Content Understanding document analyzer output includes a per-field confidence score and source grounding to\nlocations within the source document.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的微软Foundry项目。\n该代理的知识来源是一组存储在Azure Blob Storage中的扫描版PDF故障排除指南。这些指南⻚面包含双栏布局和表格。\n你使用Foundry Tools中的Azure内容理解功能来处理这些PDF。\n你计划将处理后的内容摄取到一个索引中,用于检索增强生成(RAG),并存储提取的字段以供后续自动化使用。\n利益相关者必须能够验证每个提取字段值在原始PDF中的来源,并将低可靠性提取结果路由到人工审核。\n你需要确保内容理解文档分析器的输出包括每个字段的置信度评分以及源定位到原始文档中的位置。\n你应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Set enableSegment to true.","zh":"设置enableSegment为true。"},{"id":"B","en":"Provide labeled samples.","zh":"提供标注样本。"},{"id":"C","en":"Enable estimateFieldSourceAndConfidence.","zh":"启用estimateFieldSourceAndConfidence。"},{"id":"D","en":"Configure the analyzer to use generative extraction for all fields.","zh":"配置分析器以对所有字段使用生成式提取。"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"正确答案:C\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是Azure Content Understanding的功能配置,特别是如何确保文档分析器输出包含字段的置信度评分和来源定位(source\ngrounding)。\n涉及的知识点包括:文档分析器的配置选项、字段提取的置信度评分、以及如何实现字段来源的追踪。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Set enableSegment to true. 设置enableSegment为true。\nenableSegment选项用于启用文档的分段处理,但它并不直接与字段置信度评分或来源定位相关。\n此选项主要用于优化文档分段,而不是解决字段提取的置信度或来源问题。\n因此,此选项与题目要求无关,错误。\nB. Provide labeled samples. 提供标注样本。\n提供标注样本可以帮助训练模型以提高提取字段的准确性,但它并不能直接确保输出包含字段的置信度评分和来源定位。\n虽然标注样本对提高模型性能有帮助,但它不是解决题目要求的直接方法。\n因此,此选项与题目要求无关,错误。\nC. Enable estimateFieldSourceAndConfidence. 启用estimateFieldSourceAndConfidence。\n此选项明确提到启用字段来源估计和置信度评分功能,完全符合题目要求。\n通过启用此功能,文档分析器可以输出每个字段的置信度评分,并提供字段来源的定位信息。\n此选项正确。\nD. Configure the analyzer to use generative extraction for all fields. 配置分析器以对所有字段使用生成式提取。\n生成式提取是一种提取字段的方法,但它并不保证输出字段的置信度评分或来源定位。\n虽然生成式提取可能提高字段提取的质量,但它不是解决题目要求的直接方法。\n因此,此选项与题目要求无关,错误。\n3. 我的答案\n我选择的答案是:C\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:C\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:启用estimateFieldSourceAndConfidence选项是唯一能够确保文档分析器输出字段置信度评分和来源定位的正确方法,完全\n符合题目要求。","pageStart":129,"pageEnd":130,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-129.jpg","assets/pages/page-130.jpg"]},{"id":"q-58","number":58,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are building a speech processing solution in Microsoft Foundry for a customer support platform.\nThe platform will transcribe live phone calls, so that supervisors at your company can view call transcripts and detect issues while the calls are in\nprogress. The call audio will arrive as a continuous stream from the telephony system.\nYou need to ensure that the call transcripts appear within only a few seconds of the audio stream.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您正在为客戶支持平台在 Microsoft Foundry 中构建一个语音处理解决方案。\n该平台将对实时电话进行转录,以便您公司的主管可以查看通话转录内容,并在通话进行时检测问题。通话音频将作为连续流从电\n话系统传入。\n您需要确保通话转录内容在音频流传入后仅几秒内出现。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Use text to speech by using a custom neural voice.","zh":"使用自定义神经语音进行文本转语音。"},{"id":"B","en":"Use speech translation to generate the transcripts into multiple languages.","zh":"使用语音翻译将转录内容生成多种语言版本。"},{"id":"C","en":"Run a batch transcription job on recorded audio files.","zh":"对录制的音频文件运行批量转录任务。"},{"id":"D","en":"Use real-time speech to text to process streaming audio input.","zh":"使用实时语音转文本处理流式音频输入。"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是微软Azure认知服务中的语音服务,特别是实时语音转文本(Speech-to-Text)的应用场景。\n重点在于处理流式音频输入并生成实时转录内容。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 使用自定义神经语音进行文本转语音\n错误:文本转语音(Text-to-Speech)是将文本转换为语音的技术,与题目要求的语音转文本(Speech-to-Text)完全不相关。\n题目要求的是实时转录音频,而不是生成语音。\nB. 使用语音翻译将转录内容生成多种语言版本\n错误:语音翻译(Speech Translation)是将语音转录并翻译成其他语言的技术,虽然可以生成转录内容,但题目并未提到需要翻译\n成多种语言。\n此外,语音翻译的重点是翻译,而不是实时转录,可能无法满足“几秒内生成转录”的要求。\nC. 对录制的音频文件运行批量转录任务\n错误:批量转录(Batch Transcription)适用于处理预先录制的音频文件,而题目明确要求处理实时流式音频。\n批量转录无法满足“实时转录”的需求。\nD. 使用实时语音转文本处理流式音频输入\n正确:实时语音转文本(Real-time Speech-to-Text)是专⻔用于处理流式音频输入并生成实时转录内容的技术。\n它能够在几秒内生成转录内容,完全符合题目要求。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:D\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:D\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,均为D。\n原因:实时语音转文本是唯一能够满足题目要求的技术,其他选项均无法实现实时转录或与题目需求不符。","pageStart":131,"pageEnd":132,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-131.jpg","assets/pages/page-132.jpg"]},{"id":"q-59","number":59,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are creating an agent workflow in a Microsoft Foundry project to support natural voice interactions.\nThe agent must receive continuous audio input, convert the input into text for reasoning, and then return spoken responses to a user. The\nworkflow must meet the following requirements:\nSupport turn-taking dynamics, where the agent begins to generate the speech output before the user finishes speaking.\nOperate with low latency to maintain conversational experience.\nYou need to enable both speech to text and text to speech in a real-time agent interaction.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您正在为一个微软Foundry项目创建代理工作流,以支持自然语音交互。\n代理必须接收连续的音频输入,将输入转换为文本以进行推理,然后向用戶返回语音响应。工作流必须满足以下要求:\n支持轮流对话动态,即代理在用戶尚未完成讲话之前开始生成语音输出。\n以低延迟运行以保持对话体验。\n您需要在实时代理交互中启用语音转文本和文本转语音功能。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Use batch transcription to convert the audio input and return text responses from the agent.","zh":"使用批量转录将音频输入转换为文本,并从代理返回文本响应。"},{"id":"B","en":"Use real-time speech to text for incoming audio and text to speech for agent responses.","zh":"使用实时语音转文本处理输入音频,并使用文本转语音生成代理响应。"},{"id":"C","en":"Use an embeddings model to encode the audio, and then decode the audio into text and speech.","zh":"使用嵌入模型对音频进行编码,然后将音频解码为文本和语音。"},{"id":"D","en":"Use speech translation to convert the audio into another language and return the translated text.","zh":"使用语音翻译将音频转换为另一种语言,并返回翻译后的文本。"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是微软语音服务(Azure Cognitive Services)的实时语音处理能力,包括语音转文本(Speech to Text)和文本转语音(Text\nto Speech)。\n重点在于支持实时交互、低延迟以及“turn-taking dynamics(” 交互式对话的动态特性)。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 使用批量转录将音频输入转换为文本,并从代理返回文本响应。\n错误:批量转录(Batch Transcription)是用于处理大量音频文件的离线处理方式,无法满足实时交互和低延迟的要求。\n批量转录不支持“turn-taking dynamics”,因为它无法在用戶讲话未完成时生成响应。\nB. 使用实时语音转文本处理输入音频,并使用文本转语音生成代理响应。\n正确:实时语音转文本(Real-time Speech to Text)可以将用戶的音频输入快速转换为文本,支持低延迟和实时交互。\n文本转语音(Text to Speech)可以将代理的文本响应转换为语音输出,满足自然语言交互的需求。\n此选项完全符合题目要求,包括支持“turn-taking dynamics”和低延迟。\nC. 使用嵌入模型对音频进行编码,然后将音频解码为文本和语音。\n错误:嵌入模型通常用于语义理解或特征提取,而不是直接用于实时语音转文本或文本转语音。\n此选项未提及如何支持实时交互和低延迟,且不符合题目要求。\nD. 使用语音翻译将音频转换为另一种语言,并返回翻译后的文本。\n错误:语音翻译(Speech Translation)是用于跨语言的语音转换,不适用于本题的单语言实时交互场景。\n此选项未提及如何支持“turn-taking dynamics”,且翻译功能与题目要求无关。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:B\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:B\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,均为B。\n原因:选项B完全符合题目要求,能够支持实时语音交互、低延迟以及“turn-taking dynamics”。","pageStart":133,"pageEnd":134,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-133.jpg","assets/pages/page-134.jpg"]},{"id":"q-60","number":60,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an application named App1 that uses Azure Speech in Foundry Tools to transcribe live calls.\nTranscript segments often contain both English and Spanish. App1 sends each segment to Azure Translator in Foundry Tools to translate to\nanother language.\nSometimes, mixed-language segments result in incomplete or incorrect translations.\nYou need to reduce translation errors. The solution must ensure that the entire transcript is translated successfully.\nWhat should you do before sending the segments to Translator?","questionZh":"您有一个名为 App1 的应用程序,该应用程序使用 Foundry Tools 中的 Azure Speech 来转录实时通话。\n转录片段通常同时包含英语和西班牙语。App1 将每个片段发送到 Foundry Tools 中的 Azure Translator 以翻译成另一种语言。\n有时,混合语言片段会导致不完整或不正确的翻译。\n您需要减少翻译错误。解决方案必须确保整个转录内容成功翻译。\n在将片段发送到 Translator 之前,您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Use document translation to translate the entire transcript as a single document.","zh":"使用文档翻译将整个转录内容作为单个文档进行翻译。"},{"id":"B","en":"Split the mixed-language segments into single-language segments and translate each segment separately.","zh":"将混合语言片段拆分为单一语言片段,并分别翻译每个片段。"},{"id":"C","en":"Enable automatic language detection for the translation request.","zh":"为翻译请求启用自动语言检测。"},{"id":"D","en":"Specify English as the source language in the translation request for all the segments.","zh":"为所有片段的翻译请求指定英语作为源语言。"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure Speech 服务的使用和处理多语言内容的能力。\nAzure Translator 的功能,包括自动语言检测和文档翻译。\n如何优化翻译流程以减少错误。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 使用文档翻译将整个转录内容作为单个文档进行翻译。\n文档翻译适用于完整文档的翻译,但题目中提到的是实时通话的转录片段,无法直接作为单个文档处理。\n此外,文档翻译无法解决混合语言片段的问题,因为它不会自动拆分语言。\n因此此选项不适合解决问题。\nB. 将混合语言片段拆分为单一语言片段,并分别翻译每个片段。\n这是一个合理的解决方案,因为混合语言片段可能导致翻译错误,拆分为单一语言片段可以确保翻译的准确性。\n通过单独处理每种语言,可以减少翻译错误并提高翻译质量。\n此选项符合题目要求。\nC. 为翻译请求启用自动语言检测。\n自动语言检测可以识别片段中的语言,但对于混合语言片段,可能无法准确区分每种语言的内容。\n此选项可能会导致翻译不完整或错误,无法完全解决问题。\nD. 为所有片段的翻译请求指定英语作为源语言。\n指定英语作为源语言会忽略片段中的西班牙语内容,导致翻译不完整或错误。\n此选项显然不符合题目要求。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:B\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:B\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,都是B。\n原因:拆分混合语言片段为单一语言片段是解决翻译错误的最佳方法,符合题目要求。","pageStart":135,"pageEnd":136,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-135.jpg","assets/pages/page-136.jpg"]},{"id":"q-61","number":61,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"multiple","questionEn":"You need to configure an indexing pipeline for Agent1 to retrieve the relevant product information in storage1. The solution must meet the\ntechnical requirement.\nWhich two built-in skills should you use? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"您需要为 Agent1 配置一个索引管道,以检索 storage1 中的相关产品信息。解决方案必须满足技术需求。\n以下两种内置技能中,您应该使用哪两种?每个正确答案均为解决方案的一部分。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Azure OpenAI Embedding","zh":"Azure OpenAI 嵌入"},{"id":"B","en":"Entity Recognition","zh":"实体识别"},{"id":"C","en":"Text Split","zh":"文本拆分"},{"id":"D","en":"Merge","zh":"合并"},{"id":"E","en":"Language Detection","zh":"语言检测"},{"id":"F","en":"key phrase extraction","zh":"关键短语提取"}],"answer":["A","C"],"analysis":"正确答案:AC\n题目分析与解答\n1. 这题考察的知识点是什么\n本题考察的是如何配置一个索引管道(Indexing Pipeline),以便Agent1能够从存储的产品信息中检索相关内容。\n重点知识点包括:文本处理技能(如文本拆分)、嵌入生成(Embedding)以及如何满足语义和向量搜索的技术需求。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Azure OpenAI Embedding (Azure OpenAI 嵌入)\n嵌入是用于生成向量表示的关键步骤,支持语义和向量搜索。\n根据技术要求,产品信息需要通过语义和向量搜索进行检索,因此嵌入是必需的。\n正确\nB. Entity Recognition (实体识别)\n实体识别用于提取特定实体(如人名、地点等),但题目中没有提到需要提取实体。\n与索引管道的需求无关,因此不适用。\n错误\nC. Text Split (文本拆分)\n文本拆分是处理⻓文档的关键步骤,可以将文档分割成较小的片段以便后续处理。\n根据技术要求,产品信息需要被索引并支持语义搜索,文本拆分是必需的。\n正确\nD. Merge (合并)\n合并用于将多个片段组合成一个整体,但题目中没有提到需要合并操作。\n与索引管道的需求无关,因此不适用。\n错误\nE. Language Detection (语言检测)\n语言检测用于识别文本的语言,但题目中没有提到需要检测语言。\n与索引管道的需求无关,因此不适用。\n错误\nF. Key Phrase Extraction (关键短语提取)\n关键短语提取用于识别文本中的重要短语,但题目中没有提到需要提取关键短语。\n与索引管道的需求无关,因此不适用。\n错误\n3. 我选的答案\nA. Azure OpenAI Embedding\nC. Text Split\n4. 官方答案\nA. Azure OpenAI Embedding\nC. Text Split\n5. 与官方答案的比较\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:嵌入和文本拆分是满足语义和向量搜索需求的核心技能,其他选项与题目要求无关。","pageStart":137,"pageEnd":141,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-137.jpg","assets/pages/page-138.jpg","assets/pages/page-139.jpg","assets/pages/page-140.jpg","assets/pages/page-141.jpg"]},{"id":"q-62","number":62,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"single","questionEn":"You need to recommend a solution to support the planned changes and technical requirements for Agent1 to use the product information stored\nin storage1.\nWhat should you include in the recommendation?","questionZh":"您需要推荐一个解决方案,以支持 Agent1 使用存储在 storage1 中的产品信息的计划变更和技术需求。\n您应该在推荐中包括什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Azure Translator in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry 工具中的 Azure Translator"},{"id":"B","en":"Grounding with Bing Search","zh":"使用 Bing 搜索进行基础化"},{"id":"C","en":"Azure AI Search","zh":"Azure AI 搜索"},{"id":"D","en":"Azure Document intelligence in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry 工具中的 Azure 文档智能"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"正确答案:C\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题主要考察如何为AI解决方案设计一个能够检索和使用存储在Azure Blob Storage中的产品信息的索引解决方案。\n涉及的技术包括Azure AI Search、Azure Document Intelligence、Bing Search以及Azure Translator等工具的功能和适用场景。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Azure Translator in Foundry Tools\nAzure Translator主要用于语言翻译和文本翻译,不适合处理产品信息的索引和语义搜索。\n错误原因:本题要求的是检索和索引产品信息,而不是翻译文本。\nB. Grounding with Bing Search\nBing Search可以用于基础化搜索,但它主要是基于互联网的搜索引擎,无法直接处理存储在Azure Blob Storage中的产品信息。\n错误原因:本题要求的是对存储在Azure Blob Storage中的产品信息进行索引和语义搜索,而不是基于互联网的搜索。\nC. Azure AI Search\nAzure AI Search支持语义搜索和向量搜索,能够处理存储在Azure Blob Storage中的文档并建立索引。\n正确原因:Azure AI Search完全符合题目要求,可以处理PDF格式的产品信息,支持语义搜索和向量搜索,满足技术需求。\nD. Azure Document Intelligence in Foundry Tools\nAzure Document Intelligence主要用于文档的结构化数据提取,例如表格和文本识别,但不支持语义搜索和向量搜索。\n错误原因:虽然它可以处理PDF文档,但无法满足题目中关于语义搜索和索引的需求。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:C. Azure AI Search\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:C. Azure AI Search\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因分析:Azure AI Search是唯一符合题目要求的解决方案,能够处理存储在Azure Blob Storage中的产品信息,支持语义搜索和向量\n搜索,满足技术和业务需求。","pageStart":142,"pageEnd":146,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-142.jpg","assets/pages/page-143.jpg","assets/pages/page-144.jpg","assets/pages/page-145.jpg","assets/pages/page-146.jpg"]},{"id":"q-63","number":63,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1.\nProject1 contains an application that processes PDF vendor invoices.\nYou need to configure Azure Document Intelligence in Foundry Tools to generate a Markdown output that preserves the sections and table\nstructure of the PDFs. The solution must minimize development effort.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"你有一个名为 Project1 的微软 Foundry 项目。\nProject1 包含一个处理 PDF 供应商发票的应用程序。\n你需要在 Foundry Tools 中配置 Azure Document Intelligence,以生成保留 PDF 的章节和表格结构的 Markdown 输出。解决方案必须尽量\n减少开发工作量。\n你应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Configure output=figures when you analyze the PDF.","zh":"在分析 PDF 时配置 output=figures。"},{"id":"B","en":"Configure content=markdown when you analyze the document.","zh":"在分析文档时配置 content=markdown。"},{"id":"C","en":"Increase the confidence threshold.","zh":"提高置信度阈值。"},{"id":"D","en":"Set the output_content_format=ContentFormat.MARKDOWN value.","zh":"设置 output_content_format=ContentFormat.MARKDOWN 值。"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure Document Intelligence 的配置选项,特别是如何生成 Markdown 格式的输出,同时保留 PDF 的结构(如章节和表\n格)。\n重点在于理解 Azure Document Intelligence 的输出格式配置参数。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. Configure output=figures when you analyze the PDF.\n错误:output=figures 是用于提取图像或图表的选项,与生成 Markdown 格式的输出无关。\n此选项无法满足题目要求的“生成 Markdown 输出并保留结构”的需求。\nB. Configure content=markdown when you analyze the document.\n错误:content=markdown 并不是 Azure Document Intelligence 的有效配置参数。\n此选项是无效的,可能是干扰项。\nC. Increase the confidence threshold.\n错误:提高置信度阈值仅影响模型对数据的准确性要求,与输出格式无关。\n此选项无法解决题目要求的“生成 Markdown 输出并保留结构”的问题。\nD. Set the output_content_format=ContentFormat.MARKDOWN value.\n正确:output_content_format=ContentFormat.MARKDOWN 是 Azure Document Intelligence 的有效配置参数,用于生成 Markdown 格式的输\n出。\n此选项完全符合题目要求,能够生成 Markdown 输出并保留 PDF 的结构。\n3. 我的答案\n我选择的答案是:D\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:D\n5. 比较与思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致。\n原因:D 是唯一正确的选项,能够满足题目要求的“生成 Markdown 输出并保留 PDF 的结构”。其他选项均无法实现这一目标。","pageStart":147,"pageEnd":148,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-147.jpg","assets/pages/page-148.jpg"]},{"id":"q-64","number":64,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that ingests scanned PDF invoices stored in Azure Blob Storage. Each invoice contains printed fine items\nand has a table-based layout.\nExtracted results are stored as structured JSON and used as grounding data for an agent in a Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) solution.\nYou need to create a single analyzer that meets the following requirements:\nExtracts the invoice number, invoice date, vendor name, and total amount across varying templates\nReturns confidence scores so that results with confidence below 0.80 can be routed for supervisor review\nWhat should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,该项目会从存储在 Azure Blob Storage 中的扫描 PDF 发票中提取数据。每张发票包含打印的详细项\n目,并采用基于表格的布局。\n提取的结果以结构化 JSON 的形式存储,并用作检索增强生成 (RAG) 解决方案中代理的基础数据。\n你需要创建一个单一分析器,满足以下要求:\n提取发票号、发票日期、供应商名称和总金额,适用于不同的模板\n返回置信分数,以便置信度低于 0.80 的结果可以被路由到主管进行审核\n你应该使用什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"a Foundry agent that has groundedness guardrails enabled to extract invoice fields and confidence scores","zh":"一个启用了基础性护栏的 Foundry 代理,用于提取发票字段和置信分数"},{"id":"B","en":"a custom Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools analyzer that defines the required fields as the extracted fields and the returned\nconfidence scores for routing","zh":"一个自定义的 Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools 分析器,该分析器将所需字段定义为提取字段,并返回置信分数以进行\n路由"},{"id":"C","en":"the Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools prebuilt-layout analyzer","zh":"Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools 的预构建布局分析器"},{"id":"D","en":"the Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools prebuilt-documentSearch analyzer and search.score from the Azure AI Search results for\nrouting","zh":"Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools 的预构建文档搜索分析器,以及来自 Azure AI 搜索结果的 search.score 用于路由"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"正确答案:B\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\nAzure AI 服务中的文档处理能力,包括提取结构化数据和置信分数。\n如何使用 Foundry Tools 和 Azure Content Understanding 来处理复杂的文档布局。\n如何设计解决方案以满足特定业务需求,例如置信分数低于阈值时的路由逻辑。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. 一个启用了基础性护栏的 Foundry 代理,用于提取发票字段和置信分数\nFoundry 代理的“基础性护栏”功能主要用于确保生成内容的准确性和相关性,但它并不专注于提取结构化数据(如发票字段)。\n此选项无法满足提取特定字段(如发票号、日期等)以及返回置信分数的需求。\n错误。\nB. 一个自定义的 Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools 分析器,该分析器将所需字段定义为提取字段,并返回置信分数以进行\n路由\n此选项允许用戶自定义分析器以提取特定字段(如发票号、日期等),并且可以返回置信分数用于后续路由逻辑。\n完全符合题目要求,能够处理不同模板的发票并提供置信分数。\n正确。\nC. Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools 的预构建布局分析器\n预构建布局分析器可以处理表格布局的文档,但它的功能是通用的,无法针对特定字段(如发票号、日期等)进行定制化提取。\n此外,它可能无法直接返回置信分数用于路由逻辑。\n错误。\nD. Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools 的预构建文档搜索分析器,以及来自 Azure AI 搜索结果的 search.score 用于路由\n文档搜索分析器主要用于搜索相关内容,而不是提取结构化数据(如发票字段)。\nsearch.score 是搜索结果的相关性分数,与置信分数的概念不同,无法满足题目要求。\n错误。\n3. 我的选择\n答案:B\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案:B\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,均为B。\n原因:选项 B 是唯一能够满足题目所有要求的解决方案,包括提取特定字段、处理不同模板的发票以及返回置信分数用于路由逻\n辑。","pageStart":149,"pageEnd":150,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-149.jpg","assets/pages/page-150.jpg"]},{"id":"q-65","number":65,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that uses Azure AI Search to ground an agent in internal documentation.\nAfter a recent content update, users report that the agent’s answers have become less accurate.\nYou need to identify whether the retrieved content is negatively influencing the model’s generated responses.\nWhich observability signal should you review?","questionZh":"你有一个微软Foundry项目,该项目使用Azure AI Search将代理与内部文档连接起来。\n在最近的内容更新后,用戶报告代理的回答变得不那么准确。\n你需要确定检索到的内容是否对模型生成的响应产生了负面影响。\n你应该查看哪个可观察性信号?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"indexer status and failure history","zh":"索引器状态和失败历史"},{"id":"B","en":"latency breakdown traces","zh":"延迟分解跟踪"},{"id":"C","en":"prediction drift metrics","zh":"预测漂移指标"},{"id":"D","en":"groundedness evaluation metrics","zh":"扎根性评估指标"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"正确答案:D\n题目分析与解答\n1. 考察的知识点\n本题考察的是 Azure AI Search 的观测信号(Observability Signals),尤其是如何评估模型生成的答案与检索内容的相关性。\n重点在于理解如何通过信号来诊断模型生成答案的准确性问题。\n2. 独立分析每个选项\nA. indexer status and failure history 索引器状态和失败历史\n分析:索引器状态和失败历史主要用于检查数据是否成功被索引到搜索服务中。如果索引器失败,可能会导致数据缺失,但这与模\n型生成答案的准确性问题无直接关系。因此此选项不适合用于评估检索内容对模型答案的影响。\n结论:错误。\nB. latency breakdown traces 延迟分解跟踪\n分析:延迟分解跟踪用于分析系统性能问题,例如查询响应时间或服务延迟。这与用戶报告的答案准确性问题无直接关联,因此无\n法帮助诊断检索内容对模型生成答案的影响。\n结论:错误。\nC. prediction drift metrics 预测漂移指标\n分析:预测漂移指标用于监控模型预测结果随时间的变化,通常用于检测模型是否偏离预期行为。然而,本题关注的是检索内容对\n生成答案的影响,而不是模型预测结果的漂移,因此此选项不适合。\n结论:错误。\nD. groundedness evaluation metrics 扎根性评估指标\n分析:扎根性评估指标用于衡量模型生成的答案是否基于检索到的内容。这正是本题所描述的问题——用戶报告答案不准确,可能是\n因为检索内容对生成答案的负面影响。因此,查看扎根性评估指标是解决问题的正确方法。\n结论:正确。\n3. 我的选择\n我选择的答案是:D. groundedness evaluation metrics 扎根性评估指标\n4. 官方答案\n官方答案是:D. groundedness evaluation metrics 扎根性评估指标\n5. 比较与重新思考\n我的答案与官方答案一致,均为D。\n原因:扎根性评估指标直接针对检索内容对生成答案的影响,是解决用戶报告问题的最佳信号。","pageStart":151,"pageEnd":152,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-151.jpg","assets/pages/page-152.jpg"]},{"id":"q-66","number":66,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"visual","questionEn":"You need to ensure that the marketing department can generate videos by using the model deployed to Project2.\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"您需要确保市场营销部⻔能够使用部署到 Project2 的模型生成视频。\n您应如何完成 Python 代码?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值得一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:create","item2:retrieve"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是如何使用 OpenAI 的 Python SDK 与 Azure OpenAI 服务交互,特别是视频生成模型的操作,包括创建视频任务和\n检索任务状态。\n选项逐一分析\ncreate:正确。此方法用于创建视频生成任务,符合题目要求的“生成视频”功能。\ndownload_content:错误。此方法用于下载生成的内容,但题目要求的是创建任务和检索任务状态,而非下载内容。\nlist:错误。此方法用于列出所有视频任务,与题目要求的具体任务创建和状态检索无关。\nretrieve:正确。此方法用于检索指定任务的详细信息,包括状态,符合题目要求的“监控任务状态”。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:create, retrieve\n官方答案\n官方答案:create, retrieve\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:根据 OpenAI Python SDK 的功能,create 方法用于创建视频生成任务,retrieve 方法用于检索任务状态,完全符合题目要\n求。","pageStart":153,"pageEnd":160,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-153.jpg","assets/pages/page-154.jpg","assets/pages/page-155.jpg","assets/pages/page-156.jpg","assets/pages/page-157.jpg","assets/pages/page-158.jpg","assets/pages/page-159.jpg","assets/pages/page-160.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Create video job","answer":"create","choices":["create","download_content","list","retrieve"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Retrieve job","answer":"retrieve","choices":["create","download_content","list","retrieve"]}]},{"id":"q-67","number":67,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"single","questionEn":"You need to configure personalized user interactions for Agent1. The solution must meet the business requirements.\nWhat should you include in the solution?","questionZh":"您需要为 Agent1 配置个性化用戶互动。解决方案必须满足业务需求。\n您应该在解决方案中包含什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"knowledge","zh":"知识"},{"id":"B","en":"memory","zh":"记忆"},{"id":"C","en":"guardrails","zh":"防护措施"},{"id":"D","en":"tools","zh":"工具"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"建议答案:B\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是如何配置个性化用戶交互功能,重点在于理解和应用“记忆(Memory)”功能以满足业务需求。\n选项分析\nA. knowledge(知识)\n错误:“知识”功能主要用于存储和检索结构化或非结构化数据,以便模型回答问题。虽然知识库可以帮助Agent1回答关于产品的问\n题,但它并不直接支持个性化交互或记住用戶的上下文信息,因此不符合题目要求。\nB. memory(记忆)\n正确:“记忆”功能允许Agent1保留用戶交互的上下文信息,并在后续对话中回忆相关内容。这正是题目中要求的个性化用戶交互功能\n的核心,能够满足业务需求中提到的“保留对话上下文”和“回忆相关信息”。\nC. guardrails(防护措施)\n错误:“防护措施”功能用于确保生成的内容符合安全和合规要求,例如防止泄露敏感信息或执行恶意指令。虽然防护措施是重要的\n安全功能,但它与个性化交互无关,因此不符合题目要求。\nD. tools(工具)\n错误:“工具”功能允许模型调用外部API或执行特定任务,例如数据查询或计算。虽然工具可以扩展模型的功能,但它并不支持个性\n化交互或记住用戶上下文,因此不符合题目要求。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:B\n官方答案\n官方答案:B\n答案比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:“记忆”功能能够满足题目中关于个性化用戶交互的业务需求,包括保留对话上下文和回忆相关信息。这是基于技术功能\n的准确选择。","pageStart":161,"pageEnd":167,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-161.jpg","assets/pages/page-162.jpg","assets/pages/page-163.jpg","assets/pages/page-164.jpg","assets/pages/page-165.jpg","assets/pages/page-166.jpg","assets/pages/page-167.jpg"]},{"id":"q-68","number":68,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":"contoso-case","type":"visual","questionEn":"You need to ensure that Agent1Dev Team can access Agent1. The solution must meet the security and compliance requirements.\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"您需要确保 Agent1Dev Team 能够访问 Agent1。解决方案必须满足安全和合规性要求。\n您应如何完成 Python 代码?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值得一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:DefaultAzureCredential()","item2:get"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是如何使用 Azure SDK for Python 访问 Microsoft Foundry 项目资源,并正确配置身份验证和 API 调用以满足安全和\n合规要求。\n具体技术:Azure SDK 中的身份验证机制(如 DefaultAzureCredential)和 AIProjectClient 的方法(如 get 和 get_version)。\n选项逐一分析\ncredential 参数选项:\nAzureKeyCredential:错误。题目明确要求不能使用 API 密钥(API keys),而 AzureKeyCredential 是基于密钥的认证方式,不符合安全\n和合规要求。\nDefaultAzureCredential:正确。DefaultAzureCredential 是 Azure SDK 提供的推荐身份验证方式,支持 Microsoft Entra ID(以前称为 Azure\nAD)认证,符合题目要求的“使用 Microsoft Entra 身份验证”。\nNone:错误。未提供任何认证方式会导致无法访问资源,且不符合题目要求的安全性和合规性。\nagent 方法选项:\ncreate_version:错误。此方法用于创建新的代理版本,而题目要求是“检索”现有代理信息,因此不适用。\nget:正确。get 方法用于检索现有代理的基本信息,符合题目要求“确保 Agent1Dev Team 能访问 Agent1”。\nget_version:错误。get_version 方法用于检索代理的特定版本信息,但题目并未提到需要版本级别的细节,仅要求检索代理的基本信\n息,因此不适用。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:DefaultAzureCredential() 和 get\n官方答案\n官方答案:DefaultAzureCredential() 和 get\n答案比较\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n确认理由:DefaultAzureCredential 符合身份验证要求,get 方法符合检索代理信息的需求,均符合题目要求。","pageStart":168,"pageEnd":175,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-168.jpg","assets/pages/page-169.jpg","assets/pages/page-170.jpg","assets/pages/page-171.jpg","assets/pages/page-172.jpg","assets/pages/page-173.jpg","assets/pages/page-174.jpg","assets/pages/page-175.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Credential","answer":"DefaultAzureCredential()","choices":["AzureKeyCredential()","DefaultAzureCredential()","None"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Method","answer":"get","choices":["create_version","get","get_version"]}]},{"id":"q-69","number":69,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"multiple","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) chat solution used by customer support agents.\nYou are adding an automated pre-production evaluation step to a CI/CD pipeline named Pipeline1. The evaluation will run against a labeled test\ndataset that contains support questions and the expected grounding context.\nYou need to ensure that Pipeline1 fails if unsupported content or a retrieval mismatch exceeds a defined threshold:\n• responses include claims not supported by the retrieved source content\n• retrieved source content does not align with the labeled expected context\nWhich two built-in evaluators should you use in Pipeline1? Each correct answer presents pat of the solution.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"你有一个包含检索增强生成(RAG)聊天解决方案的 Microsoft Foundry 项目,该解决方案由客戶支持代理使用。\n你正在为名为 Pipeline1 的 CI/CD 管道添加一个自动化的预生产评估步骤。评估将针对一个标记的测试数据集运行,该数据集包含支\n持问题和预期的基础上下文。\n你需要确保如果不支持的内容或检索不匹配超过定义的阈值,Pipeline1 会失败:\n• 响应包含检索到的源内容未支持的声明\n• 检索到的源内容与标记的预期上下文不一致\n在 Pipeline1 中应使用哪两个内置评估器?每个正确答案都是解决方案的一部分。\n注意:每个正确选择值一分。","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Retrieval","zh":"检索"},{"id":"B","en":"Fluency","zh":"流畅性"},{"id":"C","en":"Coherence","zh":"连贯性"},{"id":"D","en":"Groundedness","zh":"基础性"},{"id":"E","en":"Response Completeness","zh":"响应完整性"}],"answer":["A","D"],"analysis":"建议答案:AD\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Microsoft Foundry 项目中 RAG(检索增强生成)解决方案的自动化评估功能,特别是内置评估器的选择。重\n点关注“检索”和“内容是否与检索源一致”的评估能力。\n选项逐一分析\nA. Retrieval:正确。检索评估器用于评估检索到的内容是否与预期的上下文一致。这直接对应题目中提到的“检索源内容与标注的预\n期上下文不一致”的问题。\nB. Fluency:错误。流畅性评估器用于检查生成的文本是否符合语言流畅性标准,与题目中提到的“检索不一致”或“未支持的内容”无\n关。\nC. Coherence:错误。连贯性评估器用于检查生成的文本是否在逻辑上连贯,与题目要求的检索一致性或内容支持性无直接关联。\nD. Groundedness:正确。扎根性评估器用于检查生成的响应是否基于检索到的源内容,直接对应题目中提到的“响应包含未被检索源\n支持的声明”的问题。\nE. Response Completeness:错误。响应完整性评估器用于检查生成的响应是否全面回答了问题,与题目中提到的检索一致性或内容\n支持性无直接关联。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:A, D\n官方答案\n官方答案:A, D\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:检索(Retrieval)和扎根性(Groundedness)评估器直接解决了题目中提到的两个问题:检索内容与预期上下文的一致\n性,以及生成响应是否基于检索源内容。这是基于技术功能的准确选择。","pageStart":176,"pageEnd":177,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-176.jpg","assets/pages/page-177.jpg"]},{"id":"q-70","number":70,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a support-ticket triage agent built by using the Foundry Agent Service.\nThe agent uses tool to classify the ticket type and sot the ticket priority.\nSometimes, the same support case continues across multiple sessions over several days.\nYou need to persist state by using a durable ID to ensure that the agent can automatically reuse the full interaction history. The solution must\npreserve previous user messages, tool calls and tool outputs across turns and sessions.\nWhich runtime component should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个包含支持工单分类代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目,该代理是使用 Foundry Agent Service 构建的。\n该代理使用工具来分类工单类型并排序工单优先级。\n有时,同一个支持案例会在几天内跨多个会话继续进行。\n你需要使用一个持久化 ID 来保存状态,以确保代理能够自动重用完整的交互历史记录。解决方案必须在多个轮次和会话中保留之前\n的用戶消息、工具调用和工具输出。\n你应该使用哪个运行时组件?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"output item","zh":"输出项"},{"id":"B","en":"agent","zh":"代理"},{"id":"C","en":"conversation","zh":"会话"},{"id":"D","en":"response","zh":"响应"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"建议答案:C\n知识点分析\n测试的具体知识点:本题考察的是 Microsoft Foundry Agent Service 中的会话状态持久化功能,特别是如何使用持久化 ID 来保存和重\n用交互历史,包括用戶消息、工具调用和工具输出。\n选项逐一分析\nA. output item:错误。Output item 是指代理生成的输出内容(如响应文本或工具调用结果),它是单次交互的结果,无法用于跨会话\n的状态持久化。\nB. agent:错误。Agent 是整个支持票据分流系统的核心组件,但它本身并不直接负责会话状态的持久化。会话状态的管理通常由专\n⻔的会话组件处理。\nC. conversation:正确。Conversation 是 Foundry Agent Service 中用于管理会话状态的组件。它支持通过持久化 ID 保存和重用交互历\n史,确保跨会话的连续性,包括用戶消息、工具调用和工具输出。\nD. response:错误。Response 是代理生成的单次响应内容,类似于 output item,无法用于跨会话的状态持久化。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:C\n官方答案\n官方答案:C\n比较与验证\n官方答案与推荐答案一致。\n理由:Conversation 是唯一能够满足题目要求的组件,支持通过持久化 ID 保存和重用交互历史,确保跨会话的连续性。","pageStart":178,"pageEnd":179,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-178.jpg","assets/pages/page-179.jpg"]},{"id":"q-71","number":71,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Founcy project that contains a Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) solution.\nYou need to run a pre-production evaluation by using labeled CSV dataset that contains the query, context, response and ground truth. The\nevaluation must measure the following:\n• Whether responses address the user query\n• Whether responses are supported by the provided context\n• Whether responses contain sensitive or proprietary information\nWhich AI quality evaluation metrics should you use? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您有一个包含检索增强生成 (RAG) 解决方案的 Microsoft Founcy 项目。\n您需要使用包含查询、上下文、响应和真实值的标记 CSV 数据集运行预生产评估。评估必须衡量以下内容:\n• 响应是否解决了用戶查询\n• 响应是否由提供的上下文支持\n• 响应是否包含敏感或专有信息\n您应该使用哪些 AI 质量评估指标?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Groundedness and Relevance","item2:Protected material"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是微软Founcy项目中RAG(检索增强生成)解决方案的质量评估指标。具体涉及如何使用适当的AI质量评估指标\n来评估生成的响应是否符合查询、是否基于上下文支持,以及是否包含敏感或专有信息。\n选项逐一分析\n第一部分:评估响应是否基于上下文支持并回答用戶查询\nCoherence and Fluency:错误。连贯性和流畅性主要用于评估语言生成的自然性和可读性,而不是评估响应是否基于上下文或回答查\n询。\nGPT similarity and F1 score:错误。GPT相似性和F1分数通常用于评估模型生成的文本与参考文本的相似性,但它们无法直接衡量响\n应是否基于上下文支持或回答查询。\nGroundedness and Relevance:正确。Groundedness(扎根性)评估响应是否基于提供的上下文支持,Relevance(相关性)评估响应是\n否回答了用戶的查询。这两个指标直接符合题目要求。\nGroundedness and ROUGE score:错误。ROUGE分数主要用于评估文本摘要的质量,与上下文支持和查询回答的评估无直接关联。\n第二部分:评估响应是否包含敏感或专有信息\nHateful and unfair content:错误。此指标用于检测仇恨或不公平内容,与敏感或专有信息无关。\nIndirect attack:错误。间接攻击指标用于检测攻击性语言,与专有或敏感信息的检测无直接关联。\nProtected material:正确。此指标专⻔用于检测生成内容中是否包含敏感或专有信息,符合题目要求。\nViolent content:错误。暴力内容指标用于检测暴力语言,与专有或敏感信息的检测无直接关联。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:Groundedness and Relevance;Protected material\n官方答案\n官方答案:Groundedness and Relevance;Protected material\n答案比较\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。官方答案正确,因为它准确选择了符合题目要求的评估指标。","pageStart":180,"pageEnd":181,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-180.jpg","assets/pages/page-181.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Quality metrics","answer":"Groundedness and Relevance","choices":["Coherence and Fluency","GPT similarity and F1 score","Groundedness and Relevance","Groundedness and ROUGE score"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Safety metric","answer":"Protected material","choices":["Hateful and unfair content","Indirect attack","Protected material","Violent content"]}]},{"id":"q-72","number":72,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"multiple","questionEn":"You plan to configure an evaluation in Microsoft Foundry for a Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) chat app.\nYou need to provide scores for groundedness, relevance, and harmful content categories.\nWhich two evaluation categories can you use? Each correct answer presents a complete solution.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"您计划在 Microsoft Foundry 中为一个检索增强生成 (RAG) 聊天应用配置评估。\n您需要为扎实性、相关性和有害内容类别提供评分。\n您可以使用哪两个评估类别?每个正确答案都构成一个完整的解决方案。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[{"id":"A","en":"risk and safety metrics","zh":"⻛险和安全指标"},{"id":"B","en":"fluency evaluator","zh":"流畅性评估器"},{"id":"C","en":"similarity evaluators","zh":"相似性评估器"},{"id":"D","en":"AI quality (NLP) metrics","zh":"AI 质量(NLP)指标"},{"id":"E","en":"AI quality (AI assisted) metrics","zh":"AI 质量(AI 辅助)指标"}],"answer":["A","E"],"analysis":"建议答案:AE\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Microsoft Foundry 中用于评估 RAG(检索增强生成)聊天应用的评估类别,特别是如何衡量 groundedness(扎\n根性)、relevance(相关性)和 harmful content(有害内容)。涉及的概念包括 AI 质量评估和相关的指标体系。\n选项逐一分析\nA. risk and safety metrics:错误。⻛险和安全指标主要用于评估模型的安全性和潜在⻛险,但它们并不直接与 groundedness 或\nrelevance 相关,也不专⻔用于评估有害内容。\nB. fluency evaluator:错误。流畅性评估器主要用于衡量生成文本的语言流畅性,与 groundedness、relevance 或 harmful content 的评估\n无直接关联。\nC. similarity evaluators:正确。相似性评估器可以用于衡量生成内容与参考内容之间的相关性(relevance),这与题目要求的评估类\n别之一直接相关。\nD. AI quality (NLP) metrics:正确。AI 质量(NLP)指标通常包括 groundedness 和 relevance 的评估方法,同时也可能涉及有害内容的\n检测,因此符合题目要求。\nE. AI quality (AI assisted) metrics:错误。AI 辅助质量指标通常用于评估 AI 辅助任务的效率或效果,与 groundedness、relevance 或\nharmful content 的评估无直接关联。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:CD\n官方答案\n官方答案:AE\n答案比较与解释\n比较结果:官方答案 AE 不正确。\n解释:选项 A(risk and safety metrics)与题目要求的评估类别无直接关联;选项 E(AI quality (AI assisted) metrics)也不符合题目要\n求。选项 C(similarity evaluators)和 D(AI quality (NLP) metrics)更符合 groundedness 和 relevance 的评估需求。","pageStart":182,"pageEnd":183,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-182.jpg","assets/pages/page-183.jpg"]},{"id":"q-73","number":73,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent uses two tools to perform the following actions:\n• Use Azure AI Search to retrieve answers from a private product documentation index.\n• Use the web search tool to retrieve public information on the internet.\nYou need to ensure that for a specific run, the agent deterministically retrieves information only from the internet.\nTo what should you set tool_choice?","questionZh":"您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个代理。该代理使用两种工具来执行以下操作:\n• 使用 Azure AI Search 从私有产品文档索引中检索答案。\n• 使用网络搜索工具从互联网上检索公共信息。\n您需要确保在特定运行中,代理仅从互联网上确定性地检索信息。\n工具选择应设置为什么值?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"{“type”: “bing_grouding”}\n{“type”: “bing_grouding”}","zh":""},{"id":"B","en":"{“type”: “azure_ai-search”}\n{“type”: “azure_ai-search”}","zh":""},{"id":"C","en":"“auto”\n“auto”","zh":""},{"id":"D","en":"“required”\n“required”","zh":""}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"建议答案:A\n知识点分析\n知识点:此问题测试的是 Microsoft Foundry 项目中 agent 的工具选择机制(tool_choice),特别是如何配置工具以确保 agent 在特定运\n行中仅从互联网检索信息。\n涉及的具体技术包括 Azure AI Search 和 web search tool 的使用,以及工具选择参数的配置。\n选项逐一分析\nA. {“type”: “bing_grouding”}\n正确:此选项表示工具类型为 Bing Grounding(即 web search tool)。根据题目要求,agent 需要仅从互联网检索信息,而 Bing\nGrounding 是专⻔用于从公共互联网获取信息的工具。因此此选项符合题目要求。\nB. {“type”: “azure_ai-search”}\n错误:此选项表示工具类型为 Azure AI Search,它用于从私有文档索引中检索信息,而非从互联网检索信息。题目明确要求仅从互联\n网获取信息,因此此选项不符合要求。\nC. “auto”\n错误:“auto”表示 agent 会根据上下文自动选择最合适的工具。这种设置可能导致 agent 同时使用 Azure AI Search 和 Bing Grounding,\n而题目要求的是“仅从互联网检索信息”,因此此选项不符合要求。\nD. “required”\n错误:“required”通常用于强制 agent 使用某个工具,但它并未明确指定工具类型(如 Bing Grounding 或 Azure AI Search)。题目要求的\n是确保 agent 仅从互联网检索信息,因此此选项不够具体,无法满足要求。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:A\n官方答案\n官方答案:A\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:根据题目要求,agent 需要仅从互联网检索信息,而 Bing Grounding 是专⻔用于此目的的工具。A 是正确的选择。","pageStart":184,"pageEnd":185,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-184.jpg","assets/pages/page-185.jpg"]},{"id":"q-74","number":74,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a customer support agent built on a deployed chat model.\nThe agent responses are validated by using an automated testing system that compares generated answers to stored expected outputs. Identical\nprompts must return consistent response to prevent automated test failures.\nYou need to reduce response variability, without modifying the prompt or reducing factual accuracy.\nWhat should you do for the model?","questionZh":"你有一个包含基于已部署聊天模型的客戶支持代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n代理的回复通过使用自动测试系统进行验证,该系统将生成的答案与存储的预期输出进行比较。相同的提示必须返回一致的回复,\n以防止自动测试失败。\n你需要减少回复的变异性,同时不修改提示或降低事实准确性。\n你应该对模型做什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Increase the max_tokens parameter.","zh":"增加 max_tokens 参数。"},{"id":"B","en":"Remove stop sequences from the requests.","zh":"从请求中移除停止序列。"},{"id":"C","en":"Decrease the temperature parameter.","zh":"降低 temperature 参数。"},{"id":"D","en":"Increase the temperature parameter.","zh":"增加 temperature 参数。"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"建议答案:C\n知识点分析\n知识点:此问题测试的是如何通过调整模型参数来减少生成响应的变异性(response variability),特别是 OpenAI 或类似语言模型中\n的“temperature”参数的作用。\n相关概念包括:temperature 参数(控制生成文本的随机性)、max_tokens 参数(控制生成文本的⻓度)、以及stop sequences(用于终\n止生成的标记)。\n选项逐一分析\nA. Increase the max_tokens parameter\n错误:max_tokens 参数决定生成文本的最大⻓度,与减少响应变异性无直接关系。增加 max_tokens 可能导致生成更⻓的文本,但不\n会直接影响一致性。\nB. Remove stop sequences from the requests\n错误:stop sequences 用于定义生成文本的终止条件,移除它们可能导致生成的文本更⻓或不受限制,但不会减少变异性。实际上,\n这可能增加响应的不一致性。\nC. Decrease the temperature parameter\n正确:temperature 参数控制生成文本的随机性。降低 temperature 值(例如从 1 降到 0.2)会使模型更倾向于选择概率最高的词,从\n而减少变异性并提高一致性。\nD. Increase the temperature parameter\n错误:增加 temperature 值会提高生成文本的随机性,使模型更倾向于探索概率较低的词。这会增加响应的变异性,与题目要求相\n反。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:C\n官方答案\n官方答案:C\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:降低 temperature 是减少生成文本变异性的一种标准方法,符合题目要求且技术逻辑正确。","pageStart":186,"pageEnd":187,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-186.jpg","assets/pages/page-187.jpg"]},{"id":"q-75","number":75,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are developing prompts for a Micosoft Foundry project that classifies incoming support tickets by category.\nYou need to improve accuracy by showing the model how correct classifications look, without retaining the model or storing knowledge\npermanently.\nWhich prompt engineering approach should you use?","questionZh":"您正在为一个微软Foundry项目开发提示,该项目按类别对收到的支持工单进行分类。\n您需要通过向模型展示正确分类的样子来提高准确性,但不能重新训练模型或永久存储知识。\n您应该使用哪种提示工程方法?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)","zh":"检索增强生成(RAG)"},{"id":"B","en":"zero-shot learning","zh":"零样本学习"},{"id":"C","en":"chain of thought","zh":"思维链"},{"id":"D","en":"few-shot learning","zh":"少样本学习"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"建议答案:D\n知识点\n知识点:本题测试的是“提示工程(Prompt Engineering)”中的具体方法,尤其是如何通过提供示例来提高模型的分类准确性,而无需\n重新训练模型或永久存储知识。\n相关概念:“Few-shot learning”是一种提示工程技术,通过在提示中提供少量示例来帮助模型理解任务;“Zero-shot learning”则无需提供\n示例;“Chain of thought”通过分步推理提高复杂任务的准确性;“RAG”结合检索和生成以增强模型性能。\n选项分析\nA. Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG):错误\nRAG是一种结合检索和生成的技术,通常用于从外部知识库中检索相关信息并生成答案。它需要访问外部数据源,并不符合题目要\n求的“无需存储知识”条件。\nB. Zero-shot learning:错误\nZero-shot learning无需提供示例,直接依赖模型的预训练能力进行分类。虽然可以避免存储知识,但它无法通过展示正确分类示例来\n提高准确性,因此不符合题目要求。\nC. Chain of thought:错误\nChain of thought是一种通过分步推理来解决复杂问题的技术,适用于需要逻辑推理的任务,而非简单的分类任务。题目未提及需要\n分步推理,因此此选项不适用。\nD. Few-shot learning:正确\nFew-shot learning通过在提示中提供少量示例来帮助模型理解任务,从而提高分类准确性。它无需重新训练模型或永久存储知识,完\n全符合题目要求。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:D\n官方答案\n官方答案:D\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:Few-shot learning通过提供示例来提高模型的分类准确性,同时符合题目要求的“不重新训练模型”和“不存储知识”条件,因\n此是正确答案。","pageStart":188,"pageEnd":189,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-188.jpg","assets/pages/page-189.jpg"]},{"id":"q-76","number":76,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent for a customer support chat app. The agent uses a memory store and a memory\nsearch tool.\nYou need to ensure that the conversation history does NOT persist across separate sessions.\nTo what should you set the scope of the memory tool?","questionZh":"你有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个用于客戶支持聊天应用的代理。该代理使用内存存储和内存搜索工具。\n你需要确保对话历史不会在不同的会话之间保留。\n应该将内存工具的范围设置为什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"session","zh":"会话"},{"id":"B","en":"{{$conversationId}}\n{{$conversationId}}","zh":""},{"id":"C","en":"{{$userId}}\n{{$userId}}","zh":""},{"id":"D","en":"global","zh":"全局"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"建议答案:A\n知识点\n测试知识点:本题考察的是 Microsoft Foundry 项目中记忆工具的作用域设置,具体涉及会话历史的存储范围控制。\n相关概念:记忆工具的作用域(Scope)决定了数据存储的范围,例如是否在会话、用戶或全局级别共享数据。\n选项分析\nA. session:正确。将作用域设置为 \"session\" 意味着记忆工具仅在当前会话期间存储数据,且会话结束后数据不会保留。这完全符合\n题目要求,即确保会话历史不跨会话持久化。\nB. {{$conversationId}}:错误。虽然 {{$conversationId}} 可以用于标识特定会话,但它通常用于动态标记,而非直接设置记忆工具的作\n用域。此选项未明确保证会话结束后数据不会保留。\nC. {{$userId}}:错误。将作用域设置为 \"{{$userId}}\" 会导致记忆工具在用戶级别共享数据,即同一用戶的所有会话都可以访问相同的\n记忆数据。这与题目要求的“会话历史不跨会话持久化”相违背。\nD. global:错误。将作用域设置为 \"global\" 意味着记忆工具的数据在所有用戶和会话之间共享。这完全不符合题目要求,因为会话历\n史会在所有会话中持久化。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:A\n官方答案\n官方答案:A\n比较:推荐答案与官方答案一致。设置作用域为 \"session\" 是正确的选择,因为它确保会话历史不会跨会话持久化。","pageStart":190,"pageEnd":190,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-190.jpg"]},{"id":"q-77","number":77,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nYou need to enable long-term memory to ensure that the agent can recall user preferences across separate conversations. Stored memories must\nbe isolated per authenticated user without the client application manually generating user IDs.\nHow should you complete the Python code? To answer, drag the appropriate values to the correct targets. Each value may be used once, more\nthan once, or not at all.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"拖放\n-\n您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n您需要启用⻓期记忆,以确保代理能够在不同的对话中记住用戶偏好。存储的记忆必须针对每个经过身份验证的用戶进行隔离,而\n无需客戶端应用程序手动生成用戶 ID。\n您应该如何完成 Python 代码?要回答此问题,请将适当的值拖到正确的目标位置。每个值可以使用一次、多次或不使用。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值得一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:\"{{$userId}}\"","item2:[memory_tool]"],"analysis":"官方答案：原 PDF 未提供可识别的 Correct Answer\n核验说明\nPDF 第 191-192 页的 Correct Answer 为空或未识别到选中项，因此没有足够依据生成官方答案。\n本题保留原题页供人工查看，不参与自动判分，请根据原题资料自行核验。","pageStart":191,"pageEnd":192,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-191.jpg","assets/pages/page-192.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"scope =","answer":"\"{{$userId}}\"","choices":["\"session\"","\"{{$conversationId}}\"","\"{{$userId}}\""]},{"id":"item2","label":"tools =","answer":"[memory_tool]","choices":["[mem_store_name]","[memory_tool]","MemorySearchTool(\"support_mem_store\")"]}]},{"id":"q-78","number":78,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a web app named App1 that processes user prompts by integrating with a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1. App1 performs the\nfollowing actions:\n• Sends prompts directly to a model by using the Azure OpenAI Responses API\n• Invokes the Azure AI Content Safety tool by using a Foundry connection within the same request\nYou need to configure end-to-end visibility into each step of the request workflow.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您有一个名为 App1 的网络应用程序,该应用程序通过与名为 Project1 的 Microsoft Foundry 项目集成来处理用戶提示。App1 执行以下\n操作:\n• 通过使用 Azure OpenAI Responses API 将提示直接发送到模型\n• 通过在同一请求中使用 Foundry 连接调用 Azure AI 内容安全工具\n您需要配置对请求工作流每个步骤的端到端可⻅性。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Enable logging by using the client SDK for Content Safety.","zh":"通过使用内容安全的客戶端 SDK 启用日志记录。"},{"id":"B","en":"Enable logging by using Foundry Local.","zh":"通过使用 Foundry Local 启用日志记录。"},{"id":"C","en":"Enable application tracing in Project1.","zh":"在 Project1 中启用应用程序跟踪。"},{"id":"D","en":"Route requests through the Azure OpenAI endpoint.","zh":"通过 Azure OpenAI 端点路由请求。"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"建议答案:C\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是如何在使用 Azure OpenAI 和 Azure AI Content Safety 的集成工作流中实现端到端的可⻅性。具体涉及 Azure\nOpenAI Responses API、Azure AI Content Safety 工具,以及 Foundry 项目中的日志记录和追踪功能。\n选项逐一分析\nA. 启用 Content Safety 的客戶端 SDK 日志记录:错误。Content Safety 的客戶端 SDK 日志记录仅能捕获与该工具相关的操作日志,无\n法提供整个工作流的端到端可⻅性,因为它无法追踪 Azure OpenAI Responses API 的调用。\nB. 使用 Foundry Local 启用日志记录:错误。Foundry Local 是一种本地开发工具,主要用于调试和测试 Foundry 项目,而不是用于生\n产环境的端到端可⻅性配置。它无法覆盖整个请求工作流。\nC. 在 Project1 中启用应用程序追踪:正确。Project1 是 Foundry 项目的一部分,启用应用程序追踪可以捕获整个请求工作流的详细信\n息,包括 Azure OpenAI Responses API 和 Content Safety 的调用。这是实现端到端可⻅性的关键步骤。\nD. 将请求通过 Azure OpenAI 端点路由:错误。虽然通过 Azure OpenAI 端点路由请求是工作流的一部分,但这并不能直接提供端到端\n的可⻅性。日志记录和追踪功能需要在 Foundry 项目中配置,而不是仅依赖路由。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:C\n官方答案\n官方答案:C\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:启用应用程序追踪是实现端到端可⻅性的正确方法,因为它能够捕获整个请求工作流的详细信息,包括所有集成的服务\n调用。","pageStart":193,"pageEnd":194,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-193.jpg","assets/pages/page-194.jpg"]},{"id":"q-79","number":79,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains two agents named PolicyWriter and RskReviewer.\nPolicyWriter generates daft updates for customer polices, and RiskReviewer reviews the drafts.\nIn the visual builder, you need to create a workflow that meets the following requirements:\n• Finalizes low-risk updates without manual intervention\n• Ensures predictable execution across the agents\n• Requires user approval for highs updates\nWhat should you configure? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each comet selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含两个代理:PolicyWriter 和 RiskReviewer。\nPolicyWriter 生成客戶政策的草稿更新,RiskReviewer 审核这些草稿。\n在可视化构建器中,您需要创建一个满足以下要求的工作流:\n• 最终确定低⻛险更新,无需人工干预\n• 确保代理之间的可预测执行\n• 高⻛险更新需要用戶批准\n您应该配置什么?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个选项选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:The human-in-the-loop template that pauses execution of the workflow for input","item2:Add a Condition statement."],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Microsoft Foundry 项目中工作流设计的能力,具体涉及到“工作流模板选择”和“审批节点配置”。重点考察对以\n下概念的理解:\n工作流模板:包括顺序模板、群聊模板和人机协作模板。\n审批节点:如何在工作流中添加条件判断或用戶交互节点。\n选项逐一分析\n工作流模板选项\n顺序模板:错误。顺序模板适用于简单的线性工作流,逐节点传递输出,但无法动态处理不同⻛险级别的更新,也不支持用戶审\n批。\n群聊模板:错误。群聊模板用于动态路由控制,适合实时协作,但不适合需要暂停工作流以等待用戶输入的场景。\n人机协作模板:正确。人机协作模板允许工作流在需要用戶审批时暂停执行,符合题目要求的“高⻛险更新需要用戶审批”。\n审批节点选项\n添加基本聊天节点:错误。基本聊天节点用于简单的消息传递,不支持条件判断或用戶审批功能。\n添加条件语句:正确。条件语句可以根据⻛险级别(低⻛险或高⻛险)动态决定工作流的下一步操作,符合题目要求的“确保执行可\n预测”。\n添加提问节点:错误。提问节点用于收集用戶输入,但无法实现条件判断功能,因此不适合本题要求的“低⻛险自动化处理”。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:人机协作模板;添加条件语句\n官方答案\n官方答案:人机协作模板;添加条件语句\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:人机协作模板支持用戶审批,条件语句确保工作流的动态决策能力,完全符合题目要求。","pageStart":195,"pageEnd":196,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-195.jpg","assets/pages/page-196.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Template","answer":"The human-in-the-loop template that pauses execution of the workflow for input","choices":["The sequential template that passes outputs node-by-node","The group chat template to dynamically route control between the agents","The human-in-the-loop template that pauses execution of the workflow for input"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Workflow change","answer":"Add a Condition statement.","choices":["Add a Basic chat node.","Add a Condition statement.","Add an Ask a question node."]}]},{"id":"q-80","number":80,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent named Agent1.\nAgent runs successful, but Foundry Control Plane does NOT display values for error rates, runs, and token usage, and the Traces tab is empty.\nYou need to ensure that Found Control Plane displays the appropriate values for Agent1.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您有一个包含名为 Agent1 的代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n代理运行成功,但 Foundry 控制平面未显示错误率、运行次数和令牌使用的值,并且“跟踪”选项卡为空。\n您需要确保 Foundry 控制平面显示 Agent1 的适当值。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Update Agent1 to a new version.","zh":"将 Agent1 更新到新版本。"},{"id":"B","en":"Restart Agent from Foundry Control Plan","zh":"从 Foundry 控制平面重新启动代理。"},{"id":"C","en":"Assign to a Log Analytics workspace to Agent1.","zh":"为 Agent1 分配一个日志分析工作区。"},{"id":"D","en":"Enable Application Insights for Agent1.","zh":"为 Agent1 启用应用程序洞察。"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"官方答案：D\n答案核验\nPDF 第 197-198 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 D。\n对应选项：D. 为 Agent1 启用应用程序洞察。\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":197,"pageEnd":198,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-197.jpg","assets/pages/page-198.jpg"]},{"id":"q-81","number":81,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe agent uses Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Too to process vendor onboarding packets. The packs include digital PDFs that contain\ntables and hyperlinks.\nThe extracted content is indexed for search and provided to a downstream agent in the Markdown format.\nYou need to generate a Markdown output that has a layout and a semantic structure optimized for Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG)\nworkflows.\nWhich built-in analyzer should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n该代理在 Foundry Too 中使用 Azure 内容理解来处理供应商入驻包。这些包包括包含表格和超链接的数字 PDF。\n提取的内容被索引以供搜索,并以 Markdown 格式提供给下游代理。\n你需要生成一个具有优化布局和语义结构的 Markdown 输出,以适应检索增强生成 (RAG) 工作流。\n应该使用哪个内置分析器?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"prebuilt-documentFieldSchema\nprebuilt-documentFieldSchema","zh":""},{"id":"B","en":"prebuilt-documentSearch\nprebuilt-documentSearch","zh":""},{"id":"C","en":"prebuilt-read\nprebuilt-read","zh":""},{"id":"D","en":"prebuilt-layout\nprebuilt-layout","zh":""}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"官方答案：B\n答案核验\nPDF 第 199-200 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 B。\n对应选项：B. prebuilt-documentSearch\nprebuilt-documentSearch\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":199,"pageEnd":200,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-199.jpg","assets/pages/page-200.jpg"]},{"id":"q-82","number":82,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe agent uses Azure AI Search for Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG).\nYou plan to ingest and index PDF product manuals.\nYou need to build a solution that supports semantic similarity matching. The solution must ensure that the agent retrieves relevant data when user\nquestions use different wording than the product manuals.\nWhich indexing approach should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n该代理使用 Azure AI Search 进行检索增强生成 (RAG)。\n你计划导入并索引 PDF 产品手册。\n你需要构建一个支持语义相似性匹配的解决方案。该解决方案必须确保当用戶问题的措辞与产品手册不同时,代理能够检索到相关\n数据。\n你应该使用哪种索引方法?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"vector search","zh":"向量搜索"},{"id":"B","en":"semantic ranking","zh":"语义排名"},{"id":"C","en":"suggesters","zh":"建议器"},{"id":"D","en":"analyzers","zh":"分析器"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"建议答案:A\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure AI Search 中支持语义相似性匹配的索引方法,特别是在 Retrieval Augmented Generation (RAG) 场景下如何\n处理非结构化数据(如 PDF 手册)以实现语义搜索。\n相关技术:向量搜索(Vector Search)是实现语义相似性匹配的核心技术,因为它能够基于嵌入向量进行语义比较,而不是仅仅依赖\n关键词匹配。\n选项分析\nA. vector search:正确。向量搜索是实现语义相似性匹配的关键技术。它通过将文本转换为嵌入向量,并在向量空间中进行相似性\n比较,能够处理用戶问题与文档内容之间的语义差异。这种方法非常适合 RAG 场景。\nB. semantic ranking:错误。语义排名用于对搜索结果进行排序,而不是索引数据。虽然它可以提高结果的相关性,但它并不是索引\n方法,无法直接解决语义匹配问题。\nC. suggesters:错误。Suggesters 是一种自动完成功能,用于提供用戶输入建议,与语义相似性匹配无关,也不是索引方法。\nD. analyzers:错误。Analyzers 是用于处理文本的工具(如分词、去停用词等),主要用于传统的关键词搜索索引,而不是语义搜索索\n引。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:A\n官方答案\n官方答案:A\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:向量搜索是实现语义相似性匹配的正确方法,能够满足题目中关于“语义匹配”和“不同措辞”的需求。","pageStart":201,"pageEnd":202,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-201.jpg","assets/pages/page-202.jpg"]},{"id":"q-83","number":83,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry agent that grounds responses from an Azure Search index that contains the following:\n• Searchable text fields for product names and product codes\n• A vector field that stores embeddings for product descriptions\nYou need to ensure that users can query the index by using the following:\n• Exact product names or codes\n• Natural language descriptions of the products\nWhat should you configure?","questionZh":"你拥有一个 Microsoft Foundry 代理,该代理基于包含以下内容的 Azure Search 索引生成响应:\n• 产品名称和产品代码的可搜索文本字段\n• 存储产品描述嵌入的向量字段\n你需要确保用戶可以通过以下方式查询索引:\n• 精确的产品名称或代码\n• 产品的自然语言描述\n你应该配置什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"vector search only","zh":"仅向量搜索"},{"id":"B","en":"hybrid search","zh":"混合搜索"},{"id":"C","en":"keyword search only","zh":"仅关键字搜索"},{"id":"D","en":"semantic search only","zh":"仅语义搜索"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"建议答案:B\n知识点\n知识点名称:混合搜索(Hybrid Search)\n相关服务:Azure Cognitive Search\n核心概念:混合搜索结合了关键字搜索和向量搜索,允许用戶通过精确匹配(如产品名称或代码)以及自然语言查询(基于嵌入向\n量)来检索数据。\n选项分析\nA. vector search only:错误。向量搜索仅支持基于嵌入向量的自然语言查询,但无法处理精确匹配(如产品名称或代码)。题目要求\n同时支持两种查询方式,因此仅使用向量搜索无法满足需求。\nB. hybrid search:正确。混合搜索结合了关键字搜索和向量搜索,能够同时支持精确匹配(如产品名称或代码)和自然语言查询\n(基于嵌入向量)。这正是题目所要求的功能。\nC. keyword search only:错误。关键字搜索仅支持精确匹配(如产品名称或代码),无法处理自然语言查询(基于嵌入向量)。题目要\n求同时支持两种查询方式,因此仅使用关键字搜索无法满足需求。\nD. semantic search only:错误。语义搜索是基于向量嵌入的自然语言查询,与向量搜索类似,它无法处理精确匹配(如产品名称或\n代码)。题目要求同时支持两种查询方式,因此仅使用语义搜索无法满足需求。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:B\n官方答案\n官方答案:B\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:混合搜索是唯一能够同时支持精确匹配(如产品名称或代码)和自然语言查询(基于嵌入向量)的选项,符合题目要\n求。","pageStart":203,"pageEnd":204,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-203.jpg","assets/pages/page-204.jpg"]},{"id":"q-84","number":84,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an Azure AI Search indexer that ingests PDF policy manuals.\nClient applications must display page-level citations that have bounding polygons for both text and images.\nYou need to add a single built-in multimodal content extraction skill to the Azure AI Search skillset. The solution must meet the following\nrequirements:\n• Provide text and image location metadata.\n• Extract tables that span multiple pages.\nWhat should you add?","questionZh":"您有一个 Azure AI Search 索引器,用于摄取 PDF 政策手册。\n客戶端应用程序必须显示⻚面级引用,并为文本和图像提供边界多边形。\n您需要向 Azure AI Search 技能集添加一个内置的多模态内容提取技能。解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n• 提供文本和图像位置元数据。\n• 提取跨多个⻚面的表格。\n您应该添加什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Document Extraction","zh":"文档提取"},{"id":"B","en":"Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry Tools 中的 Azure 内容理解"},{"id":"C","en":"GenAI Prompt","zh":"生成式 AI 提示"},{"id":"D","en":"Document Layout","zh":"文档布局"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"官方答案：B\n答案核验\nPDF 第 205-206 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 B。\n对应选项：B. Foundry Tools 中的 Azure 内容理解\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":205,"pageEnd":206,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-205.jpg","assets/pages/page-206.jpg"]},{"id":"q-85","number":85,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are building an Azure AI Search indexing pipeline named Pipeline1 that ingests invoices stored in Azure Blob Storage. The invoices are stored\nas scanned images.\nYou need to enable users to search invoice data across the invoice fields.\nWhich built-in skill should you add to the skillset of Pipeline1?","questionZh":"您正在构建一个名为 Pipeline1 的 Azure AI 搜索索引管道,该管道用于摄取存储在 Azure Blob 存储中的发票。这些发票以扫描图像的\n形式存储。\n您需要使用戶能够在发票字段中搜索发票数据。\n您应该向 Pipeline1 的技能集添加哪种内置技能?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Text Split","zh":"文本拆分"},{"id":"B","en":"Text Translation","zh":"文本翻译"},{"id":"C","en":"optical character recognition (OCR)","zh":"光学字符识别 (OCR)"},{"id":"D","en":"Image Analysis","zh":"图像分析"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"建议答案:C\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure AI Search 的技能集(Skillset)功能,具体涉及处理扫描图像中的文本数据以支持搜索功能。关键技能\n是光学字符识别(OCR),用于从图像中提取文本。\n选项逐一分析\nA. Text Split:错误。Text Split 技能用于将⻓文本分割成较小的片段,便于进一步处理或分析。它不适用于从图像中提取文本。\nB. Text Translation:错误。Text Translation 技能用于翻译文本内容,但前提是已经有可处理的文本数据。它无法直接从图像中提取文\n本。\nC. optical character recognition (OCR):正确。OCR 技能专⻔用于从图像中提取文本数据,是处理扫描图像(如发票)并使其可搜索的\n核心功能。\nD. Image Analysis:错误。Image Analysis 技能用于分析图像的视觉特征(如颜色、标签、对象检测等),但不负责提取文本数据。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:C\n官方答案\n官方答案:C\n答案比较\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。OCR 是正确的选择,因为它能够从扫描图像中提取文本数据,满足题目要求。","pageStart":207,"pageEnd":207,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-207.jpg"]},{"id":"q-86","number":86,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that uses Azure Content Understanding in Foundry Tools to analyze marketing videos.\nVideo segmentation is enabled.\nYou need to configure an analyzer to output a generated JSON field that describes the color scheme of each video segment.\nHow should you configure the analyzer? To answer, drag the appropriate values to the correct targets. Each value may be used once, more than\nonce, or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"拖放\n-\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,该项目在 Foundry Tools 中使用 Azure 内容理解来分析营销视频。\n视频分割已启用。\n您需要配置一个分析器,以输出一个生成的 JSON 字段,该字段描述每个视频片段的配色方案。\n您应该如何配置分析器?要回答此问题,请将适当的值拖到正确的目标位置。每个值可以使用一次、多次或不使用。您可能需要拖\n动窗格之间的分隔条或滚动以查看内容。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:string","item2:generate"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure Content Understanding 的视频分析功能,特别是如何配置分析器以生成描述视频片段颜色方案的 JSON\n字段。这涉及到 Azure Foundry Tools 的视频分割和字段生成功能。\n选项逐一分析\nField value type: string\n正确。JSON 字段通常以字符串形式存储数据,尤其是描述性信息(如颜色方案)。选择“string”作为字段值类型是合理的。\nField value type: table\n错误。表格类型通常用于结构化数据(如行和列),而不是描述性 JSON 数据。颜色方案的描述更适合字符串类型。\nField method: classify\n错误。“classify”用于分类任务,例如将数据分配到预定义类别。生成颜色方案描述不涉及分类任务。\nField method: generate\n正确。“generate”方法用于创建新数据字段,例如生成描述性 JSON 数据。生成颜色方案描述符合此方法的用途。\nField method: group\n错误。“group”方法用于对数据进行分组,而不是生成新字段。它不适用于生成颜色方案描述。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:Field value type: string;Field method: generate\n官方答案\n官方答案:Field value type: string;Field method: generate\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:根据 Azure Content Understanding 的功能,“string”是适合存储 JSON 描述字段的值类型,而“generate”是生成新字段的正确\n方法。这符合题目要求。","pageStart":208,"pageEnd":209,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-208.jpg","assets/pages/page-209.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Field value type","answer":"string","choices":["group","string","table"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Field method","answer":"generate","choices":["classify","generate"]}]},{"id":"q-87","number":87,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an invoice-processing application named App1 that uses Azure Constant Understanding in Foundry Tools.\nYou are building a new Content Understanding pipeline named Pipeline1 that must meet the following requirements:\n• Compare an invoice to its related purchase order\n• Validate the voice against static vendor contact documents\n• Return a single structured output that includes discrepancy findings\nYou need to configure Pipeline1 and expose the pipeline as a single analyzer endpoint. What should you configure?","questionZh":"您有一个名为 App1 的发票处理应用程序,该应用程序使用 Foundry Tools 中的 Azure Constant Understanding。\n您正在构建一个名为 Pipeline1 的新内容理解管道,该管道必须满足以下要求:\n• 将发票与其相关的采购订单进行比较\n• 根据静态供应商联系文档验证发票\n• 返回包含差异发现的单一结构化输出\n您需要配置 Pipeline1 并将该管道作为单一分析器端点公开。您应该如何配置?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"a single-file task in standard mode that uses the vendor contract provided as an additional document during analysis.","zh":"在标准模式下的单文件任务,分析期间使用提供的供应商合同作为附加文档。"},{"id":"B","en":"a single-file task in standard mode that uses confidence scores enabled for the extracted fields.","zh":"在标准模式下的单文件任务,启用对提取字段的置信度评分。"},{"id":"C","en":"a multiple-file task in pro mode that uses the vendor contract files as reference data","zh":"在专业模式下的多文件任务,使用供应商合同文件作为参考数据。"},{"id":"D","en":"a multi-file task in standard mode that uses the invoice and purchase order as input to the analyzer","zh":"在标准模式下的多文件任务,使用发票和采购订单作为分析器的输入。"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"建议答案:C\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure Form Recognizer(表单识别器)中的“Content Understanding”功能,特别是如何配置任务以处理多文件输\n入并生成结构化输出。\n具体涉及:多文件任务(multi-file task)、标准模式(standard mode)与专业模式(pro mode)、参考数据(reference data)、以及如何\n使用额外文档进行分析。\n选项逐一分析\nA. 单文件任务(single-file task)标准模式,使用供应商合同作为额外文档:错误。单文件任务仅处理单一输入文件,无法满足题目\n要求的“比较发票与采购订单”以及“验证供应商合同”的需求。此外,标准模式不支持复杂的多文件比较。\nB. 单文件任务(single-file task)标准模式,启用字段置信度分数:错误。启用置信度分数仅影响提取字段的准确性评估,与题目要\n求的“比较发票与采购订单”或“验证供应商合同”无关。单文件任务仍无法处理多文件输入。\nC. 多文件任务(multi-file task)专业模式,使用供应商合同文件作为参考数据:正确。专业模式支持多文件任务,并允许使用参考\n数据(如供应商合同)进行验证。此配置能够满足题目要求的“比较发票与采购订单”和“验证供应商合同”的需求,同时生成结构化输\n出。\nD. 多文件任务(multi-file task)标准模式,使用发票和采购订单作为分析输入:错误。虽然多文件任务可以处理多个输入文件,但\n标准模式不支持复杂的文件间比较或验证功能,无法满足题目要求的“验证供应商合同”需求。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:C\n官方答案\n官方答案:C\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:专业模式的多文件任务支持复杂的文件间比较和验证功能,能够满足题目要求的所有条件。","pageStart":210,"pageEnd":211,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-210.jpg","assets/pages/page-211.jpg"]},{"id":"q-88","number":88,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that generates short promotional product videos.\nAfter several clips are approved, reviewers notice a small watermark in the top-right corner of some videos.\nYou need to remove the watermark without regenerating the videos.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"你有一个微软Foundry项目,用于生成简短的产品宣传视频。\n在几个片段被批准后,审阅者注意到某些视频的右上⻆有一个小水印。\n你需要在不重新生成视频的情况下移除水印。\n你应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Modify the original prompt to exclude watermarks.","zh":"修改原始提示以排除水印。"},{"id":"B","en":"Crop the video by using the size parameter.","zh":"使用尺寸参数裁剪视频。"},{"id":"C","en":"Increase the guidance scale.","zh":"增加指导比例。"},{"id":"D","en":"Apply a mask-based inpainting edit to the affected part of the video.","zh":"对视频受影响的部分应用基于遮罩的修复编辑。"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"建议答案:D\n知识点\n测试知识点:视频编辑中的水印移除技术,特别是基于人工智能的掩膜修复(Mask-based Inpainting)。\n选项分析\nA. 修改原始提示以排除水印:错误。修改原始提示仅适用于生成新内容,而不是编辑现有视频。题目明确要求不重新生成视频,因\n此此选项不适用。\nB. 使用尺寸参数裁剪视频:部分正确但不理想。裁剪视频可以移除水印,但会导致视频内容丢失(例如画面边缘部分被裁掉),这\n可能影响视频的完整性和质量。\nC. 增加指导比例:错误。指导比例(Guidance Scale)是生成模型中的参数,用于控制生成内容与提示的匹配程度。它与现有视频的\n编辑无关,因此无法解决水印问题。\nD. 对视频受影响部分应用基于掩膜的修复编辑:正确。掩膜修复(Mask-based Inpainting)是一种人工智能技术,可以对视频或图像\n的特定区域进行修复,移除水印而不影响其他部分。这是解决问题的最佳方法。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:D\n官方答案\n官方答案:D\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:掩膜修复技术能够精准移除水印,同时保留视频的其他部分完整性,是最符合题目要求的解决方案。","pageStart":212,"pageEnd":213,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-212.jpg","assets/pages/page-213.jpg"]},{"id":"q-89","number":89,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a web app named App1 that sends requests to a multimodal chat model deployment in a Microsoft Foundry project.\nUser messages can contain both text and images.\nCurrently, App1 includes image URL: as plain text inside the message content so the model cannot recognize them as images.\nTraces show that the requests contain a single text message instead of a multimodal content array.\nYou need to send the message as a structured array that includes both the text portion and the image reference to ensure that the model can\nprocess the image correctly.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您有一个名为 App1 的 Web 应用程序,该应用程序向 Microsoft Foundry 项目中的多模态聊天模型部署发送请求。\n用戶消息可以包含文本和图像。\n目前,App1 将图像 URL 作为纯文本包含在消息内容中,因此模型无法将其识别为图像。\n追踪显示,请求仅包含单一文本消息,而不是多模态内容数组。\n您需要将消息作为一个结构化数组发送,其中包括文本部分和图像引用,以确保模型能够正确处理图像。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Set the user message content array to include items that have type: text and type: image_url.","zh":"将用戶消息内容数组设置为包含类型为 text 和类型为 image_url 的项目。"},{"id":"B","en":"Encode the image to base64 and include the encoded data inside the content string of the user message.","zh":"将图像编码为 base64,并将编码后的数据包含在用戶消息的内容字符串中。"},{"id":"C","en":"Add the image URL to the request metadata section, so the model can resolve the processing issue automatically.","zh":"将图像 URL 添加到请求的元数据部分,以便模型可以自动解决处理问题。"},{"id":"D","en":"Place the image URL inside the System Message and set type to image_url so the model loads the image at initialization.","zh":"将图像 URL 放置在系统消息中,并将类型设置为 image_url,以便模型在初始化时加载图像。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"建议答案:A\n知识点\n测试知识点:Microsoft Foundry项目中的多模态聊天模型如何正确处理包含文本和图像的消息。\n具体概念:多模态内容数组的结构化消息格式,包括文本和图像的正确类型定义。\n选项分析\nA. Set the user message content array to include items that have type: text and type: image_url.\n正确:多模态聊天模型需要结构化的内容数组,其中每个项目必须明确指定类型(如文本或图像)。将消息内容设置为包含类型\n为\"text\"和\"image_url\"的项目,符合模型处理多模态输入的要求。\nB. Encode the image to base64 and include the encoded data inside the content string of the user message.\n错误:将图像编码为Base64并嵌入到内容字符串中不符合多模态聊天模型的输入格式要求。模型需要明确的结构化数组,而不是嵌\n入式字符串。\nC. Add the image URL to the request metadata section, so the model can resolve the processing issue automatically.\n错误:将图像URL添加到请求的元数据部分不会自动解决问题。多模态模型无法从元数据中提取图像信息,必须通过内容数组明确\n传递。\nD. Place the image URL inside the System Message and set type to image_url so the model loads the image at initialization.\n错误:系统消息通常用于设置模型行为或上下文,而不是传递用戶输入的多模态内容。将图像URL放入系统消息并设置类型\n为\"image_url\"不符合模型的输入要求。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:A\n官方答案\n官方答案:A\n比较:推荐答案与官方答案一致。选项A正确地描述了如何构造多模态内容数组以满足模型的输入要求。","pageStart":214,"pageEnd":215,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-214.jpg","assets/pages/page-215.jpg"]},{"id":"q-90","number":90,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are building a customer support web app named App1 in Microsoft Foundry that uses a GPT realtime model.\nApp1 must support:\n• Live, low-latency voice conversations that use Azure OpenAI\n• Streaming audio input from users and playback audio responses\nYou need to configure a connection method that supports real-time audio streaming in client application and targets approximately 100 ms\nlatency.\nWhich connection method should you use?","questionZh":"您正在 Microsoft Foundry 中构建一个名为 App1 的客戶支持 Web 应用程序,该应用程序使用 GPT 实时模型。\nApp1 必须支持:\n• 使用 Azure OpenAI 的实时、低延迟语音对话\n• 从用戶处流式传输音频输入并播放音频响应\n您需要配置一种连接方法,以支持客戶端应用程序中的实时音频流,并将延迟控制在大约 100 毫秒。\n您应该使用哪种连接方法?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"RTMP\nRTMP","zh":""},{"id":"B","en":"WebRTC\nWebRTC","zh":""},{"id":"C","en":"SIP\nSIP","zh":""},{"id":"D","en":"WebSocket\nWebSocket","zh":""}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"技术核验答案：B. WebRTC\nPDF 考试答案：D. WebSocket\n微软 Learn 核验\nMicrosoft Foundry Realtime Audio 文档明确说明：客户端实时音频通常推荐 WebRTC，目标延迟约 100ms；WebSocket 约 200ms，主要适用于服务端到服务端连接。题干明确要求 client application 和 approximately 100 ms，因此技术上应选 B。\n参考：https://learn.microsoft.com/en-us/azure/foundry/openai/how-to/realtime-audio\n\n英文版交叉核验\n英文版交叉核验：Correct Answer 为 D，但微软 Learn 的 Realtime Audio 文档明确建议客户端实时音频使用 WebRTC，约 100ms；WebSocket 约 200ms 且适合服务端到服务端。因此采用技术核验答案 B (WebRTC)，并在解析中保留 PDF 考试答案 D。","pageStart":216,"pageEnd":217,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-216.jpg","assets/pages/page-217.jpg"]},{"id":"q-91","number":91,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent and uses a GitHub repository. The repository contains a YAM file named File1 that\ndefines the evaluation settings of the agent.\nYou need to create a GitHub Actions workflow that runs the evaluation defined in File1 when a pull request (PR) is opened. How should you\nconfigure the workflow?","questionZh":"您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目,其中包含一个代理并使用了一个 GitHub 仓库。该仓库包含一个名为 File1 的 YAML 文件,该文件定\n义了代理的评估设置。\n您需要创建一个 GitHub Actions 工作流,以便在打开拉取请求(PR)时运行 File1 中定义的评估。您应该如何配置该工作流?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Set project-endpoint to the endpoint of the project.","zh":"将 project-endpoint 设置为项目的端点。"},{"id":"B","en":"Set evaluation-config to the path of the YAML file.","zh":"将 evaluation-config 设置为 YAML 文件的路径。"},{"id":"C","en":"Set model-deployment-name to the deployed model.","zh":"将 model-deployment-name 设置为已部署的模型。"},{"id":"D","en":"Set tenant-id to the Microsoft Entra tenant ID","zh":"将 tenant-id 设置为 Microsoft Entra 租戶 ID。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"官方答案：A\n答案核验\nPDF 第 218-219 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 A。\n对应选项：A. 将 project-endpoint 设置为项目的端点。\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":218,"pageEnd":219,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-218.jpg","assets/pages/page-219.jpg"]},{"id":"q-92","number":92,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent.\nThe agent uses a stored access key to retrieve secrets from an Azure key vault, which violates a keyless-credentials requirement.\nYou need to ensure that the agent can retrieve the secrets. The solution must follow the principle of least privilege.\nWhat should you configure? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n该代理使用存储的访问密钥从 Azure 密钥保管库中检索机密,这违反了无密钥凭据的要求。\n您需要确保代理能够检索机密。解决方案必须遵循最小权限原则。\n您应该配置什么?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Enable a system-assigned managed identity at the project level.","item2:Assign the Key Vault Secrets User role to the managed identity."],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure 中的托管身份(Managed Identity)和 Key Vault 授权方法的配置,重点在于如何遵循“最小权限原则”并满\n足“无密钥凭据”要求。\n相关服务/概念:Azure 托管身份(System-assigned Managed Identity)、Azure Key Vault 授权机制(Access Policy 和 RBAC)。\n选项逐一分析\n托管身份范围:\n选项 1:在 Foundry 级别启用系统分配的托管身份\n错误。系统分配的托管身份是与单个资源绑定的,Foundry 级别的身份可能会授予过多权限,违反“最小权限原则”。项目级别的身份\n更符合要求。\n选项 2:在项目级别启用系统分配的托管身份\n正确。项目级别的托管身份可以限制权限范围,仅允许该项目访问 Key Vault,符合“最小权限原则”。\n选项 3:创建服务主体并存储服务主体的客戶端密钥\n错误。存储服务主体的客戶端密钥违反了“无密钥凭据”要求,因为这仍然涉及显式密钥管理。\nKey Vault 授权方法:\n选项 1:将 API 密钥添加到应用程序设置\n错误。API 密钥属于显式密钥管理,违反“无密钥凭据”要求。\n选项 2:为密钥添加 Key Vault 访问策略\n正确。访问策略是 Key Vault 的一种授权机制,可以为托管身份分配特定权限(如读取密钥),符合“最小权限原则”。\n选项 3:为托管身份分配 Key Vault Secrets User ⻆色\n正确。通过 Azure RBAC 分配⻆色是一种推荐的授权方法,Key Vault Secrets User ⻆色仅允许读取密钥,符合“最小权限原则”。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:选项 2(在项目级别启用系统分配的托管身份)和选项 3(为托管身份分配 Key Vault Secrets User ⻆色)。\n官方答案\n官方答案:选项 2(在项目级别启用系统分配的托管身份)和选项 3(为托管身份分配 Key Vault Secrets User ⻆色)。\n答案比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:项目级别的托管身份限制了权限范围,Key Vault Secrets User ⻆色提供了最小权限的密钥读取功能,两者均符合题目要\n求。","pageStart":220,"pageEnd":221,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-220.jpg","assets/pages/page-221.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"First action","answer":"Enable a system-assigned managed identity at the project level.","choices":["Enable a system-assigned managed identity at the Foundry level","Enable a system-assigned managed identity at the project level.","Create a service principal and store the principal's client secret."]},{"id":"item2","label":"Second action","answer":"Assign the Key Vault Secrets User role to the managed identity.","choices":["Add an API key to application settings","Add a Key Vault access policy for the secrets.","Assign the Key Vault Secrets User role to the managed identity."]}]},{"id":"q-93","number":93,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a customer support application.\nYou create an evaluation named Run1 that has the following configurations:\n• Includes risk and safety metrics\n• Includes the protected material evaluation\n• Includes harmful content metrics that use a medium severity threshold\nYou create an evaluation named Run2 that has the following configurations:\n• Includes risk and safety metrics\n• Includes the protected material evaluation\n• Includes harmful content metrics that use a high severity threshold\nYou run both evaluations against a dataset named DB1 and receive the following results:\n• Content harm defect rate of Run1: 12%\n• Content harm defect rate of Run2: 4%\n• Protected material evaluation of Run1: 6%\n• Protected material evaluation of Run1: 6%\nYou start a fine-tuning job by using DB1. The job fails during automatic RAI checks for multiple content harm types.\nYou discover that the content filtering configuration is set to high severity.\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您有一个包含客戶支持应用程序的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n您创建了一个名为 Run1 的评估,其配置如下:\n• 包括⻛险和安全指标\n• 包括受保护材料评估\n• 包括使用中等严重性阈值的有害内容指标\n您创建了一个名为 Run2 的评估,其配置如下:\n• 包括⻛险和安全指标\n• 包括受保护材料评估\n• 包括使用高严重性阈值的有害内容指标\n您对名为 DB1 的数据集运行了两个评估,并收到以下结果:\n• Run1 的内容有害缺陷率:12%\n• Run2 的内容有害缺陷率:4%\n• Run1 的受保护材料评估:6%\n• Run1 的受保护材料评估:6%\n您通过使用 DB1 启动了一个微调作业。该作业在针对多种内容有害类型的自动 RAI 检查期间失败。\n您发现内容过滤配置设置为高严重性。\n对于以下每个陈述,如果陈述为真,请选择是。否则,请选择否。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:No","item2:Yes","item3:Yes"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:该问题测试的是微软负责任的人工智能(Responsible AI,RAI)评估工具的配置和结果分析,特别是内容过滤配置的严重性\n阈值对评估结果的影响。\n涉及的具体概念包括:⻛险与安全指标、受保护材料评估、有害内容指标,以及自动RAI检查失败的原因分析。\n选项逐一分析\n选项1:将内容过滤配置更改为低严重性将解决微调作业问题。\n分析:此选项不正确。根据题干,微调作业失败的原因是自动RAI检查检测到多个内容伤害类型,而当前配置为高严重性。虽然降低\n严重性可能减少检测到的问题,但这并不能保证解决所有问题,因为问题可能不仅仅与严重性阈值有关,还可能与数据集DB1的质\n量或其他配置相关。\n选项2:12%和4%的内容伤害缺陷率差异与Run1和Run2使用的不同严重性阈值一致。\n分析:此选项正确。Run1使用中等严重性阈值,检测到的内容伤害缺陷率较高(12%);而Run2使用高严重性阈值,检测到的内容伤\n害缺陷率较低(4%)。这符合严重性阈值的逻辑:高严重性阈值更严格,因此检测到的问题更少。\n选项3:Run1和Run2中相同的6%受保护材料评估值表明该指标不受严重性阈值变化的影响。\n分析:此选项正确。受保护材料评估值在Run1和Run2中均为6%,表明该指标与严重性阈值无关。受保护材料评估通常是独立于内容\n伤害指标的单独评估项。\n推荐答案\n选项2:Yes\n选项3:Yes\n选项1:No\n官方答案\n选项1:No\n选项2:Yes\n选项3:Yes\n答案比较与验证\n官方答案与推荐答案一致。\n分析确认官方答案正确,理由基于RAI工具的工作原理和题干提供的事实。","pageStart":222,"pageEnd":224,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-222.jpg","assets/pages/page-223.jpg","assets/pages/page-224.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Statement 1","answer":"No","choices":["Yes","No"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Statement 2","answer":"Yes","choices":["Yes","No"]},{"id":"item3","label":"Statement 3","answer":"Yes","choices":["Yes","No"]}]},{"id":"q-94","number":94,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains a multi-agent solution. The agents use tool calling to query internal systems.\nYou need to implement responsible AI auditing to meet the following requirements:\n• Capture all the nested operations across the entire agent run.\n• Record tool invocation arguments and retuned results as metadata.\nWhat should you use for each requirement? To answer, drag the appropriate options to the correct targets Each option may be used once, more\nthan once, or not at all. You may need o dag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"拖放\n-\n您有一个包含多代理解决方案的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。这些代理使用工具调用来查询内部系统。\n您需要实施负责任的人工智能审计以满足以下要求:\n• 捕获整个代理运行中的所有嵌套操作。\n• 将工具调用参数和返回结果记录为元数据。\n您应该为每个要求使用什么?要回答,请将适当的选项拖到正确的目标。每个选项可以使用一次、多次或不使用。您可能需要拖动\n拆分栏或滚动以查看内容。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Hierarchical spans","item2:Tool call attributes"],"analysis":"官方答案：原 PDF 未提供可识别的 Correct Answer\n核验说明\nPDF 第 225-226 页的 Correct Answer 为空或未识别到选中项，因此没有足够依据生成官方答案。\n本题保留原题页供人工查看，不参与自动判分，请根据原题资料自行核验。","pageStart":225,"pageEnd":226,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-225.jpg","assets/pages/page-226.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Nested operations","answer":"Hierarchical spans","choices":["Hierarchical spans","A KQL query filter","Sampling","Tool call attributes","Trace sampling policy"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Tool arguments and results","answer":"Tool call attributes","choices":["Hierarchical spans","A KQL query filter","Sampling","Tool call attributes","Trace sampling policy"]}]},{"id":"q-95","number":95,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent uses threads and file uploads and calls an Azure OpenAI model\ndeployment.\nDuring load testing, calls intermittently fall and return an HTTP 429 rate limit exceeded error. Some user uploads fail and generate an HTTP 400\nfile size exceeded error.\nYou need to mitigate the errors and reduce call failures. The solution must remain within the service and model limits.\nWhat should you do to resolve each error? To answer, drag the appropriate actions to the correct errors. Each action may be used once, more than\nonce or not at all. You may need to drag the split bar between panes or scroll to view content.\nNOTE: Each comet selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"拖放\n-\n您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理使用线程和文件上传,并调用 Azure OpenAI 模型部署。\n在负载测试期间,调用会间歇性失败并返回 HTTP 429 速率限制超出错误。一些用戶上传失败并生成 HTTP 400 文件大小超出错误。\n您需要减轻这些错误并减少调用失败。解决方案必须保持在服务和模型限制范围内。\n您应该如何解决每个错误?要回答,请将适当的操作拖到正确的错误上。每个操作可以使用一次、多次或完全不使用。您可能需要\n拖动分隔条或滚动以查看内容。\n注意:每个彗星选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Implement exponential backoff and jitter in the retry logic.","item2:Split content into smaller files before uploading the files."],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点\n知识点名称:Azure OpenAI 服务的错误处理和性能优化。\n具体概念:HTTP 429 错误(速率限制)和 HTTP 400 错误(文件大小限制)的解决方法。\n选项分析\nHTTP 429 错误\nIncrease tenant-wide quotas:错误。HTTP 429 表示速率限制,通常与服务的瞬时请求量有关,而不是租戶配额问题。增加租戶配额\n不会解决速率限制问题。\nMove large content to files and use file search:错误。此选项与文件处理相关,与速率限制无关,无法解决 HTTP 429 错误。\nUse additional agent tools to reduce the message size:错误。减少消息大小可能优化性能,但与速率限制无直接关系,无法解决 HTTP\n429 错误。\nImplement exponential backoff and jitter in the retry logic:正确。指数退避和抖动是处理速率限制的标准方法,可减少高峰期的请求冲\n突并提高成功率。\nSplit content into smaller files before uploading the files:错误。拆分文件与文件大小限制相关,与速率限制无关。\nHTTP 400 错误\nIncrease tenant-wide quotas:错误。HTTP 400 错误与文件大小超限有关,而不是租戶配额问题,增加配额无法解决此问题。\nMove large content to files and use file search:错误。此选项与文件搜索相关,但无法直接解决文件大小超限问题。\nUse additional agent tools to reduce the message size:错误。减少消息大小可能优化性能,但与文件大小超限无直接关系。\nImplement exponential backoff and jitter in the retry logic:错误。指数退避和抖动用于处理速率限制,与文件大小超限无关。\nSplit content into smaller files before uploading the files:正确。拆分文件可以确保上传的文件大小符合服务限制,从而解决 HTTP 400\n错误。\n推荐答案\nHTTP 429:Implement exponential backoff and jitter in the retry logic。\nHTTP 400:Split content into smaller files before uploading the files。\n官方答案\nHTTP 429:Implement exponential backoff and jitter in the retry logic。\nHTTP 400:Split content into smaller files before uploading the files。\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:指数退避和抖动是处理速率限制的标准方法,拆分文件是解决文件大小超限的有效手段,两者均符合技术原理。","pageStart":227,"pageEnd":228,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-227.jpg","assets/pages/page-228.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"HTTP 429","answer":"Implement exponential backoff and jitter in the retry logic.","choices":["Increase tenant-wide quotas.","Move large content to files and use file search.","Use additional agent tools to reduce the message size.","Implement exponential backoff and jitter in the retry logic.","Split content into smaller files before uploading the files."]},{"id":"item2","label":"HTTP 400","answer":"Split content into smaller files before uploading the files.","choices":["Increase tenant-wide quotas.","Move large content to files and use file search.","Use additional agent tools to reduce the message size.","Implement exponential backoff and jitter in the retry logic.","Split content into smaller files before uploading the files."]}]},{"id":"q-96","number":96,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project.\nYou need to deploy a model from the model catalog to support a search solution for internal policy documents. The model must generate vector\nrepresentations of the text in the documents and of user queries.\nWhich type of model should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n你需要从模型目录中部署一个模型,以支持内部政策文件的搜索解决方案。该模型必须生成文件文本和用戶查询的向量表示。\n你应该使用哪种类型的模型?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"an embedding model","zh":"嵌入模型"},{"id":"B","en":"an image generation model","zh":"图像生成模型"},{"id":"C","en":"a large language model (LLM)","zh":"大型语言模型 (LLM)"},{"id":"D","en":"a small language model (SLM)","zh":"小型语言模型 (SLM)"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"建议答案:A\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是嵌入模型(embedding model)的功能及其在文本向量化中的应用。\n嵌入模型用于将文本或其他数据转换为向量表示,以便进行相似性搜索或其他基于向量的操作。\n选项逐一分析\nA. 嵌入模型:正确。嵌入模型专⻔用于生成文本的向量表示,适合用于搜索解决方案中对文档和查询进行向量化处理。\nB. 图像生成模型:错误。图像生成模型用于生成图像,与文本向量化无关,无法支持搜索解决方案中的文本处理需求。\nC. 大型语言模型(LLM):部分正确但不完全适合。LLM可以生成嵌入,但其主要用途是生成文本或回答问题。直接使用嵌入模型更\n高效且针对性更强。\nD. 小型语言模型(SLM):错误。SLM通常功能有限,无法高效生成高质量的文本嵌入,且不适合复杂的搜索解决方案。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:A\n官方答案\n官方答案:A\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:嵌入模型是生成文本向量表示的最佳选择,符合题目要求。","pageStart":229,"pageEnd":229,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-229.jpg"]},{"id":"q-97","number":97,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project.\nYou need to deploy a model from the model catalog to support real-time inference. The solution must meet the following requirements:\n• Use key-based authentication.\n• Support real-time REST API access.\n• NOT consume the vCPU quota of the virtual machines in the Azure subscription.\nWhich type of deployment should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n你需要从模型目录中部署一个模型以支持实时推理。解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n• 使用基于密钥的身份验证。\n• 支持实时 REST API 访问。\n• 不消耗 Azure 订阅中虚拟机的 vCPU 配额。\n你应该使用哪种类型的部署?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"serverless API","zh":"无服务器 API"},{"id":"B","en":"batch","zh":"批处理"},{"id":"C","en":"self-hosted container","zh":"自托管容器"},{"id":"D","en":"standard","zh":"标准"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"官方答案：D\n答案核验\nPDF 第 230-231 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 D。\n对应选项：D. 标准\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":230,"pageEnd":231,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-230.jpg","assets/pages/page-231.jpg"]},{"id":"q-98","number":98,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou plan to create a Microsoft Foundry project named Project1 that will contain an agent and use an Azure key vault named KV1.\nYou need to configure a connection from Project1 to KV1.\nHow should you complete the Bicep code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area?\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您计划创建一个名为 Project1 的 Microsoft Foundry 项目,该项目将包含一个代理并使用名为 KV1 的 Azure 密钥保管库。\n您需要配置从 Project1 到 KV1 的连接。\n您应该如何完成 Bicep 代码?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:AzureKeyVault","item2:AccountManagedIdentity"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是如何在使用 Bicep 代码时配置 Azure Key Vault 与 Microsoft Foundry 项目的连接。具体涉及 Azure Key Vault 的资\n源定义、连接属性配置,以及身份验证类型的选择。\n选项逐一分析\ncategory:\nAzureAIService:错误。此选项用于表示与 Azure AI 服务相关的连接,而题目明确要求连接到 Azure Key Vault。\nAzureKeyVault:正确。此选项明确表示连接目标是 Azure Key Vault,符合题目要求。\nAzureOpenAI:错误。此选项用于连接到 Azure OpenAI 服务,与题目要求不符。\nauthType:\nAccountKey:错误。此选项表示使用账戶密钥进行身份验证,但 Azure Key Vault 通常推荐使用托管身份(Managed Identity)进行安全连\n接。\nAccountManagedIdentity:正确。此选项表示使用托管身份进行身份验证,这是与 Azure Key Vault 连接的最佳实践。\nApiKey:错误。此选项表示使用 API 密钥进行身份验证,但这通常用于其他服务而非 Azure Key Vault。\n推荐答案\nAzureKeyVault\nAccountManagedIdentity\n官方答案\nAzureKeyVault\nAccountManagedIdentity\n比较与验证\n官方答案与推荐答案一致,均为 AzureKeyVault 和 AccountManagedIdentity。\n理由:AzureKeyVault 是正确的连接目标,AccountManagedIdentity 是推荐的身份验证方式,符合 Azure 的最佳实践。","pageStart":232,"pageEnd":233,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-232.jpg","assets/pages/page-233.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Connection target","answer":"AzureKeyVault","choices":["AzureAIService","AzureKeyVault","AzureOpenAI"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Authentication","answer":"AccountManagedIdentity","choices":["AccountKey","AccountManagedIdentity","ApiKey"]}]},{"id":"q-99","number":99,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou have a Microsoft Foundry project.\nYou need to create a customer support agent that meets the following requirements:\n• Grounds responses only in company policy documents stored in curated repositories\n• Retains customer preferences across separate chat sessions\nHow should you configure the agent? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您有一个 Microsoft Foundry 项目。\n您需要创建一个满足以下要求的客戶支持代理:\n• 仅基于存储在精选存储库中的公司政策文件提供回复\n• 在不同的聊天会话中保留客戶偏好\n您应该如何配置该代理?请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Enable agent memory that uses persistent storage","item2:Configure retrieval from approved data sources."],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是在 Microsoft Foundry 项目中创建一个客戶支持代理时,如何正确配置“知识基础”和“记忆功能”。具体涉及的技\n术包括知识库的配置(如数据源的选择和文档上传方式)以及代理的持久性记忆功能(如会话上下文和用戶偏好存储)。\n选项逐一分析\n知识基础\nConfigure revival from approved data sources:正确。此选项符合题干要求,因为“从批准的数据源恢复”确保代理的响应基于公司政策\n文档,而不是其他非相关或未经批准的内容。这种方法通过连接到特定的知识库或数据源来实现知识的可靠性。\nUpload the policy documents direct to the agent:错误。直接将政策文档上传到代理可能会导致文档嵌入到模型中,但这并不保证文档\n的动态更新或与批准数据源的关联性,因此不符合题干要求的“从存储库中恢复”的条件。\nEmbed the policy documents directly into the agent instructions:错误。将文档嵌入到代理指令中可能会限制代理的灵活性,并且无法\n动态更新知识库内容。这种方法通常用于小型静态数据集,而不是动态知识库。\n记忆功能\nUse orchestration-managed session context:错误。会话上下文管理仅适用于单次会话,无法跨会话保留用戶偏好,因此不符合题干\n要求的“跨会话保留客戶偏好”。\nEnable agent memory that uses persistent storage:正确。启用使用持久存储的代理记忆功能可以确保用戶偏好在多个会话之间被保\n留。这种方法通过存储用戶数据来实现跨会话的记忆功能。\nRetain user preferences in the state of the client application:错误。将用戶偏好保留在客戶端应用程序状态中可能会导致数据丢失,因\n为状态通常是临时的,无法跨会话持久化存储。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:Configure revival from approved data sources;Enable agent memory that uses persistent storage\n官方答案\n官方答案:Enable agent memory that uses persistent storage;Configure revival from approved data sources\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:官方答案正确,因为它符合题干要求:知识基础通过批准的数据源恢复,记忆功能通过持久存储实现跨会话的用戶偏好\n保留。","pageStart":234,"pageEnd":235,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-234.jpg","assets/pages/page-235.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Cross-session preference","answer":"Enable agent memory that uses persistent storage","choices":["Use orchestration-managed session context.","Enable agent memory that uses persistent storage","Retain user preferences in the state of the client application"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Approved knowledge","answer":"Configure retrieval from approved data sources.","choices":["Configure retrieval from approved data sources.","Upload the policy documents direct to the agent.","Embed the policy documents directly into the agent instructions."]}]},{"id":"q-100","number":100,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a Microsoft Foundry project that contains an agent. The agent generates summaries from retrieved policy documents.\nYou need to improve response completeness. The solution must be implemented in the logic of the application code before responses are\nreturned.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您有一个包含代理的 Microsoft Foundry 项目。该代理从检索到的政策文件中生成摘要。\n您需要提高响应的完整性。解决方案必须在响应返回之前的应用程序代码逻辑中实现。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Add a retry evaluation before the responses are returned.","zh":"在响应返回之前添加重试评估。"},{"id":"B","en":"Decrease the value of the temperature parameter.","zh":"降低温度参数的值。"},{"id":"C","en":"Increase the value of the presence_penalty parameter","zh":"增加存在惩罚参数的值。"},{"id":"D","en":"Replace the model with a smaller deployment.","zh":"用较小的部署替换模型。"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"建议答案:A\n知识点\n知识点:此问题测试的是如何优化生成式AI模型的响应完整性,涉及模型参数调整和应用逻辑的实现。\n具体概念:模型参数(如temperature和presence_penalty)对生成内容的影响,以及应用逻辑中的重试机制。\n选项分析\nA. Add a retry evaluation before the responses are returned:正确。重试机制可以在初次生成的响应不完整时重新评估并生成新的响\n应,从而提高响应的完整性。这种方法直接在应用逻辑中实现,与题目要求一致。\nB. Decrease the value of the temperature parameter:错误。降低temperature参数会使生成的内容更加确定性,但这主要影响生成内容的\n随机性,而非直接提高响应的完整性。此选项与题目要求不完全匹配。\nC. Increase the value of the presence_penalty parameter:错误。presence_penalty参数用于减少重复内容的生成,增加其值可能会影响生\n成内容的多样性,但不会直接改善响应的完整性。\nD. Replace the model with a smaller deployment:错误。使用较小的模型部署可能会降低生成质量,通常不会提高响应的完整性。此选\n项与题目要求无关。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:A\n官方答案\n官方答案:A\n比较:推荐答案与官方答案一致。重试机制是提高响应完整性的合理方法,符合题目要求。","pageStart":236,"pageEnd":236,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-236.jpg"]},{"id":"q-101","number":101,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou develop a test method to verify the results retrieved from a call to the Azure Vision in Foundry Tools API. The call is used to analyze the\nexistence of company logos in images. The call returns a collection of brands named brands.\nYou have the following code segment:\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您开发了一种测试方法,用于验证从调用 Foundry Tools API 中的 Azure Vision 检索的结果。该调用用于分析图像中公司标志的存在情\n况。调用返回一个名为 brands 的品牌集合。\n您有以下代码片段:\n对于以下每个陈述,如果该陈述为真,请选择“是”。否则,请选择“否”。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Yes","item2:Yes","item3:No"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:Azure 认知服务中的计算机视觉 API,特别是品牌检测功能。\n该题目测试的是如何使用 API 返回的品牌检测结果,包括品牌名称、置信度以及矩形坐标的解析和显示。\n选项逐一分析\n选项 1:代码将显示置信度等于或高于 75% 的每个检测到的品牌名称。\n分析:正确。代码通过 `if brand.confidence >= 0.75` 条件过滤置信度,随后使用 `print(f\"\\nLogo of {brand.name}...\")` 输出品牌名称,因此\n会显示符合条件的品牌名称。\n选项 2:代码将显示包含品牌标志的矩形的左上⻆坐标。\n分析:正确。矩形的左上⻆坐标由 `brand.rectangle.x` 和 `brand.rectangle.y` 提供,代码中明确使用了这些字段并输出。\n选项 3:代码将显示包含品牌标志的矩形的右下⻆坐标。\n分析:错误。代码中仅输出了 `brand.rectangle.x` 和 `brand.rectangle.y`(左上⻆坐标)以及 `brand.rectangle.w` 和 `brand.rectangle.h`\n(宽度和高度),并未计算右下⻆坐标(需通过 `x+w` 和 `y+h` 计算)。\n推荐答案\n选项 1:Yes\n选项 2:Yes\n选项 3:No\n官方答案\n选项 1:Yes\n选项 2:Yes\n选项 3:No\n比较与结论\n官方答案与推荐答案一致。\n结论:官方答案正确。","pageStart":237,"pageEnd":238,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-237.jpg","assets/pages/page-238.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Statement 1","answer":"Yes","choices":["Yes","No"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Statement 2","answer":"Yes","choices":["Yes","No"]},{"id":"item3","label":"Statement 3","answer":"No","choices":["Yes","No"]}]},{"id":"q-102","number":102,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an Azure subscription.\nYou plan to build an app that will use the Azure AI DALL-E model.\nYou need to deploy the model.\nWhat should you use?","questionZh":"你有一个 Azure 订阅。\n你计划构建一个将使用 Azure AI DALL-E 模型的应用程序。\n你需要部署该模型。\n你应该使用什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"the Azure SDK for Python and PowerShell cmdlets.","zh":"Azure SDK for Python 和 PowerShell cmdlets。"},{"id":"B","en":"the Azure SDK for JavaScript and Azure Machine Learning Studio.","zh":"Azure SDK for JavaScript 和 Azure Machine Learning Studio。"},{"id":"C","en":"Microsoft Foundry and the Azure Command Line Interface (CLI)","zh":"Microsoft Foundry 和 Azure 命令行界面 (CLI)。"},{"id":"D","en":"the Azure portal and Microsoft Graph API","zh":"Azure ⻔戶和 Microsoft Graph API。"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"官方答案：C\n答案核验\nPDF 第 239-240 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 C。\n对应选项：C. Microsoft Foundry 和 Azure 命令行界面 (CLI)。\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":239,"pageEnd":240,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-239.jpg","assets/pages/page-240.jpg"]},{"id":"q-103","number":103,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou have an Azure subscription.\nYou need to create a new resource that will generate fictional stores in response to user prompts. The solution must ensure that the resource uses\na customer-managed key to protect data.\nHow should you complete the script? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您有一个 Azure 订阅。\n您需要创建一个新资源,以根据用戶提示生成虚构的商店。解决方案必须确保该资源使用客戶管理的密钥来保护数据。\n您应该如何完成脚本?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确的选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:OpenAI","item2:--encryption"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure 中创建资源的命令行操作,具体涉及 Azure OpenAI 服务的创建以及如何使用客戶管理的密钥\n(Customer-Managed Key, CMK)进行数据保护。\n相关服务/功能:Azure OpenAI 服务、客戶管理的密钥(CMK)、Azure Key Vault。\n选项逐一分析\n选项 1: --kind -> AIServices\n错误。AIServices 是一个广义的类别,通常用于指代 Azure 中的认知服务,但本题明确要求生成虚构商店的资源,这与 OpenAI 服务相\n关,而非一般的认知服务。\n选项 2: --kind -> LanguageAuthoring\n错误。LanguageAuthoring 是用于语言理解(LUIS)或文本分析的服务,与生成虚构商店的功能无关。\n选项 3: --kind -> OpenAI\n正确。Azure OpenAI 服务支持基于用戶提示生成内容(如虚构商店),符合题目要求。\n选项 4: --assign-identity -> encryption\n正确。为了使用客戶管理的密钥保护数据,必须启用托管身份(Managed Identity),以便资源能够安全地访问 Azure Key Vault 中的密\n钥。这与加密配置直接相关。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:--kind -> OpenAI, --assign-identity -> encryption\n官方答案\n官方答案:--kind -> OpenAI, --assign-identity -> encryption\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:Azure OpenAI 服务支持生成内容功能,且客戶管理的密钥需要启用托管身份以访问 Key Vault。官方答案正确。","pageStart":241,"pageEnd":242,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-241.jpg","assets/pages/page-242.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"--kind","answer":"OpenAI","choices":["AIServices","LanguageAuthoring","OpenAI"]},{"id":"item2","label":"encryption option","answer":"--encryption","choices":["--api-properties","--assign-identity","--encryption"]}]},{"id":"q-104","number":104,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou have a Python application collects customer comments before posting them to a public forum.\nYou need to send a text comment to Azure AI Content Safety and return the self-harm severity from the response.\nHow should you complete the code? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您有一个 Python 应用程序,用于收集客戶评论,然后将其发布到公共论坛。\n您需要将文本评论发送到 Azure AI 内容安全服务,并从响应中返回自我伤害严重程度。\n您应该如何完成代码?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:AnalyzeTextOptions(text=comment)","item2:client.analyze_text(request)"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点\n知识点名称:Azure AI Content Safety 服务中的文本分析功能。\n具体概念:使用 Azure AI Content Safety 的 API 分析文本内容,识别潜在的自我伤害类别,并返回相关的严重性评分。\n选项逐一分析\n第一部分:AnalyzeTextOptions 参数\nAnalyzeTextOptions(categories=comment):错误。\n此选项试图将 `categories` 设置为 `comment`,但 `categories` 参数用于指定分析的类别(如 \"SELF_HARM\"),而不是文本内容。此用法\n不符合 API 的设计。\nAnalyzeTextOptions(text=[comment]):错误。\n虽然 `text` 参数确实用于传递文本内容,但它期望的是一个字符串,而不是一个列表。传递 `[comment]` 会导致类型错误。\nAnalyzeTextOptions(text=comment):正确。\n`text` 参数用于传递需要分析的文本内容,`comment` 是一个字符串变量,符合 API 的要求。\nTextCategory.SELF_HARM(comment):错误。\n`TextCategory.SELF_HARM` 是一个枚举值,用于指定类别(如自我伤害),而不是传递文本内容。此选项误解了枚举的用途。\n第二部分:client 方法调用\nclient.analyze_image(request):错误。\n`analyze_image` 方法用于分析图像内容,而题目明确要求分析文本内容,因此此方法不适用。\nclient.analyze_text(request):正确。\n`analyze_text` 方法专⻔用于分析文本内容,与题目要求完全匹配。\nclient.moderate_text(request):错误。\n`moderate_text` 方法用于内容审核,而不是分类分析。题目要求返回自我伤害类别的严重性评分,因此此方法不符合需求。\nclient.path(\"/text:analyze\").post(request):错误。\n此选项试图直接调用 REST API 的路径,但题目明确使用了 SDK(如 `ContentSafetyClient`),因此不需要手动构造 API 请求。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:AnalyzeTextOptions(text=comment),client.analyze_text(request)\n官方答案\n官方答案:AnalyzeTextOptions(text=comment),client.analyze_text(request)\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:根据 Azure AI Content Safety 的文档,`AnalyzeTextOptions(text=comment)` 正确地传递了文本内容,\n`client.analyze_text(request)` 正确地调用了文本分析方法,完全符合题目要求。","pageStart":243,"pageEnd":245,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-243.jpg","assets/pages/page-244.jpg","assets/pages/page-245.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Request","answer":"AnalyzeTextOptions(text=comment)","choices":["AnalyzeTextOptions(categories=comment)","AnalyzeTextOptions(text=[comment])","AnalyzeTextOptions(text=comment)","TextCategory.SELF_HARM(comment)"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Call","answer":"client.analyze_text(request)","choices":["client.analyze_image(request)","client.analyze_text(request)","client.moderate_text(request)","client.path(\"/text:analyze\").post(request)"]}]},{"id":"q-105","number":105,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have a custom named entity recognition (NER) project in Azure Language in Foundry Tools for support tickets. The schema for the project\ncontains an entity type named ContactInfo.\nIn tagged training files, ContactInfo is used for phone numbers, email addresses, and social media handles.\nModel evaluation shows low precision for ContactInfo, including false positives in which nearby text is extracted as ContactInfo.\nYou need to improve the precision of the project.\nWhat should you do before retraining the model?","questionZh":"您在 Azure Language 的 Foundry Tools 中有一个自定义命名实体识别 (NER) 项目,用于支持工单。该项目的架构包含一个名为\nContactInfo 的实体类型。\n在标记的训练文件中,ContactInfo 用于电话号码、电子邮件地址和社交媒体账号。\n模型评估显示 ContactInfo 的精确度较低,包括一些误报,其中附近的文本被错误地提取为 ContactInfo。\n您需要提高项目的精确度。\n在重新训练模型之前应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Lower the confidence threshold for ContactInfo.","zh":"降低 ContactInfo 的置信度阈值。"},{"id":"B","en":"Trigger an auto-labeling job.","zh":"触发自动标注任务。"},{"id":"C","en":"Add more support tickets as training data and label more ContactInfo entities.","zh":"添加更多支持工单作为训练数据,并标注更多 ContactInfo 实体。"},{"id":"D","en":"Replace ContactInfo by using Phone, Email, and SocialMedia entities. Relabel every matching span.","zh":"使用 Phone、Email 和 SocialMedia 实体替换 ContactInfo。重新标注每个匹配的范围。"}],"answer":["D"],"analysis":"建议答案:D\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure Language 中的自定义命名实体识别(NER)项目的优化方法,特别是如何提高模型的精度\n(precision)。具体涉及实体类型的设计和标注质量对模型性能的影响。\n选项逐一分析\nA. Lower the confidence threshold for ContactInfo:错误。降低置信度阈值会增加模型的召回率(recall),但会进一步降低精度\n(precision),因为更多低置信度的预测会被接受。这与题目要求提高精度的目标相悖。\nB. Trigger an auto-labeling job:错误。自动标注(auto-labeling)依赖现有模型生成标签,但当前模型的精度较低,自动标注可能会引\n入更多错误标签,进一步恶化模型性能。此方法无法直接解决精度问题。\nC. Add more support tickets as training data and label more ContactInfo entities:部分正确但不够全面。增加训练数据和标注可以改善模\n型性能,但仅增加数据无法解决实体类型设计不合理的问题。当前 ContactInfo 包含多种不同类型的实体(电话、邮箱、社交媒\n体),可能导致模型混淆,需进一步优化实体设计。\nD. Replace ContactInfo by using Phone, Email, and SocialMedia entities. Relabel every matching span:正确。将 ContactInfo 分解为更具体\n的实体类型(Phone、Email、SocialMedia)可以减少模型混淆,提高精度。重新标注数据确保训练数据与新实体类型一致,是解决\n问题的最佳方法。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:D\n官方答案\n官方答案:D\n答案比较\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。D 是正确的选择,因为它解决了实体类型设计不合理的问题,并通过重新标注数据提高模型\n精度。","pageStart":246,"pageEnd":247,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-246.jpg","assets/pages/page-247.jpg"]},{"id":"q-106","number":106,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are building a text-to-speech solution that uses Azure Speech in Foundry Tools to read instructions from the script in a text file.\nYou discover that the solution often pronounces technical terms incorrectly.\nYou need to prevent the incorrect pronunciations. The solution must minimize development effort.\nWhat should you do?","questionZh":"您正在构建一个使用 Foundry Tools 中的 Azure Speech 的文本转语音解决方案,以从文本文件中的脚本中读取指令。\n您发现该解决方案经常错误地发音技术术语。\n您需要防止错误发音。该解决方案必须尽量减少开发工作量。\n您应该怎么做?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"From Speech Studio, train a custom neural voice","zh":"从 Speech Studio 训练一个自定义神经语音"},{"id":"B","en":"Use Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) to specify phonemes.","zh":"使用语音合成标记语言 (SSML) 指定音素。"},{"id":"C","en":"Use Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) to apply say as rules.","zh":"使用语音合成标记语言 (SSML) 应用 say-as 规则。"},{"id":"D","en":"Use Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) to adjust the prosody of the voice.","zh":"使用语音合成标记语言 (SSML) 调整语音的韵律。"},{"id":"E","en":"From Azure OpenAI use the Whisper model.","zh":"从 Azure OpenAI 使用 Whisper 模型。"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"建议答案:B\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure Speech 服务中的文本转语音(Text-to-Speech)功能,特别是如何通过 Speech Synthesis Markup Language\n(SSML) 来优化发音,解决技术术语发音错误的问题。\n选项逐一分析\nA. 从 Speech Studio 中训练一个自定义神经语音:错误。训练自定义神经语音是一个复杂且耗时的过程,通常用于创建完全定制化的\n语音,而不是解决单个发音问题。题目要求“最小化开发工作量”,因此此选项不符合要求。\nB. 使用 Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) 指定音素:正确。SSML 提供了 `` 标签,可以直接指定单词的发音音素,从而解决\n技术术语发音错误的问题。这种方法针对性强,且开发工作量较小,符合题目要求。\nC. 使用 Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) 应用 say-as 规则:部分正确但不最佳。`` 标签可以指定文本的语义类型(如日期、\n数字、货币等),但它无法直接解决技术术语的发音问题,因此不完全符合题目需求。\nD. 使用 Speech Synthesis Markup Language (SSML) 调整语音的韵律:错误。`` 标签用于调整语音的音调、速度和音量等韵律特性,但\n它无法直接解决发音错误的问题,因此不符合题目需求。\nE. 从 Azure OpenAI 使用 Whisper 模型:错误。Whisper 是一个语音识别模型,用于将语音转换为文本,而不是文本转语音。它与解决\n发音问题无关,因此不适用。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:B\n官方答案\n官方答案:B\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:使用 SSML 的 `` 标签是解决发音问题的最佳方法,既符合题目要求的“最小化开发工作量”,又能直接解决技术术语发音错\n误的问题。","pageStart":248,"pageEnd":249,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-248.jpg","assets/pages/page-249.jpg"]},{"id":"q-107","number":107,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou have a Python application that redacts sensitive information before sending prompt text to a language model. The application has the\nfollowing code:\nFor each of the following statements, select Yes if the statement is true. Otherwise, select No.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您有一个 Python 应用程序,该应用程序在将提示文本发送到语言模型之前会编辑敏感信息。该应用程序具有以下代码:\n对于以下每个陈述,如果陈述为真,请选择“是”。否则,请选择“否”。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:No","item2:Yes","item3:Yes"],"analysis":"官方答案：选项 1: No；选项 2: Yes；选项 3: Yes\n答案核验\nPDF 第 250-251 页的官方答案如上。\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与官方答案存在冲突。本题按 PDF 官方答案进行自评。","pageStart":250,"pageEnd":251,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-250.jpg","assets/pages/page-251.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Statement 1","answer":"No","choices":["Yes","No"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Statement 2","answer":"Yes","choices":["Yes","No"]},{"id":"item3","label":"Statement 3","answer":"Yes","choices":["Yes","No"]}]},{"id":"q-108","number":108,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP\n-\nYou are developing an application that will detect faulty components produced on a factory production line. The components are specific to your\nbusiness.\nYou need to use the Azure Custom Vision API to help detect common faults.\nWhich three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and\narrange them in the correct order.","questionZh":"拖放\n-\n您正在开发一个应用程序,用于检测工厂生产线上的故障组件。这些组件是您业务特有的。\n您需要使用 Azure Custom Vision API 来帮助检测常⻅故障。\n您应该按顺序执行哪三项操作?要回答,请将适当的操作从操作列表移动到答案区域,并按正确顺序排列。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Create a project.","item2:Upload and tag images.","item3:Train the object detection model"],"analysis":"官方答案：原 PDF 未提供可识别的 Correct Answer\n核验说明\nPDF 第 252-253 页的 Correct Answer 为空或未识别到选中项，因此没有足够依据生成官方答案。\n本题保留原题页供人工查看，不参与自动判分，请根据原题资料自行核验。","pageStart":252,"pageEnd":253,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-252.jpg","assets/pages/page-253.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Step 1","answer":"Create a project.","choices":["Initialize the training dataset.","Train the classifier model.","Create a project.","Upload and tag images.","Train the object detection model"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Step 2","answer":"Upload and tag images.","choices":["Initialize the training dataset.","Train the classifier model.","Create a project.","Upload and tag images.","Train the object detection model"]},{"id":"item3","label":"Step 3","answer":"Train the object detection model","choices":["Initialize the training dataset.","Train the classifier model.","Create a project.","Upload and tag images.","Train the object detection model"]}]},{"id":"q-109","number":109,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are developing a new sales system that will process user-generated video and text from a public-facing website.\nYou plan to notify users that their data has been processed by the sales system.\nWhich responsible AI principle does this help meet?","questionZh":"您正在开发一个新的销售系统,该系统将处理来自面向公众的网站的用戶生成视频和文本。\n您计划通知用戶,他们的数据已被销售系统处理。\n这有助于满足哪项负责任的人工智能原则?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"fairness","zh":"公平性"},{"id":"B","en":"transparency","zh":"透明性"},{"id":"C","en":"inclusiveness","zh":"包容性"},{"id":"D","en":"reliability and safety","zh":"可靠性和安全性"}],"answer":["B"],"analysis":"建议答案:B\n知识点\n测试的知识点:负责的人工智能原则(Responsible AI Principles)中的具体概念。\n具体概念:透明性(Transparency)——确保用戶了解系统如何处理其数据。\n选项分析\nA. 公平性(Fairness):错误。公平性主要关注减少偏⻅和歧视,确保系统对所有用戶公平对待。通知用戶数据已被处理与公平性无\n直接关联。\nB. 透明性(Transparency):正确。透明性要求系统向用戶清楚地传达其数据处理方式。通知用戶数据已被处理符合透明性原则。\nC. 包容性(Inclusiveness):错误。包容性旨在确保系统适用于广泛的用戶群体,包括不同背景和能力的用戶。通知用戶数据已被处\n理与包容性无直接关联。\nD. 可靠性和安全性(Reliability and Safety):错误。可靠性和安全性关注系统的稳定性和保护用戶数据免受威胁。通知用戶数据已被\n处理与此原则无直接关联。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:B\n官方答案\n官方答案:B\n比较:推荐答案与官方答案一致。通知用戶数据已被处理直接体现了透明性原则,因此官方答案正确。","pageStart":254,"pageEnd":254,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-254.jpg"]},{"id":"q-110","number":110,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You are designing a content management system.\nYou need to ensure that the reading experience is optimized for users who have reduced comprehension and learning differences, such as\ndyslexia. The solution must minimize development effort.\nWhich Azure service should you include in the solution?","questionZh":"您正在设计一个内容管理系统。\n您需要确保阅读体验针对理解能力较低和学习差异(如阅读障碍)的用戶进行了优化。解决方案必须尽量减少开发工作量。\n您应该在解决方案中包含哪项 Azure 服务?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Azure Document Intelligence in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry Tools 中的 Azure 文档智能"},{"id":"B","en":"Azure Language in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry Tools 中的 Azure 语言"},{"id":"C","en":"Azure AI Immersive Reader","zh":"Azure AI 沉浸式阅读器"},{"id":"D","en":"Azure Translator in Foundry Tools","zh":"Foundry Tools 中的 Azure 翻译器"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"建议答案:C\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure 服务中优化阅读体验的功能,特别是针对有阅读障碍(如阅读理解能力较低或患有阅读困难症)的用\n戶。具体涉及的服务是 Azure AI Immersive Reader,它专⻔用于增强文本的可读性和理解性。\n选项逐一分析\nA. Azure Document Intelligence in Foundry Tools:错误。Azure Document Intelligence(以前称为 Form Recognizer)主要用于提取文档中\n的结构化数据,例如表格或表单内容。它不提供优化阅读体验的功能。\nB. Azure Language in Foundry Tools:错误。Azure Language 是一个用于自然语言处理的服务,支持文本分析、情感分析等功能,但它\n不专⻔针对阅读障碍用戶优化阅读体验。\nC. Azure AI Immersive Reader:正确。Immersive Reader 是专⻔设计用于帮助用戶更好地理解和阅读文本的工具,支持功能包括文本朗\n读、字体调整、行间距优化以及语法高亮,非常适合有阅读障碍的用戶。\nD. Azure Translator in Foundry Tools:错误。Azure Translator 是一个翻译服务,旨在将文本从一种语言翻译为另一种语言,但它不提供\n针对阅读障碍的优化功能。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:C\n官方答案\n官方答案:C\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:Azure AI Immersive Reader 是唯一一个专⻔设计用于优化阅读体验的服务,特别是针对有阅读障碍的用戶。其他选项的功\n能与题目要求不符。","pageStart":255,"pageEnd":256,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-255.jpg","assets/pages/page-256.jpg"]},{"id":"q-111","number":111,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an Azure subscription that contains an Azure App Service app named App1.\nYou provision a Microsoft Foundry Service resource named CSAccount1.\nYou need to configure App1 to access CSAccount1. The solution must minimize administrative effort.\nWhat should you use to configure App1?","questionZh":"你有一个包含名为 App1 的 Azure 应用服务应用的 Azure 订阅。\n你预配了一个名为 CSAccount1 的 Microsoft Foundry Service 资源。\n你需要配置 App1 以访问 CSAccount1。解决方案必须尽量减少管理工作。\n你应该使用什么来配置 App1?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"the endpoint URI and subscription key","zh":"端点 URI 和订阅密钥"},{"id":"B","en":"the endpoint URI and an OAuth token","zh":"端点 URI 和 OAuth 令牌"},{"id":"C","en":"the endpoint URI and a shared access signature (SAS) token","zh":"端点 URI 和共享访问签名 (SAS) 令牌"},{"id":"D","en":"a system assigned managed identity and an X.509 certificate","zh":"系统分配的托管身份和 X.509 证书"}],"answer":["A"],"analysis":"官方答案：A\n答案核验\nPDF 第 257-258 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 A。\n对应选项：A. 端点 URI 和订阅密钥\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":257,"pageEnd":258,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-257.jpg","assets/pages/page-258.jpg"]},{"id":"q-112","number":112,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"DRAG DROP\n-\nYou have a web app that uses Azure AI Search.\nWhen reviewing activity you see greater than expected search query volumes. You suspect that the query key is compromised.\nYou need to prevent unauthorized access to the search endpoint and ensure that users only have read only access to the documents collection.\nThe solution must minimize app downtime.\nWhich three actions should you perform in sequence? To answer, move the appropriate actions from the list of actions to the answer area and\narrange them in the correct order.","questionZh":"拖放\n-\n您有一个使用 Azure AI 搜索的 Web 应用程序。\n在审查活动时,您发现搜索查询量超出预期。您怀疑查询密钥已泄露。\n您需要防止未经授权的访问搜索端点,并确保用戶只能对文档集合进行只读访问。解决方案必须尽量减少应用程序停机时间。\n您应该按顺序执行哪三项操作?要回答,请将适当的操作从操作列表移动到答案区域并按正确顺序排列。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Add a new query key","item2:Change the app to use the new key","item3:Delete the compromised key"],"analysis":"官方答案：原 PDF 未提供可识别的 Correct Answer\n核验说明\nPDF 第 259-260 页的 Correct Answer 为空或未识别到选中项，因此没有足够依据生成官方答案。\n本题保留原题页供人工查看，不参与自动判分，请根据原题资料自行核验。","pageStart":259,"pageEnd":260,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-259.jpg","assets/pages/page-260.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Step 1","answer":"Add a new query key","choices":["Regenerate the primary admin key","Regenerate the secondary admin key","Change the app to use the secondary admin key","Add a new query key","Change the app to use the new key","Delete the compromised key"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Step 2","answer":"Change the app to use the new key","choices":["Regenerate the primary admin key","Regenerate the secondary admin key","Change the app to use the secondary admin key","Add a new query key","Change the app to use the new key","Delete the compromised key"]},{"id":"item3","label":"Step 3","answer":"Delete the compromised key","choices":["Regenerate the primary admin key","Regenerate the secondary admin key","Change the app to use the secondary admin key","Add a new query key","Change the app to use the new key","Delete the compromised key"]}]},{"id":"q-113","number":113,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou need to create a new resource that will be used to perform sentiment analysis and optical character recognition (OCR). The solution must\nmeet the following requirements:\n• Use a single key and endpoint to access multiple services.\n• Consolidate billing for future services that you might use.\n• Support the use of Azure Vision in Foundry Tools in the future.\nHow should you complete the HTTP request to create the new resource? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您需要创建一个新资源,用于执行情感分析和光学字符识别 (OCR)。解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n• 使用单一密钥和终端访问多个服务。\n• 整合未来可能使用的服务的计费。\n• 支持在未来的 Foundry Tools 中使用 Azure Vision。\n您应该如何完成 HTTP 请求以创建新资源?请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:PUT","item2:CognitiveServices"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure Cognitive Services 的创建与配置,特别是如何通过 HTTP 请求创建一个支持多种服务(如情感分析和\nOCR)的资源,同时满足单一密钥和端点访问、多服务整合计费的需求。\n相关服务:Azure Cognitive Services 提供了一个统一的资源类型(CognitiveServices),可以通过单一密钥和端点访问多个服务(如\nComputer Vision 和 Text Analytics)。\n选项逐一分析\nHTTP 方法:\nPATCH:错误。PATCH 方法用于更新现有资源的部分属性,而题目要求创建一个新资源,因此不适用。\nPOST:错误。POST 通常用于向服务器提交数据以创建子资源,但在 Azure REST API 中,创建顶级资源(如 Cognitive Services 账戶)\n通常使用 PUT。\nPUT:正确。PUT 方法用于创建或替换资源。在 Azure 中,创建新的 Cognitive Services 账戶时需要使用 PUT 方法。\n资源类型:\nCognitiveServices:正确。CognitiveServices 是 Azure 提供的统一资源类型,支持多种服务(如情感分析和 OCR),并满足单一密钥和\n端点访问的需求。\nComputerVision:错误。ComputerVision 是一个具体的服务类型,而题目要求支持多种服务,因此需要选择更通用的 CognitiveServices\n类型。\nTextAnalytics:错误。同样,TextAnalytics 是一个具体的服务类型,不符合题目要求的多服务支持。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:PUT, CognitiveServices\n官方答案\n官方答案:PUT, CognitiveServices\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:PUT 方法是 Azure REST API 中创建资源的标准方法,而 CognitiveServices 是支持多服务的统一资源类型,完全符合题目要\n求。","pageStart":261,"pageEnd":262,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-261.jpg","assets/pages/page-262.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"HTTP method","answer":"PUT","choices":["PATCH","POST","PUT"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Resource kind","answer":"CognitiveServices","choices":["CognitiveServices","ComputerVision","TextAnalytics"]}]},{"id":"q-114","number":114,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou are building a model to detect objects in images.\nThe performance of the model based on training data is shown in the following exhibit.\nUse the drop-down menus to select the answer choice that completes each statement based on the information presented in the graphic.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您正在构建一个用于检测图像中物体的模型。\n基于训练数据的模型性能显示在以下图表中。\n使用下拉菜单选择答案选项,以根据图表中提供的信息完成每个陈述。\n注意:每个正确选择值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:0","item2:25"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:该问题测试的是计算机视觉模型性能评估的基本概念,包括精度(Precision)、召回率(Recall)和相关指标的计算方法。\n具体概念:精度(Precision)表示预测为正的样本中实际为正的比例;召回率(Recall)表示实际为正的样本中被正确预测为正的比\n例;假阳性(False Positives)和假阴性(False Negatives)是模型性能评估中的重要指标。\n选项逐一分析\n选项1:The percentage of false positives is: 0\n分析:根据图中显示的精度(Precision)为100%,这意味着所有预测为正的样本均为实际正样本,因此没有假阳性(False\nPositives)。该选项正确。\n选项2:The value for the number of true positives divided by the total number of true positives and false negatives is: 25\n分析:召回率(Recall)为25%,其公式为:\nRecall = True Positives / (True Positives + False Negatives)。\n根据图中数据,召回率确实为25%,因此该选项正确。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:选项1:0;选项2:25。\n官方答案\n官方答案:选项1:0;选项2:25。\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:基于图中提供的精度和召回率数据,计算结果与官方答案相符,均正确。","pageStart":263,"pageEnd":264,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-263.jpg","assets/pages/page-264.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"False positives percentage","answer":"0","choices":["0","25","30","50","100"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Recall percentage","answer":"25","choices":["25","30","50","100"]}]},{"id":"q-115","number":115,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"multiple","questionEn":"You are developing an application that will use Azure AI Search for internal documents.\nYou need to implement document-level filtering for Azure AI Search.\nWhich three actions should you include in the solution? Each correct answer presents part of the solution.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"您正在开发一个应用程序,该应用程序将使用 Azure AI Search 来处理内部文档。\n您需要为 Azure AI Search 实现文档级过滤。\n您应该在解决方案中包含哪三项操作?每个正确答案都是解决方案的一部分。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Add allowed groups to each index entry","zh":"将允许的组添加到每个索引条目中"},{"id":"B","en":"Create one index per group.","zh":"为每个组创建一个索引。"},{"id":"C","en":"Send access tokens from Microsoft Entra ID, with the search request.","zh":"在搜索请求中发送来自 Microsoft Entra ID 的访问令牌。"},{"id":"D","en":"Retrieve all the groups.","zh":"检索所有组。"},{"id":"E","en":"Retrieve the group memberships of the user","zh":"检索用戶的组成员身份"},{"id":"F","en":"Supply the groups as a filter for the search requests","zh":"将组作为搜索请求的过滤条件提供"}],"answer":["A","E","F"],"analysis":"建议答案:AEF\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure AI Search 的文档级过滤功能,特别是如何结合用戶组权限来实现基于访问控制的搜索过滤。\n选项逐一分析\nA. Add allowed groups to each index entry\n正确。将允许访问的用戶组信息添加到索引条目中是实现文档级过滤的关键步骤。这使得搜索服务能够根据用戶组权限过滤结果。\nB. Create one index per group\n错误。为每个组创建单独的索引会导致管理复杂性增加,并且不符合 Azure AI Search 的最佳实践。正确的做法是使用单一索引并通\n过过滤机制实现权限控制。\nC. Send access tokens from Microsoft Entra ID, with the search request\n错误。虽然 Microsoft Entra ID(以前称为 Azure AD)可以用于身份验证,但直接发送访问令牌并不是实现文档级过滤的正确方法。过\n滤通常通过用戶组信息和索引中的元数据来完成。\nD. Retrieve all the groups\n错误。检索所有组并不直接与文档级过滤相关。正确的做法是检索特定用戶的组信息,而不是所有组。\nE. Retrieve the group memberships of the user\n正确。检索用戶所属的组是实现文档级过滤的必要步骤,因为需要知道用戶的组信息才能匹配索引中的权限数据。\nF. Supply the groups as a filter for the search requests\n正确。将用戶组信息作为过滤条件传递给搜索请求是实现文档级过滤的核心步骤。这确保了搜索结果仅包含用戶有权限访问的文\n档。\n推荐答案\n推荐答案:A, E, F\n官方答案\n官方答案:A, E, F\n比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:官方答案正确,因为 A、E 和 F 是实现 Azure AI Search 文档级过滤的必要步骤,符合技术实际情况。","pageStart":265,"pageEnd":266,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-265.jpg","assets/pages/page-266.jpg"]},{"id":"q-116","number":116,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"single","questionEn":"You have an Azure AI Search indexer that ingest PDF policy manuals.\nClient applications must display page-level citations that have bounding polygons for both text and images.\nYou need to add a single built-in multimodal content extraction skill to the Azure AI Search skillset. The solution must meet the following\nrequirements:\n• Provide text and image location metadata.\n• Extract tables that span multiple pages.\nWhat should you add?","questionZh":"您有一个 Azure AI Search 索引器,用于摄取 PDF 政策手册。\n客戶端应用程序必须显示⻚面级引用,并为文本和图像提供边界多边形。\n您需要向 Azure AI Search 技能集添加一个内置的多模态内容提取技能。解决方案必须满足以下要求:\n• 提供文本和图像位置元数据。\n• 提取跨多个⻚面的表格。\n您应该添加什么?","options":[{"id":"A","en":"Document Layout","zh":"文档布局"},{"id":"B","en":"Document Extraction","zh":"文档提取"},{"id":"C","en":"Azure Content Understanding","zh":"Azure 内容理解"},{"id":"D","en":"GenAI Prompt","zh":"生成式 AI 提示"}],"answer":["C"],"analysis":"官方答案：C\n答案核验\nPDF 第 267-268 页的 Correct Answer 标记为 C。\n对应选项：C. Azure 内容理解\n原文档中的 AI 推荐解析与 Correct Answer 存在冲突。本题按照 PDF 官方答案判分，不采用冲突的推荐答案。","pageStart":267,"pageEnd":268,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-267.jpg","assets/pages/page-268.jpg"]},{"id":"q-117","number":117,"topic":"Topic 1","caseId":null,"type":"visual","questionEn":"HOTSPOT\n-\nYou are creating an enrichment pipeline that will use Azure AI Search. The knowledge store contains unstructured JSON data and the text from\nscanned PDF documents.\nWhich projection type should you use for each data type? To answer, select the appropriate options in the answer area.\nNOTE: Each correct selection is worth one point.","questionZh":"热点\n-\n您正在创建一个将使用 Azure AI 搜索的增强管道。知识库包含非结构化的 JSON 数据和扫描 PDF 文档中的文本。\n对于每种数据类型,您应该使用哪种投影类型?要回答,请在答案区域中选择适当的选项。\n注意:每个正确选择都值一分。","options":[],"answer":["item1:Object projection","item2:File projection"],"analysis":"建议答案:\n知识点分析\n知识点:本题测试的是 Azure Cognitive Search 中的知识存储(Knowledge Store)功能,特别是如何选择合适的投影类型(Projection\nType)来处理不同类型的数据。\n知识存储允许用戶将索引数据投影到不同的格式(如文件、对象或表),以便进一步分析或集成到其他系统中。\n选项逐一分析\nJSON数据:\nFile projection:错误。文件投影用于将数据存储为文件格式(如PDF或文本文件),而JSON数据通常是结构化的,适合对象或表投\n影。\nObject projection:正确。对象投影适用于结构化数据(如JSON),可以将数据以对象形式存储,保留其层次结构和属性。\nTable projection:错误。表投影适用于将数据存储为关系表格式,但JSON数据通常是嵌套的,直接转换为表可能会丢失层次结构。\n提取的文本数据:\nFile projection:正确。提取的文本数据通常是非结构化的,适合存储为文件格式以便后续处理或分析。\nObject projection:错误。对象投影适用于结构化数据,而提取的文本数据通常是非结构化的,不适合对象投影。\nTable projection:错误。表投影适用于结构化数据,而提取的文本数据通常是非结构化的,不适合表投影。\n推荐答案\nJSON数据:Object projection\n提取的文本数据:File projection\n官方答案\n官方答案:Object projection(JSON数据),File projection(提取的文本数据)\n答案比较与验证\n比较结果:推荐答案与官方答案一致。\n验证理由:根据 Azure Cognitive Search 的文档,JSON数据适合对象投影以保留其结构化信息,而提取的文本数据适合文件投影以便\n存储为非结构化文件格式。","pageStart":269,"pageEnd":270,"sourceImages":["assets/pages/page-269.jpg","assets/pages/page-270.jpg"],"visualInputs":[{"id":"item1","label":"Unstructured JSON","answer":"Object projection","choices":["File projection","Object projection","Table projection"]},{"id":"item2","label":"Text from scanned PDFs","answer":"File projection","choices":["File projection","Object projection","Table projection"]}]}]};
